('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-13-star-confederate-flag-106265-42238140009','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/p/356/0001737_13-star-confederate-flag__94238.jpg','["13 Star Confederate Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140009&a=2893129&m=106265","The 13 Star Confederate flag was the official Civil War battle flag of the South and was in use from 1861-1865. The flag had 13 stars for the thirteen states in the Confederacy. This flag was first used in battle in December 1861. Legend states that because the pattern and colors of the Stars and Bars flag did not distinguish it sharply from the Stars and Stripes of the Union, it sometimes led to confusion on the battlefield. So it was decided to design a new flag for the Confederate States that"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-17th-century-italian-rapier-106265-42238139818','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/947/0013153_17th-century-italian-rapier__58940.jpg','["17th Century Italian Rapier","324.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139818&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 17th Century This is a beautifully executed rapier with a very complex hilt and faceted pommel. The grip is hand-wound with silver plated wire with woven wire rings top and bottom. The hand-forged, high carbon steel, fully tempered blade features a wide fuller to lighten and strengthen it for thrusting and the heavy ricasso provides extra strength to the main stress area. Top-quality, genuine leather scabbard with deeply engraved floral pattern on the throat and tip. This type of sword was"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-1800s-pair-of-brass-dice-106265-42238139900','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/442/0008234_1800s-pair-of-brass-dice__66804.jpg','["1800s Pair of Brass Dice","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139900&a=2893129&m=106265","Make your next game of chance really stand out with this hand made pair of dice. Solid brass with an antique finish and rounded corners. Each Overall: 1/2\" x 1/2\" x 1/2\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-1840-ames-nco-sword-106265-42238140208','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/942/0009859_1840-ames-nco-sword__83897.jpg','["1840 Ames NCO Sword","189.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140208&a=2893129&m=106265","The 1840 non commissioned sword was carried by American soldiers for over 70 years; a period which included the Mexican War, Civil War and Spanish American War. Copied from an Ames original. The left ricasso reads AMES MFG CO / CHICOPEE / MASS. The right ricasso reads US / DFM / 1863. The single edged blade has a single broad fuller running from the ricasso to near the point. The entire hilt is cast brass and the grip is ribbed. The pommel is global with a capstan. The grip is flanked by kidney-"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-1841-sappers-and-miners-sword-bayonet-replica-106265-42238139954','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/976/0009850_1841-sappers-and-miners-sword-bayonet-replica__95298.jpg','["1841 Sappers and Miners Sword Bayonet Replica","179.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139954&a=2893129&m=106265","This is the P-1841 Sappers and Miner''s Bayonet for use with the short Percussion (or Flintlock converted) Musket issued to Specialized troops. Fitted with a 22\" Sword blade but used additionally as a socket bayonet. This is one of the most impressive and important bayonets of the British Victorian era. Forged steel. 27-1/2\" overall."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-1860-heavy-cavalry-saber-106265-42238139963','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/445/0001098_1860-heavy-cavalry-saber__17895.jpg','["1860 Heavy Cavalry Saber","249.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139963&a=2893129&m=106265","At the outbreak of the American Civil War, there were two types of sabers issued to the Federal Cavalry - \"light\" and \"heavy\". The light version was popular, but the heavy model, dubbed the \"Old Wrist Breaker\" was the one worth owning, as it was a superior weapon. Its 36\" blade offered big reach advantages over most sabers, and its substantial weight gave it the leverage to easily crush bones and sever limbs with a single blow. The brass guard had three bars to protect the hand and the grip was "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-1860-light-cavalry-union-saber-106265-42238139753','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/935/0012346_1860-light-cavalry-union-saber__50332.jpg','["1860 Light Cavalry Union Saber","179.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139753&a=2893129&m=106265","Originally copied from an earlier French issue saber and manufactured in the North and in Europe for the lads in blue. It evokes the unflinching bravery of Antietam, Manassas, Gettysburg. Our excellent reproduction is hand made and ready for use. The hand forged blade of the M-1860 Light Cavalry Saber is British military spec steel that will flex over 20° and return to true. Leather handle is wire wrapped. Curving blade is superbly designed for penetration (thrust) and as a slashing weapon. A st"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-1907-bayonet-with-hooked-quillion-sheath-106265-42238139829','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/595/0001641_1907-bayonet-with-hooked-quillion-sheath__79416.jpg','["1907 Bayonet with Hooked Quillion & Sheath","129.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139829&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a reproduction SMLE No. 1, Mk III early style bayonet with scabbard. Originals are scarce; early in WWI quillions were officially removed. The blade, which includes British markings, is made from high carbon steel properly tempered for holding a razor edge. Sharpening is available for an additional fee. All metal has been deeply blued and the wood grips have a rubbed oil appearance. The sheath is made with a leather body and sewn seam up the back with a lozenge style frog. The top and ti"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-1917-royal-navy-sliding-magnifier-106265-42238139783','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/359/0009287_1917-royal-navy-sliding-magnifier__65479.jpg','["1917 Royal Navy Sliding Magnifier","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139783&a=2893129&m=106265","This solid brass magnifier telescopes from 8-1/2\" to 11\". Words on handle read \"Made For Royal Navy Sliding Magnifying 1917\". For over 70 years Windlass has been a trusted name in historically accurate replicas from the past including arms and armor. An ISO-9001:2015 certified company, they are a trusted source throughout the world. Windlass Nautical celebrates our nautical past by recreating historically significant sea going instruments in wonderful detail. We are able to capture the age-old s"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-19th-century-replica-surgery-kit-106265-42238139847','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/905/0013157_19th-century-replica-surgery-kit__77476.jpg','["19th Century Replica Surgery Kit","79.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139847&a=2893129&m=106265","The Civil War in the US pitted the North against the South in some of the most bloody fighting this country has ever endured. And this kit would have been designed for those bloody battlefields. Each piece in this kit is hand forged entirely in carbon steel and weathered to look as authentic as possible. The set includes eight tools, including one bone saw (does not have a cutting edge), one hinged clamp, hinged scissors, two bistoury knives (one large, one small), one pick-probe, and two hooked"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-1st-confederate-national-flag-106265-42238139890','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/973/0001738_1st-confederate-national-flag__55254.jpg','["1st Confederate National Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139890&a=2893129&m=106265","The first version of the First Confederate National Flag (1861 - 1863) was adopted but never officially enacted. In their haste to have a flag prepared for the flag raising ceremony on March 4, 1861, the Confederate Congress neglected to formally enact a flag law. The seven stars represent the seven Confederate States. This number jumped to eleven with the secession of Virginia, Arkansas, North Carolina and Tennessee, and finally to thirteen (in recognition of the symbolic admission of Kentucky "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-34-star-union-flag-106265-42238139901','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/707/0001739_34-star-union-flag__06642.jpg','["34 Star Union Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139901&a=2893129&m=106265","These national presentation colors were manufactured by the Evans & Hassall Company of Philadelphia for all the Union New Jersey regiments after 1863. Flag measures 3'' x 5''. It is double sided, made of indoor-outdoor Polyester and has metal grommets."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-5-in-1-survival-tool-106265-42238139849','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/270/0007198_5-in-1-survival-tool__77919.jpg','["5-in-1 Survival Tool","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139849&a=2893129&m=106265","This 5-in-1 Survival Tool features a compass, punch/glass breaker, flint, striker and whistle. The pen shape when screwed together makes it super easy to carry and the whistle is still accessible. Great for emergency kits and backpacking. Stainless steel construction."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-acc-field-knife-hammer-forged-finish-106265-42238140200','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/756/0008343_acc-field-knife-hammer-forged-finish__88692.jpg','["ACC Field Knife Hammer Forged Finish","74.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140200&a=2893129&m=106265","This Field Knife is handmade in the USA in our metal shop here in Conyers, GA. Our team hand selects the steels and hardwoods; they are beautiful, simple, efficient and practical. The 9cr14MoV stainless steel blade has a hammer forged finish and full profile tang with a 57RC. This knife is great at skinning and field chores. Features Bocote scales with white liners and thick stainless steel pins, solid brass finger guard and lanyard hole. Includes a leather belt sheath. Also available with Stone"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-acc-field-knife-stonewash-finish-106265-42238140171','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/i/574/0008346_acc-field-knife-stonewash-finish__55432.jpg','["ACC Field Knife Stonewash Finish","64.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140171&a=2893129&m=106265","This Field Knife is handmade in the USA in our metal shop here in Conyers, GA. Our team hand selects the steels and hardwoods; they are beautiful, simple, efficient and practical. The 9cr14MoV stainless steel blade has a stonewash finish and full profile tang with a 57RC. This knife is great at skinning and field chores. Features Bocote scales with white liners and thick stainless steel pins, solid brass finger guard and lanyard hole. Includes a leather belt sheath, a custom made Kydex sheath is"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-accusharp-world-s-fastest-sharpener-106265-42238139964','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/883/0012239_accusharp-worlds-fastest-sharpener__07323.jpg','["Accusharp World''s Fastest Sharpener","10.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139964&a=2893129&m=106265","The World''s Fastest Sharpener by Accusharp® makes anyone an instant expert because it''s pre-set to sharpen to the proper angle every time, lightning-fast. No more messy oils or stones! In about 10 seconds you can sharpen even serrated knives, cleavers, axes, machetes, scissors and other cutting tools. The large ergonomic handle fits in either hand safely and the full length finger guard protects all your fingers. The diamond honed Tungsten carbide sharpening blades will give a razor edge which c"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-adam-steel-wire-works-jailhouse-key-106265-42238140172','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/228/0008268_adam-steel-wire-works-jailhouse-key__01598.jpg','["Adam Steel & Wire Works Jailhouse Key","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140172&a=2893129&m=106265","This reproduction early 1900''s Adam Steel & Wire Works jailhouse key is brass. William J. Adam founded Adam Steel and Wire Works in Joliet, Illinois. In 1905 Folger Adam entered the business and the company focused on high-security equipment. In 1929, as Southern Steel, they introduced the 2700 mechanical continual motion locking system at Rikers Island Penitentiary, New York, the largest steel-constructed jail in the country. Approximately 5-1/8\" x 2-3/8\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-air-force-belt-106265-42238139799','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/453/0001241_air-force-belt__62915.jpg','["Air Force Belt","74.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139799&a=2893129&m=106265","This Air Force Belt is beautifully made. Silver color buckle with \"Hap\" Arnold design. One size, adjustable up to 52\". Width 1-3/4\"."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-alcatraz-guard-badge-106265-42238139850','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/648/0007124_alcatraz-guard-badge__60012.jpg','["Alcatraz Guard Badge","5.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139850&a=2893129&m=106265","This Alcatraz Guard Badge is a well-made replica from Americas past to complete your history collection. The metal badge is hand made and aged to be accurate to the originals with a heavy pin back for attaching to the thick clothing of the era. Each is properly dished and deeply stamped. Alcatraz Guard Key and Whistle also available. Approximately 2-1/2\" x 2-1/8\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-alcatraz-guard-key-and-whistle-106265-42238140101','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/226/0009386_alcatraz-guard-key-and-whistle__84180.jpg','["Alcatraz Guard Key and Whistle","18.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140101&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a hand aged, reproduction Alcatraz Guard Key and Whistle in solid brass and iron. Standard issue to guards during this penitentiary''s heyday, it includes a solid brass, functional whistle, iron key with chain and a brass tag which reads UNITED STATES PENITENTIARY ALCATRAZ ISLAND. No weapons were allowed on the floor of the Alcatraz cellhouse, so officers carried whistles to summon help in case of trouble. Whistle blasts also woke prisoners each morning, directed inmates to come to attent"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-alcatraz-hand-cuffs-106265-42238140056','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/657/0011258_alcatraz-hand-cuffs__75977.jpg','["Alcatraz Hand Cuffs","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140056&a=2893129&m=106265","These hand cuffs are made of iron and hand finished to highlight its patina and capture its age. This working cuff set has a brass plate marking it \"ALCATRAZ SAN FRANCISCO\". Very typical set of the era that kept some of the most notorious criminals in check. Includes 2 keys."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-all-damascus-commando-dagger-106265-42238140003','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/309/0012903_all-damascus-commando-dagger__52643.jpg','["All Damascus Commando Dagger","64.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140003&a=2893129&m=106265","This is one of the most attractive daggers we''ve seen in years. Every part of this dagger is crafted of legendary Damascus, from tip to pommel. It has a nicely proportioned with a classic commando design with a grooved handle to aid grip, an oval guard, and skull crusher pommel. Includes leather belt sheath. We recommend keeping a light coating of oil on this knife; high carbon steel is not rust-resistant. Cannot ship to CA, MA, or NJ"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-american-revolution-saber-106265-42238139945','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/750/0011513_american-revolution-saber__62895.jpg','["American Revolution Saber","189.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139945&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 1775 The American Colonists were, like most of Europe, amorous of the dashing French Hussar. The handmade hilt of this American saber reflects their admiration of the 1700s French style. This well-balanced, fast sword was designed for the mounted fighter. Solid steel hilt with spiral pattern carved hardwood grip is married to an effective 1085 high carbon, well-tempered blade. Comes with a black leather scabbard with steel mounts. Arrives sharpened from the factory. This attractive sword c"]'),
