('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-arab-scimitar-gold-106265-42238140064','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/823/0013601_arab-scimitar-gold__81805.jpg','["Arab Scimitar Gold","494.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140064&a=2893129&m=106265","Intricate etch-work patterns dress this cutlass which is of 420 stainless steel and mirror polished. Forged with Martos world-renown quality, the Arabic cutlass is a worthy and popular addition to any sword enthusiasts collection. Note: Decorative use only. Intended for wall decor, displays, home or office decor or for costume. Price includes international shipping."]'),
