('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-axe-of-the-crusades-106265-42238139795','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/824/0012221_axe-of-the-crusades__37247.jpg','["Axe of the Crusades","169.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139795&a=2893129&m=106265","This stout weapon features a large, sharpened blade pierced with a cross. The blade is riveted to the hardwood shaft and has langets for extra support. The grip has been smoothed and wrapped with smooth black leather. All metal parts have been blackened, including the hanging rings at the bottom. Made by the master smiths of Windlass Steelcrafts. Includes leather axe head sheath. This was a formidable sidearm used by medieval knights, especially during the crusades."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-barbershop-razor-with-laminated-wood-grip-106265-42238140102','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/005/0002252_barbershop-razor-with-laminated-wood-grip__98390.jpg','["Barbershop Razor with Laminated Wood Grip","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140102&a=2893129&m=106265","This throwback old fashioned folding razor has a stainless steel blade and laminated hardwood grip. Overall: 9-3/4\" Blade: 2-3/4\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-battlecry-bosworth-longsword-106265-42238139828','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/128/0011433_battlecry-bosworth-longsword__34308.jpg','["Battlecry Bosworth Longsword","374.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139828&a=2893129&m=106265","This medieval Bosworth Longsword is from Windlass Steelcrafts'' Battlecry collection. Designed specifically to be used and made from 1065 high carbon steel with a darkened, battle-hardened finish, extra wide tang and tempering to a low 50s RC. This pre-sharpened blade has gone through rigorous testing. The hands-on nature of the manufacturing by master smiths makes this line unique. Includes a belt frog, matching scabbard with belt stop, custom packaging and certificate of authenticity signed by "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-battlecry-maldon-viking-seax-106265-42238139794','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/295/0000444_battlecry-maldon-viking-seax__54016.jpg','["Battlecry Maldon Viking Seax","189.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139794&a=2893129&m=106265","The variety of different historical knives and daggers is immense. Yet many can be traced back in some part to only a handful of proven designs. One of the most practical and functional is one thats not widely known, the Viking Sax. As both a serviceable tool and deadly weapon this is the little brother to its better known larger sibling, the Viking sword. Whether hidden behind a shield, worn on the belt, or left upright free-standing in a wooden block or sticking in the railing and posts of a "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-battlecry-maldon-viking-sword-106265-42238139806','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/360/0001153_battlecry-maldon-viking-sword__30784.jpg','["Battlecry Maldon Viking Sword","349.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139806&a=2893129&m=106265","The Maldon Viking sword from Windlass Steelcrafts Battlecry collection is a light, agile and resilient fighting blade that captures nearly everything that made this style a formidable and near legendary design. Created to deal with shields, mail, and thick fur or leather armor, it was more than a match for any hand-weapon of its day. Its semi-rounded point was capable of forcefully biting into targets without snagging or catching, while its well-honed edge, neither too wide nor too narrow, enabl"]'),
