('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-betsy-ross-flag-106265-42238139881','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/437/0001745_betsy-ross-flag__42273.jpg','["Betsy Ross Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139881&a=2893129&m=106265","According to legend, Betsy Ross created the first official American flag in the spring of 1776. This flag measures 3'' x 5'' and is double sided with 2 metal grommets."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-bird-trout-neck-knife-106265-42238140010','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/p/779/0015712_bird-trout-neck-knife__35820.jpg','["Bird & Trout Neck Knife","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140010&a=2893129&m=106265","The Bird & Trout Knife is a modern version of a 100 year old classic, treasured by hunters and fishermen for generations. The secret to its enduring popularity is its ultra slim profile and unique all steel construction. The skeletonized handle offers great versatility and freedom of movement. It''s perfect for working in tight places or making precise cuts. The ring allows the knife to hang from the little finger when not in use and yet remain instantly available. The Bird & Trout is made out of"]'),
