('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-bobby-whistle-106265-42238139974','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/221/0009561_bobby-whistle__17106.jpg','["Bobby Whistle","6.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139974&a=2893129&m=106265","This all metal whistle is a fully functional replica of the WWII issued British Bobby whistle. It is engraved with \"METROPOLITAN POLICE, LONDON 1942\". Overall: 3-1/2\" long"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-boker-plus-training-knife-set-106265-42238140069','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/808/0002244_boker-plus-training-knife-set__75611.jpg','["Boker Plus Training Knife Set","27.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140069&a=2893129&m=106265","These Boker Plus Training Knives closely resemble the size and weight of the famous Applegate-Fairbairn fighting knife which has been so effective for years as a personal defensive and offensive tool for our soldiers. Practice safely with these thermoplastic elastomer knives. They hold up under extreme training and weather conditions. There are no sharp edges, but you''d swear your holding the real thing. Includes 2 knives for proper training with a partner. Key Measurements: Overall: 11-1/2\" Bla"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-bone-scales-small-106265-42238139745','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/851/0011958_bone-scales-small__62860.jpg','["Bone Scales - Small","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139745&a=2893129&m=106265","This set of small bone scales are a great addition to any custom knife project. The genuine bone scales polish up with unique patterns and patinas. Note: due to the naturally occurring nature of bone there can be irregular striations and they can show cracking if excessive pressure is applied. Low qty. Scale Size: Approximately 4\" x 1\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-boy-scout-pocket-coin-106265-42238139779','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/514/0008759_boy-scout-pocket-coin__65626.jpg','["Boy Scout Pocket Coin","4.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139779&a=2893129&m=106265","This Boy Scout Pocket Coin is a cool historical collectible and a constant reminder that brings out our best. Originally used in the early to mid-1900''s as a reminder for Scouts to help others in need, our version is made of solid metal with an antique brass finish. Do a good turn daily is a motto we could all use today and when your good deed is accomplished move the little token from the left pocket to your right! 1-1/2 round."]'),
