('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-brown-leather-flying-cap-106265-42238140001','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/850/0012708_brown-leather-flying-cap__07254.jpg','["Brown Leather Flying Cap","56.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140001&a=2893129&m=106265","This WWI Flying Ace Leather Cap is a must for any aviation enthusiast! Worn by barnstormers, pilots of WWI, and not to mention a certain popular cartoon dog, this brown cowhide leather flying cap recalls the spirit of adventure from a bygone era. Its also a staple of steampunk fashion. Authentic in every detail, features an adjustable chin strap with brass buckle. Goggles available separately. Available in sizes S/M or L/XL."]'),
