('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-c-96-wood-buttstock-holster-set-106265-42238139815','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/334/C-96_Wood_Buttstock_Holster_Set_803408_h__24302.jpg','["C-96 Wood Buttstock Holster Set","179.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139815&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a high quality, hand-crafted wood butt stock holster with a leather belt harness and cleaning rod. It works with all model Mauser C-96 Broomhandle, Bolo, etc. with 10 round magazines. The wood holster has a satin sheen finish that could pass for hand-rubbed. All metal is deeply blued, while the leather is a beautiful warm satin brown color stitched with waxed linen thread. The metal hardware is bright finished. Cleaning rod can be used with 6\" barrels, 1?4\" diameter and can be used with "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-calico-jack-pirate-flag-106265-42238139979','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/323/0001741_calico-jack-pirate-flag__88433.jpg','["Calico Jack Pirate Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139979&a=2893129&m=106265","This is the standard of pirate John Rackham, also known as the infamous Calico Jack. His nickname came from the inexpensive, brightly colored clothes he was fond of wearing. He was also fond of keeping female crew members aboard! Rackham''s flag differs from others in that instead of bones it features large crossed cutlasses. Made of indoor/outdoor Polyester, this double sided flag measures 3'' x 5'' with metal grommets."]'),
