('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-camper-high-carbon-steel-blade-106265-42238139768','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/372/0000083_camper-high-carbon-steel-blade__52690.jpg','["Camper High Carbon Steel Blade","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139768&a=2893129&m=106265","This camper blade is made with 1085 high carbon steel which has been hand-forged and tempered to approximately 50 RC. Features 5 pre-drilled holes for rivets or screws and a lanyard hole. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Key Measurements: Overall: 8-3/4\" Blade: 5\" x 1\" x 1/8\" Wt: 4 oz Can be personalized with 3 Initials. Click here for details on our personalization service and return policy."]'),
