('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-cane-chopper-machete-106265-42238139747','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/536/0012959_cane-chopper-machete__87311.jpg','["Cane Chopper Machete","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139747&a=2893129&m=106265","This \"compact\" machete from Tata Agrico is perfect for clearing vegetation in tight spaces. The square blade tip means it''s highly suitable for trail carry and camping (no accidental punctures). The super-thin blade, only 1/32\", is excellent for penetration and slice through. The full tang, stainless steel blade is sharpened to a keen edge and the sturdy hardwood handle is a meaty 3/4\" thick. Includes a mold and mildew resistant nylon sheath with belt loop. Overall: 20-5/8\" long Blade: 14-7/8\" l"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-canvas-first-aid-kit-106265-42238140149','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/x/690/0012466_canvas-first-aid-kit__59266.jpg','["Canvas First Aid Kit","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140149&a=2893129&m=106265","This military-inspired first aid kit is housed in a soft canvas pouch with a nylon zipper and belt loop. Compact enough to fit in a glove box or purse or carry on your belt. Handy for outings with the kids, over-40 baseball leagues (not as handy as an ambulance, but that''s way more expensive), all your outdoor activities, and more. Heavyweight canvas belt pouch measures 4-1/4\" x 3\" x 1-3/4\". Includes Steripad, adhesive tape, bandages, alcohol prep pads, towelettes, sugar, soap, and aspirin."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-captains-cups-with-storage-box-106265-42238139820','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/863/0001990_captains-cups-with-storage-box__89938.jpg','["Captains Cups with Storage Box","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139820&a=2893129&m=106265","Salute your next voyage with this elegant set of 2 sailor''s cups. Made of spun brass and plated in silver, theyre safe for your next rum toast! Brazed onto each cup is a copper anchor for added nautical flare. Includes a beautiful hardwood storage box with brass accents. Each cup is sized similar to a shot glass. A great item from Windlass Nautrical to take on your next voyage. Hand Wash. Box measures 2-1/4\" x 2-1/4\" x 4-1/4\" Cup height 1-7/8\" Capacity: 1 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-cast-iron-ford-mini-anvil-106265-42238140111','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/375/0011074_cast-iron-ford-mini-anvil__91678.jpg','["Cast Iron Ford Mini Anvil","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140111&a=2893129&m=106265","This beautifully cast iron anvil really captures the blue collar spirit of America''s industrious past which helped shape our present. This miniature iron Ford anvil has the classic Ford script and date of 1920 cast in it which commemorates the year Henry Ford bought out all minority stockholders for sole ownership. Overall: 2-1/2\" tall, 4-1/2\" long, 1-3/4\" thick at the base Weight: 1-1/2 pounds"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-cast-iron-john-deere-mini-anvil-106265-42238139993','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/175/0011079_cast-iron-john-deere-mini-anvil__91868.jpg','["Cast Iron John Deere Mini Anvil","15.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139993&a=2893129&m=106265","This beautifully cast iron anvil really captures the blue collar spirit of America''s industrious past which helped shape our present. This miniature iron John Deere anvil has the John Deere name and date of 1937 cast in it which commemorates the 100 year anniversary of this American icon. Overall: 2-1/2\" tall, 4-1/2\" long, 1-3/4\" thick at the base Weight: 1-1/2 pounds"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-chopping-axe-106265-42238140063','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/x/574/0012877_chopping-axe__48419.jpg','["Chopping Axe","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140063&a=2893129&m=106265","This Chopping Axe from Python has a drop forged 1055 high carbon steel thin blade suited for cutting down trees and chopping. Features an American hardwood handle with a plastic sleeve for an extra-secure head. Axe head weighs 4 lbs. Overall: 36\" long Axe face: 8\" long with 4-1/4\" cutting edge Wt: 4 lb / 8 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-civil-war-era-knapsack-106265-42238140201','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/052/0000662_civil-war-era-knapsack__30570.jpg','["Civil War Era Knapsack","79.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140201&a=2893129&m=106265","This 19th century era knapsack is a great reproduction of the large waterproof knapsacks carried by Civil War troops. Our faithful replica is made of tarred canvas with leather straps just like the originals and has 2 main compartments, 13\" x 17\" and 12-1/2\" x 15\", so there is lots of storage."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-civil-war-fireman-s-shirt-106265-42238140139','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/707/0000253_civil-war-firemans-shirt__09075.jpg','["Civil War Fireman''s Shirt","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140139&a=2893129&m=106265","Civil War Fireman''s Shirt is a 100% cotton, replica bib shirt with faux bone buttons as used by not only fire brigades, but also some of the Irish brigade and artillery gunners. Click here for Size Chart"]'),
