('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-condor-engineer-bolo-machete-106265-42238140091','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/031/0011902_condor-engineer-bolo-machete__27951.jpg','["Condor Engineer Bolo Machete","97.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140091&a=2893129&m=106265","The Condor Engineer Bolo Machete has a 1075 high carbon steel blade with thick full profile tang which has been hand forged and hand sharpened to a razor edge. This beast is a Corps of Engineers'' choice for clearing the heavy stuff. Saplings and small trees don''t stand a chance. We even split armor with it! Includes handmade leather belt sheath. Scales are stained walnut with genuine brass rivets and lanyard hole. If you need to take down anything large, this will be your bolo/machete for years "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-condor-viking-machete-106265-42238140031','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/135/0011904_condor-viking-machete__07966.jpg','["Condor Viking Machete","102.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140031&a=2893129&m=106265","This massive chopper is modeled after some blades excavated in Northern Europe. It is an amazing chopper and brush clearer. The heavy ended blade provides momentum for a deep cut every time. Yet, not so heavy that you can''t swing it for a while or carry it into the brush for days on end. Made of hand-finished and forged 1075 high carbon steel with satin blasted finish. The full profile tang is very strong and features walnut slabs for a good grip. Go berserker on your next trek. Includes handmad"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-confederate-2nd-pattern-kepi-106265-42238140173','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/641/0000208_confederate-2nd-pattern-kepi__19460.jpg','["Confederate 2nd Pattern Kepi","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140173&a=2893129&m=106265","These exacting replicas are based directly from the second pattern issued to Confederate Regulars. Each color designated a specific division and could be seen easily on a battle field. Based on the French-style it was one of the most common patterns of the military for years. All are 100% wool with leather visor just like the originals. Each is fully lined and has brass hardware. Choose M, L or XL and branch of service: Infantry - Blue, Cavalry - Yellow, Artillery - Red,"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-confederate-2nd-pattern-kepi-106265-42238140174','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/641/0000208_confederate-2nd-pattern-kepi__19460.jpg','["Confederate 2nd Pattern Kepi","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140174&a=2893129&m=106265","These exacting replicas are based directly from the second pattern issued to Confederate Regulars. Each color designated a specific division and could be seen easily on a battle field. Based on the French-style it was one of the most common patterns of the military for years. All are 100% wool with leather visor just like the originals. Each is fully lined and has brass hardware. Choose M, L or XL and branch of service: Infantry - Blue, Cavalry - Yellow, Artillery - Red,"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-confederate-cavalry-officer-s-saber-106265-42238139802','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/034/0012233_confederate-cavalry-officers-saber__36850.jpg','["Confederate Cavalry Officer''s Saber","199.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139802&a=2893129&m=106265","This authentic, hand made replica is hand forged and fully tempered of 1095 high carbon steel, coupled with original handle and sheath materials to ensure it performs exactly as the original did. Features a flexible, ornate blade and leather grip wrapped with brass wire. It is just like the old one carried by General Jo Shelby, the Missouri cavalry raider who never surrendered his command. This fine sword has \"C.S.A.\" crisply acid etched on the hand-forged blade. \"C.S.\" is cast into the guard wi"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-confederate-cavalry-saber-106265-42238139851','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/715/0000999_confederate-cavalry-saber__45437.jpg','["Confederate Cavalry Saber","179.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139851&a=2893129&m=106265","Of all the Confederate swords and sabers, this was the one used most. Wielded by the troops under the command of J.E.B. Stuart, Wade Hampton and Nathan Bedford Forrest, this sword dispatched hordes of Yankee soldiers. This is a very distinctive saber with a brass guard similar to that of an 1860 Light Cavalry Saber (which itself was a copy of an earlier French saber). This authentic, hand made replica has a flexible, ornate blade and leather grip wrapped with brass wire. The blade has the classi"]'),
