('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-confederate-kepi-106265-42238140141','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/593/0000205_confederate-kepi__22467.jpg','["Confederate Kepi","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140141&a=2893129&m=106265","These exacting replicas are based directly from the first pattern issued to Confederate Regulars. Each color designated a specific division and could be seen easily on a battle field. Based on the French style, it was the most common pattern of the military for decades. All are 100% wool with leather visor just like the originals. Each is fully lined and has brass hardware. Choose M, L or XL and branch of service: blue band for infantry, yellow band for cavalry or red band for artillery."]'),
