('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-confederate-staff-field-officer-s-sword-106265-42238139838','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/l/964/0015269_confederate-staff-field-officers-sword__61482.jpg','["Confederate Staff & Field Officer''s Sword","199.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139838&a=2893129&m=106265","This authentic, hand made replica is hand forged and fully tempered of 1095 high carbon steel. Coupled with original handle and sheath materials to ensure it performs exactly as the originals did. Flexible, ornate blade and leather grip wrapped with brass wire. This faithful reproduction of the Boyle, Gamble, and McFee sword is a beauty! The blade etching is even more detailed than on the old ones, with the heroic \"C.S.A.\", cannon and battle flag all well done. The brass fittings are beautifully"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-confederate-sword-belt-106265-42238139739','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/l/140/0012230_confederate-sword-belt__73904.jpg','["Confederate Sword Belt","69.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139739&a=2893129&m=106265","This authentic leather sword belt has two straps that attach to your sword scabbard''s rings. The belt has brass hardware and adjusts to fit sizes 37 to 42\" waist. You can punch holes for a smaller waist. The square brass buckle has the letters \"CS\" on a coarse field. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts®. Union Sword Belt also available."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-confederate-vest-106265-42238140164','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/027/0000262_confederate-vest__77661.jpg','["Confederate Vest","54.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140164&a=2893129&m=106265","This authentic Civil War vest is authentically patterned, high quality clothing. Perfect for collectors, history buffs and re-enactors who want durable, well-made, accurate copies from a critical time in our nations history. 100% richly dyed wool front with cotton back and lining. CSA metal buttons. Choose size 40, 42, 44, 46, 48, 50. Click here for size chart"]'),
