('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-cougar-neck-knife-106265-42238140072','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/873/0011538_cougar-neck-knife__33356.jpg','["Cougar Neck Knife","8.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140072&a=2893129&m=106265","Light and effective, this Lynx neck knife is the perfect companion and back-up knife. Cats claws are always ready to defend. Features strong, full profile tang construction of 400 series stainless steel. Nylon cord wrap. Tough plastic molded sheath with boot clip for multiple carry options. Puma Neck Knife also available. Overall: 6-7/8 Blade: 2-7/8\" View more products from Master Cutlery"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-crossed-guns-lock-106265-42238139991','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/568/0009495_crossed-guns-lock__04724.jpg','["Crossed Guns Lock","32.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139991&a=2893129&m=106265","This functional Crossed Guns Lock is solid brass and iron which has been hand aged to look like it was used in the Old West. This is a great collector item of a day gone by and great to secure lock boxes, firearms, etc. We can picture this doing yeoman''s work during the Civil War far into the Industrial Revolution. Working lock includes 2 keys. Approximately 3-1/2\" x 2-1/4\" x 1\" thick"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-crusader-shield-triple-layered-face-mask-106265-42238140008','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/845/0013927_crusader-shield-triple-layered-face-mask__61977.jpg','["Crusader Shield Triple Layered Face Mask","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140008&a=2893129&m=106265","This Crusader Shield face mask is lightweight, breathable, and stylishly designed with everyday work in mind. Made of 100% cotton with silk thread embroidery, it is multi-layered and has a sleeve so you can slide an additional disposable filter into the pocket if desired. The one size fits all construction, combined with adjustable elastic straps behind each ear, provides a snug fit. It even fits well over beards! Machine washable. Note: These masks are not graded for medical use."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-crusader-trinket-box-106265-42238140119','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/065/0012018_crusader-trinket-box__20522.jpg','["CRUSADER TRINKET BOX","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140119&a=2893129&m=106265","This miniature treasure box is rich in detail. Made of a durable resin, this exquisite piece has been metalized with an antique bronze finished and accented with red and blue painted jewels. Measures 3-7/8\" x 2-1/4\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-custom-damascus-kukri-106265-42238140110','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/574/0011039_custom-damascus-kukri__90065.jpg','["Custom Damascus Kukri","79.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140110&a=2893129&m=106265","This stunning kukri has custom touches all around. Wave after wave of beautiful Damascus steel is folded into a supremely functional, full tang kukri blade. The handle is light and dark stained olive wood with steel and brass spacers. Hand jimping on all major parts accented with brass pins, even the nut on the pommel has artistic cut outs blending it into the artful design. The small utility knives are also Damascus and have wood handles. Includes leather belt sheath. Overall: 18-1/4\" Blade: 10"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-d-guard-bowie-knife-106265-42238139743','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/150/0012354_d-guard-bowie-knife__89056.jpg','["D-Guard Bowie Knife","149.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139743&a=2893129&m=106265","Popular in the Confederacy during the Civil War for its all-purpose capabilities, the D-Guard Bowie chopped branches, split logs, sliced saplings and even had its way with a Yankee or two. A soldier on the move learned to travel light, so a handmade Bowie was often treasured as a backup weapon when the entire cavalry were \"under the guns.\" The steel guard on our D Guard Bowie can withstand punishment and the massive, high carbon steel blade holds an edge well. Re-enactors use it to dig cannon em"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-damascus-barbershop-razor-with-camel-bone-scales-106265-42238140011','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/247/0007267_damascus-barbershop-razor-with-camel-bone-scales__22117.jpg','["Damascus Barbershop Razor with Camel Bone Scales","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140011&a=2893129&m=106265","This Straight Edge Barbershop Razor has a real Damascus Steel blade and Camel Bone scales. One of the most beautiful we''ve ever offered, it is razor sharp and handsomely fitted to hand made handles featuring mosaic rivets and extensive file work designs on the brass liners. Truly fit for a gentleman of means."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-damascus-barbershop-razor-with-horn-scales-106265-42238140041','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/191/0007263_damascus-barbershop-razor-with-horn-scales__78294.jpg','["Damascus Barbershop Razor with Horn Scales","32.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140041&a=2893129&m=106265","This Straight Edge Barbershop Razor has a real Damascus Steel blade and Water Buffalo Horn scales. One of the most beautiful we''ve ever offered, it is razor sharp and handsomely fitted to hand made handles featuring mosaic rivets and extensive file work designs on the brass liners. Truly fit for a gentleman of means."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-damascus-frontier-stag-handle-hunter-106265-42238139867','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/567/0007188_damascus-frontier-stag-handle-hunter__95675.jpg','["Damascus Frontier Stag Handle Hunter","87.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139867&a=2893129&m=106265","Damascus, check. Functional, check. Handsome, check. This Frontier Stag Handle Hunting Knife has a hand forged blade with decorative file work along the spine and solid brass finger guard and pommel. A star nut adorns the pommel for a bit of western flare. Bone, brass and micarta spacers fit to a genuine stag handle. A stunner in almost any collection. Includes leather belt sheath."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-damascus-hand-axe-106265-42238140126','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/131/0007634_damascus-hand-axe__46840.jpg','["Damascus Hand Axe","48.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140126&a=2893129&m=106265","This Damascus Hand Axe is a custom piece if we''ve ever seen one! Layered carbon steel with varying depth etch for a truly unique pattern design. Wood and genuine horn scales with brass rivets, mosaic copper rivet and brass spacers. File jimping on the spine. Includes leather belt sheath."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-damascus-sgian-dubh-raider-knife-106265-42238139882','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/769/0000373_damascus-raider-knife__10806.jpg','["Damascus Sgian Dubh Raider Knife","74.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139882&a=2893129&m=106265","This Sgian Dubh Raider Knife is truly one of the most elegant Damascus daggers we have offered. This stunning piece has a wide, high carbon Damascus blade and is complimented with a polished hardwood grip, which fits perfectly in your hand. The dagger has been expertly adorned with silver and brass filigree work, decorated with fine brass-headed nails and capped with an antique brass pommel cap. Includes brown leather scabbard with belt loop."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-damascus-short-sword-106265-42238139957','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/687/0011053_damascus-short-sword__21168.jpg','["Damascus Short Sword","114.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139957&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a medieval style short sword we can picture with a knight or Viking of old....any warrior would have been proud to own it. The deeply etched and attractive double edged Damascus steel blade slashes and penetrates your target with ease. Handle is stunning with its blonde wood stain and real bone. Spacers are black and brass with horn. Steel pommel. Includes brown leather scabbard with black accents. Overall: 24\" Blade: 18\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-damascus-talon-106265-42238139975','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/693/0011058_damascus-talon__38925.jpg','["Damascus Talon","84.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139975&a=2893129&m=106265","Dagger or short sword, by either name this is still one wicked blade. The deeply etched pattern in the Damascus steel is magnificent to behold. Full profile tang. The handle scales are darkly stained wood and genuine bone with brass pins and spacers. Includes leather belt sheath. Overall: 22-1/4\" Blade: 14-1/4\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-deer-antler-obsidian-blade-knife-106265-42238139875','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/663/0012124_deer-antler-obsidian-blade-knife__11878.jpg','["Deer Antler Obsidian Blade Knife","74.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139875&a=2893129&m=106265","This knife is handmade by master artist Dale Duby using the methods of old; grinding, abrading, percussion and pressure flaking. Each knife is one of a kind. Blades are attached using sinew. Comes with Certificate of Authenticity signed by the artist. Size approximately 7-1/2\" overall. Includes hand carved stand. Please note: This is not an authentic Indian made product. read more..... View more Dale Duby products Each of these knives is handcrafted of naturally occurring materials, with as litt"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-deer-leg-bone-obsidian-knife-106265-42238139869','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/380/0010688_deer-leg-bone-obsidian-knife__10817.jpg','["Deer Leg Bone Obsidian Knife","69.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139869&a=2893129&m=106265","This Natural Deer Leg Bone Obsidian Blade Knife is handmade by master artist Dale Duby using the methods of old; grinding, abrading, percussion and pressure flaking. Each knife has a leather thong, antiqued leather wrap and is one of a kind. Each of these knives is handcrafted of naturally occurring materials, with as little alteration as possible to preserve its natural beauty. Each handle is minimally worked to save most of its original shape, so color, grain, and shape will vary from the knif"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-deschaux-rapier-106265-42238139748','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/462/0013985_deschaux-rapier__61789.jpg','["Deschaux Rapier","349.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139748&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 1590 With its graceful, artistic lines, the rapier has always been a romantic symbol of the Renaissance. The reality is that the rapier is a very deadly hand-to-hand combat weapon, perfectly suited for the swift moves of the duelists of the day. Many hilt forms were tried early on like this three-ringed swept hilt. The bone grip is wire wrapping, making for a very secure grip. This is a light, fast and deadly sword with a classical design. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Includes scabbard. N"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-desk-magnifier-106265-42238139821','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/518/0009283_desk-magnifier__69666.jpg','["Desk Magnifier","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139821&a=2893129&m=106265","This elegant desk accessory makes a classy statement and aids in navigational charts and map reading. Hardwood base with solid brass plate reading \"Watts & Sons Ltd. Opticians London 1814\". Approximately 10\" extended."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-display-crusader-axe-106265-42238140094','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/801/Display_Crusader_Ax_601081_h_new__72943.jpg','["\"Display\" Crusader Axe","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140094&a=2893129&m=106265","This Crusader style axe has a hand forged blade and a tough hardwood handle; it has all the heft and feel of a working axe, but has a blunt edge so you can safely display it without worrying about curious little fingers touching it in the wrong place. In other words, this is a display axe that''s made like a real one, not like the cheap display axes on the market that have pot metal blades. Comes with leather belt frog. Perfect for display OR realistic cosplay."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-display-viking-war-axe-106265-42238140035','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/864/0012279_display-viking-war-axe__15328.jpg','["\"Display\" Viking War Axe","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140035&a=2893129&m=106265","This Viking style axe has a hand forged blade and a tough hardwood handle; it has all the heft and feel of a working axe, but has a blunt edge so you can safely display it without worrying about curious little fingers touching it in the wrong place. In other words, this is a display axe that''s made like a real one, not like the cheap display axes on the market that have pot metal blades. Perfect for display OR realistic cosplay."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-don-t-tread-on-me-gadsden-flag-106265-42238139947','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/662/0001740_dont-tread-on-me-gadsden-flag__45960.jpg','["Don''t Tread On Me Gadsden Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139947&a=2893129&m=106265","Also known as Gadsden Flag, the image of a coiled rattlesnake was first used in 1750s prior to the American Revolution. This was a popular flag with the South during American Civil War and continues to be popular with some political groups. Flag measures 3'' x 5''. It is made of indoor-outdoor Polyester and has metal grommets."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-double-agent-ii-neck-knife-106265-42238140042','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/511/0002220_double-agent-ii-neck-knife__58089.jpg','["Double Agent II Neck Knife","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140042&a=2893129&m=106265","Cold Steel''s Double Agent® neck knife, designed by Zach Whitson, is thin, flat and super light; a little over 3 ounces including the Secure-Ex® neck sheath. This makes it easy to conceal and very comfortable to wear. The most notable feature, however, is the double ring handle design. Slip an index finger through the front ring nearest the blade and your pinkie finger through the rear ring and close your fist to obtain a forward grip and vice versa for a reverse grip. It doesn''t matter how hard "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-double-agent-ii-neck-knife-serrated-106265-42238139982','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/612/0002223_double-agent-ii-neck-knife-serrated__85370.jpg','["Double Agent II Neck Knife - Serrated","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139982&a=2893129&m=106265","Cold Steel''s Double Agent® neck knife, designed by Zach Whitson, is thin, flat and super light; a little over 3 ounces including the Secure-Ex® neck sheath. This makes it easy to conceal and very comfortable to wear. The most notable feature, however, is the double ring handle design. Slip an index finger through the front ring nearest the blade and your pinkie finger through the rear ring and close your fist to obtain a forward grip and vice versa for a reverse grip. It doesn''t matter how hard "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-downhome-hunter-knife-106265-42238139948','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/175/0000319_downhome-hunter-knife__97179.jpg','["Downhome Hunter Knife","21.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139948&a=2893129&m=106265","Ever wish you had a knife that you didnt have much money in and could just beat it up in the field and not really care too much if it was banged around in the process? You know, just use to pry or chop? Well, this could just be it. This knife is ground from a high carbon file with a good angle grind for easy resharpening. The scales on the full profile tang are Dymondwood. Comes with leather frontier style, fold-over scabbard that swallows most of the knife, making it very difficult to lose. Ov"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-dragon-piercer-damascus-fantasy-sword-106265-42238140092','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/889/0012261_dragon-piercer-damascus-fantasy-sword__63592.jpg','["Dragon Piercer Damascus Fantasy Sword","129.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140092&a=2893129&m=106265","If you ever encounter a dragon with an extra tough hide, here''s the right weapon to send it yelping back into its cave. This medieval-style fantasy sword is completely made of Damascus steel-the blade, the guard, even the pommel. The grip is highly imagined as well; alternating strands of steel, brass, and red wire create a showy, exquisitely detailed hilt that begs for attention even when it''s in the scabbard. Make no mistake, however, this is a real sword with a sharp edge. Includes leather sc"]')
) AS src(slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url, payload)) AS parsed
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, price=EXCLUDED.price, currency=EXCLUDED.currency,
  brand=EXCLUDED.brand, merchant=EXCLUDED.merchant, category=EXCLUDED.category, department=EXCLUDED.department,
  product_type=EXCLUDED.product_type, image_url=EXCLUDED.image_url, affiliate_url=EXCLUDED.affiliate_url,
  description=EXCLUDED.description, source_data=EXCLUDED.source_data;
INSERT INTO awin_catalog_products
  (slug, name, price, currency, brand, merchant, category, department, product_type, image_url, affiliate_url, description, source_data)
SELECT slug, data->>'product_name', (data->>'search_price')::numeric, data->>'currency', brand,
  data->>'merchant_name', data->>'category_name', department, product_type, image_url,
  data->>'aw_deep_link', data->>'description', data
FROM (SELECT slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url,
  to_jsonb(jsonb_object(ARRAY['product_name','search_price','currency','merchant_name','category_name','aw_deep_link','description'], ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(payload::jsonb)))) AS data FROM (VALUES
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-dragon-short-sword-106265-42238140090','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/197/0011867_dragon-short-sword__98299.jpg','["Dragon Short Sword","294.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140090&a=2893129&m=106265","Slightly different than your normal wakizashi, this stunning sword is one of our favorites. In fact, many of our staff own this beauty. And that says a lot with all the different swords we see and handle. The detailed parts are exquisite and have antiqued gold and silver accents. A dragon weaves his way around many of the cast metal parts. The handle has a traditional Japanese cotton wrap over real ray skin. The wooden saya is reddish brown with black flecks and genuine black buffalo horn accent"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-dragon-viking-axe-106265-42238139760','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/355/0011535_dragon-viking-axe__31754.jpg','["Dragon Viking Axe","89.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139760&a=2893129&m=106265","The Nordic warrior held his weapon in great reverence and often lavished them with elaborate decorations. Our example displays a Viking dragon knot work motif. This is the perfect size for one handed combat in conjunction with a shield. The decorated head is tempered steel and the shaft is from a good hardwood. A great choice to finish out your Viking gear. A Viking''s equipment consisted of sword, seax, axe, spear and round shield, the quality of which indicated a warrior''s social status. Made b"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-dragonfly-katana-106265-42238140127','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/433/0000836_dragonfly-katana__53947.jpg','["Dragonfly Katana","489.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140127&a=2893129&m=106265","The classic Japanese battle sword in all its incarnations has been celebrated for centuries, not only for its elegant lines and simple beauty, but also for the technique and skill that went into its construction. Most swords offered today are interpretive copies of antiquities from feudal Japan. They were made for warriors of small stature who seldom rose above five and a half feet. As skillfully designed as these swords are, they may not be perfectly suited for the 21st century warrior. As a w"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-dragonfly-wakizashi-106265-42238140128','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/546/0000838_dragonfly-wakizashi__47911.jpg','["Dragonfly Wakizashi","394.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140128&a=2893129&m=106265","The classic Japanese battle sword in all its incarnations has been celebrated for centuries, not only for its elegant lines and simple beauty, but also for the technique and skill that went into its construction. Most swords offered today are interpretive copies of antiquities from feudal Japan. They were made for warriors of small stature who seldom rose above five and a half feet. As skillfully designed as these swords are, they may not be perfectly suited for the 21st century warrior. As a w"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-drinking-horn-of-olaf-106265-42238139819','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/x/104/0012008_drinking-horn-of-olaf__75909.jpg','["Drinking Horn of Olaf","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139819&a=2893129&m=106265","This gorgeous Viking drinking horn is named after Olaf the Peacock, chieftain of the early Icelandic Commonwealth. An intricate peacock feather has been lavishly hand-painted onto the horn and sealed for durability. A brass rim surrounds the top edge. It comes with an adjustable, leather belt holster. Part of our exclusive Asgard Creations line, this comes with a free jute bag (while supplies last)! Please Note: Due to the horns being natural, the sizes and color may vary. It is recommended to w"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ear-protectors-106265-42238140121','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/526/0011871_ear-protectors__84129.jpg','["Ear Protectors","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140121&a=2893129&m=106265","We loved the effectiveness of these ear protectors, and well as the price! And they''re not just for the range, we found them well suited for lawn work and industrial use too. 29DB, black ABS muff bodies with padded ear cover."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-early-scottish-dirk-106265-42238139801','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/256/0014684_early-scottish-dirk__69134.jpg','["Early Scottish Dirk","139.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139801&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 1550 This style dirk is a direct descendant of the medieval ballock dagger. The grip form began to change, probably sometime in the late 16th century, but soon developed a form that was purely Scottish. The blade was long and single-edged. Made to use alone, with a shield and sword, or just with a basket-hilt claymore. We have replicated an early version of the dirk. The hardwood handle is carved with a chevron style pattern copied from an original of the same time period. For those with a"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-eastern-damascus-chopper-106265-42238140084','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/567/0011067_eastern-damascus-chopper__39419.jpg','["Eastern Damascus Chopper","129.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140084&a=2893129&m=106265","This fantasy inspired scimitar is a sight to behold. You can picture Ali Baba or Sinbad swinging a fantastic sword such as this on their many adventures. The Damascus, full tang blade has an amazing random pattern and the pommel is matching Damascus steel. Hilt has a stained wood grip with brass pins and brass and steel spacers that have extensive jimping. Cross guard is steel and brass and is a fitting touch to this truly stunning sword. Includes leather belt sheath. Overall: 35-1/2\" Blade: 24\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-edc-survival-cards-106265-42238139772','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/x/978/0007204_edc-survival-cards__91242.jpg','["EDC Survival Cards","5.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139772&a=2893129&m=106265","These every day carry survival cards are an easy to carry credit card sized tool that is perfect for everyday chores, camping, car, purse, and so much more. Includes a set of 2 sturdy, stainless steel cards with plastic sleeves. Key Functions: Can opener Knife edge Screwdriver Ruler Bottle opener Wrenches Wood saw blade Direction ancillary indication Lanyard hole"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-einardolk-pewter-pendant-106265-42238140082','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/253/0010017_einardolk-pewter-pendant__49415.jpg','["Einardolk Pewter Pendant","40.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140082&a=2893129&m=106265","This stunning Viking talisman was used for personal protection and symbol of self-preservation. Its name come from the Norse word Einar, One who fights alone, and Dolk, dagger. Made in England of fine pewter and has a black cabochon in the dragons eye. Measures approximately 2-1/2 tall. Includes a 21 metal chain."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-eisenhower-war-bonds-metal-sign-106265-42238140057','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/632/0011372_eisenhower-war-bonds-metal-sign__62432.jpg','["Eisenhower War Bonds Metal Sign","18.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140057&a=2893129&m=106265","War Bonds were the life blood of our troops during World War II. This great poster showing General Dwight D. Eisenhower is perfectly reproduced on this sturdy tin sign. Perfect for your den, office or man cave. Measures 11-3/4 x 7-3/4"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-elk-ridge-easy-carry-hunter-106265-42238140073','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/257/0000377_elk-ridge-easy-carry-hunter__31135.jpg','["Elk Ridge Easy Carry Hunter","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140073&a=2893129&m=106265","This Elk Ridge Easy Carry knife is a great companion while hunting; it skins small to medium sized game and looks darn good doing it (as good as you can anyway). Plus it doesnt look out of place in a collection with the polished 440 stainless steel and wood scales. Full profile tang with an attractive elk cut-out. Includes leather belt sheath Overall: 7\" Blade: 2-3/4\" View more Elk Ridge products"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-elk-ridge-hunter-106265-42238140074','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/099/0000301_elk-ridge-hunter__63908.jpg','["Elk Ridge Hunter","18.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140074&a=2893129&m=106265","This Elk Ridge knife is a very nice modified hunter with an upsweep for skinning functions. Features a hollow ground stainless steel blade. This attractive knife has a real stag horn bolster married to dark hardwood polished scales with lanyard hollow. Stainless guard and full profile tang for rugged use. Comes with good leather sheath. Get ready for the upcoming season with this very affordable knife. Overall: 8-5/8\" Blade: 4\" long, 7/8\" wide View more Elk Ridge products"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-elk-ridge-multi-purpose-hatchet-106265-42238140222','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/l/003/0011959_elk-ridge-multi-purpose-hatchet__69343.jpg','["Elk Ridge Multi-Purpose Hatchet","17.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140222&a=2893129&m=106265","This handy little axe from Elk Ridge is perfect for small chores and features hex wrench cut-outs in the head. Made from one piece of stainless steel with laminate scales, it has a full profile tang. The back of axe has a cord cutter. Includes nylon belt sheath. Small and light enough for good chopping and ease of carrying while trekking. Overall: 10-1/2\" x 3-3/8\" Axe face: 4\" Wt: approximately 8 oz View more from Elk Ridge"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-embroidered-fringed-texas-flag-106265-42238140129','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/920/0008724_embroidered-fringed-texas-flag__31310.jpg','["Embroidered Fringed Texas Flag","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140129&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a heavy duty version of the Texas State Flag featureing the famous Lone Star. The red in the state flag of Texas represents bravery, the white represents purity and the blue represents loyalty. Made from 210D Oxford polyester with bright gold fringe, it has embroidered stars and a heavy canvas header. Fly-end has four rows of stitching. Brass grommets. Measures: 3'' x 5''"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-end-times-machete-106265-42238139835','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/434/0011063_end-times-machete__67591.jpg','["End Times Machete","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139835&a=2893129&m=106265","The stainless steel blade of this machete is ready for the apocalypse. The rugged plastic handle is mold over rubber for comfort and great grip. The blade has a saw back spine and cut-outs which lighten it and could even pop a bottle top in a pinch. Light for its size which makes for a very quick swing, plus it''s just cool looking! Includes nylon belt sheath. Overall: 25\" Blade: 19\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-erik-the-red-viking-sword-by-marto-106265-42238139896','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/212/0010101_erik-the-red-viking-sword-by-marto__79605.jpg','["Erik the Red Viking Sword by Marto","295.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139896&a=2893129&m=106265","Intricate etch-work patterns dress the blade, which is of 420 stainless steel and mirror polished. Forged with Martos world-renown quality, the Erik the Red Viking Sword is a worthy and popular addition to any sword enthusiasts collection. Decorative use only. Intended for wall decor, displays, home or office decor or for costume."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-extra-short-handle-felling-axe-106265-42238139750','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/334/0013723_extra-short-handle-felling-axe__03023.jpg','["Extra Short Handle Felling Axe","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139750&a=2893129&m=106265","This Extra Short Handle Felling Axe from Tata Agrico has a drop forged 1055 high carbon steel blade suited for cutting down trees and chopping. The tapered cutting edge ensures cutting efficiency & longer life to the axe. Features an American hickory handle. Axe head weighs 2 lbs. Short Felling Axe also available. Overall: 27\" long Axe head: 6-1/2\" long with 4-1/4\" cutting edge Wt: 3-1/2 lbs"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-faithkeeper-dagger-of-the-knights-templar-106265-42238140099','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/179/0012821_faithkeeper-dagger-of-the-knights-templar__69430.jpg','["Faithkeeper - Dagger of the Knights Templar","179.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140099&a=2893129&m=106265","The main driving force behind the Order of the Knights Templar was faith. Faith in God, faith in their mission, and faith in each other. This dagger is a testament to these valiant knights. The finest metal-smiths at Windlass Steelcrafts have spent hours on each blade, hand-forging the high-carbon steel for optimal balance, quickness, and durability. Holding this dagger in your hand will leave no doubt that this magnificent weapon could have defended the Holy Land. The genuine hand-wrapped leath"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-falcata-106265-42238139786','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/726/0013096_falcata__39258.jpg','["Falcata","224.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139786&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 200 BC The Celt-Iberians of Roman times were justly famed for their weapons, such as the Falcata - one of the most devastating swords ever made! The inward curving blade delivered a tremendous blow and could split both shield and helmet. Considered to be of Greek, or possibly Etruscan origin, this sword spread into Southern Russia and also Spain. It was in Spanish hands that it was most feared by the Romans. The blade is made from high carbon steel. The handle is solid brass. Made by Windl"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-fdr-bust-106265-42238139924','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/871/0011300_fdr-bust__42076.jpg','["FDR Bust","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139924&a=2893129&m=106265","The only President to serve three terms, Franklin D. Roosevelt is widely thought of as one of the most important and influential figures of the 20th Century. He is consistently ranked with the likes of George Washington and Abraham Lincoln as one of the great US Presidents. This cold cast resin bust is metalized with a bronze finish and feel. You''d think it was real metal! A fitting tribute to the man that took us through WWII which highlights his friendly and strong features. Comes affixed to t"]'),
