('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-finnish-contract-german-m40-wwii-type-steel-helmet-106265-42238140085','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/302/0002165_finnish-contract-german-m40-wwii-type-steel-helmet__10024.jpg','["Finnish Contract German M40 WWII Type Steel Helmet","79.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140085&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a rare chance to own a genuine military issue German made M40 WWII style helmet for the almost the same price as a reproduction. There is simply no comparison to a genuine combat helmet! These WWII helmet stocks are from the government of Finland and are 100% genuine German manufactured WWII type M40 steel combat helmets that were produced by German WWII helmet manufacturer Hans Römer Fabrik from Neu-Ulm (Donau-Freiberg). Supplied throughout WWII and then under special contract for the F"]'),
