('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-firefighter-stein-with-lid-106265-42238140205','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/p/436/0009315_firefighter-stein-with-lid__28216.jpg','["Firefighter Stein with Lid","59.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140205&a=2893129&m=106265","This heavy, beautiful stein was custom made from Italian glass and German pewter with a fire crest designed just for this mug. The smooth, sturdy glass body is tapered with a starburst pattern on the bottom. The heavy gauge pewter lid is easily removed and re-attached by simply tightening and loosening special threaded hinge pin with a screwdriver. After battling blazes, youll want a cold drink and from a stein that honors that effort. Overall: 6-1/2\" tall Capacity: 13-1/2 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-fireman-wall-plaque-106265-42238140160','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/005/0009504_fireman-wall-plaque__21367.jpg','["Fireman Wall Plaque","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140160&a=2893129&m=106265","This heavy cast iron plaque has been aged and styled to look like something you''d see on a Firehouse wall in the early 1900''s. Rustic and hand crafted just like the originals, it makes a great decor item. It can be hung in your home or proudly displayed by a fire department honoring the past. Approximately 9\" x 7-3/4\" Weight: 2 lbs / 12 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-fisted-walking-stick-106265-42238139782','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/929/0008265_fisted-walking-stick__79479.jpg','["Fisted Walking Stick","59.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139782&a=2893129&m=106265","This cane is solidly constructed of wood with a black finish. The sculpted cane head is that of an ominous fist and molded in metal, which is imposing enough to ward off the toughest of criminals. A rubber, anti-skid tip is included. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Also available Fisted Cane with Spike for added self defense. Not meant to be used for medical purposes."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-flitz-knife-sword-gun-care-kit-106265-42238139833','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/804/0008240_flitz-knife-sword-gun-care-kit__52729.jpg','["Flitz Knife, Sword & Gun Care Kit","26.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139833&a=2893129&m=106265","Working directly with the pros at Flitz weve come up with what we feel is the ultimate cleaning and care kit available. Our 37 years experience have shown us that each of these products is essential for the complete care of any and all of your valued knives, swords, axes, firearms and almost anything else that needs the best care and protection. The set features the famous polishing paste that works miracles on metals, plastic & fiberglass surfaces, specially formulated stainless steel & chrome"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-florentine-cinquedea-106265-42238140065','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/378/0010040_florentine-cinquedea__36818.jpg','["Florentine Cinquedea","204.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140065&a=2893129&m=106265","The unique cinquedea (ching-kwi-dey-uh) gained popularity as the sidearm of choice for noblemen walking through the narrow alleyways and walled cities of Italy. The name cinquedea means \"five fingers\", and it describes the width of the blade next to the guard. A blade worn exclusively for civilian self-defense, it was essentially the precursor to the civilian side sword and the rapier  and yet, this instrument of personal protection seems to have owed much of its design to fashion as it did to "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-foam-assassin-s-creed-kukri-106265-42238140097','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/644/0012734_foam-assassins-creed-kukri__73438.jpg','["Foam Assassin''s Creed Kukri","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140097&a=2893129&m=106265","This Officially licensed Assassin''s Creed kukri may look real, but is made from dense latex foam! The curved blade has been hand-painted to resemble steel and the handle looks like real wood with brass accents. The insignia of the British Brotherhood decorates the top of the grip and the center of the pommel. Great for cosplay and costumes! Overall: 19\" long Handle: 6\" Warning: Use common sense and restraint when using any weapon. Although these are foam covered they can still do harm. They are "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-foam-black-pipe-106265-42238140029','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/d/850/0011576_foam-black-pipe__40140.jpg','["Foam Black Pipe","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140029&a=2893129&m=106265","Its easy to imagine this wooden stick terrorizing the locals in the hands of evil bogeymen from your favorite horror movies of the last few decades. But look again! This may look real, but is made of soft, friendly foam rubber! So go ahead and bash each other to your hearts content, or be the hero who turns the bad guys own weapon against him. Realistically painted and will withstand up to 80 lbs. of force. Overall: 28\" long Warning: Use common sense and restraint when using any weapon. Altho"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-foam-bloody-butchers-cleaver-106265-42238140002','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/868/0012745_foam-bloody-butchers-cleaver__80590.jpg','["Foam Bloody Butchers Cleaver","12.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140002&a=2893129&m=106265","This blood-splattered meat cleaver will make it look like you''ve been busy cooking up a nightmare! It may look real, but is made of dense foam rubber! Lightweight and realistically painted, it will withstand up to 80 lbs. of pressure. Overall: 15-1/2\" long Warning: Use common sense and restraint when using any weapon. Although these are foam, they can still do harm. They are not toys and are intended for prop adult use only. Please use caution!"]'),
