('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-folding-travel-bottles-set-of-3-106265-42238140012','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/p/865/0009401_folding-travel-bottles-set-of-3__73562.jpg','["Folding Travel Bottles - Set of 3","5.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140012&a=2893129&m=106265","These Folding Travel Bottles are ultralight, food grade, BPA free and TSA compliant. Each 100ml collapsible bottle can be used for any liquid from food to soap and collapse down to almost nothing. Sold as a set of 3, they are easy to stow and carry, you''ll never be without a bottle again."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-forged-iron-candle-holder-106265-42238139865','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/184/0012061_forged-iron-candle-holder__29441.jpg','["Forged Iron Candle Holder","16.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139865&a=2893129&m=106265","Traverse the darkened hallways of the castle or dungeons with this hand-forged iron candle holder. Made of strong wrought iron, this multi-functional holder can be either carried by its decorative twisted iron handle or places on any flat surface on its strong sturdy feet. It has been forged-blackened to give it an authentic look. Can handle up to a 3 wide candle (not included). Overall: 9-1/4\" tall\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-forged-iron-cork-screw-106265-42238139733','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/788/0010986_forged-iron-cork-screw__26606.jpg','["Forged Iron Cork Screw","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139733&a=2893129&m=106265","This cork screw is hand forged from iron and is a very unique accent piece for your home bar, festival, feast or reenactment. Approx. 4-7/8\" x 3-1/2\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-forged-iron-dice-set-106265-42238139775','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/440/0010987_forged-iron-dice-set__38734.jpg','["Forged Iron Dice Set","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139775&a=2893129&m=106265","This set of 2 dice is hand forged from iron. Even the village smithy liked a good game of chance every now and then. These are heavy and solid, so watch out when rolling on smooth or soft surfaces they have sharp points that could mar the finish. Designed to be used over rough-hewn wood or the ground itself. Approx. 1/2\" x 1/2\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-fox-fur-mantle-106265-42238140224','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/168/0009972_fox-fur-mantle__46344.jpg','["Fox Fur Mantle","54.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140224&a=2893129&m=106265","This rich faux fox mantle can be utilized with a variety of your existing garments and capes, giving your pieces an entirely new look! This collar is suitable for both men and women. The simple drape design is cut to resemble a fox pelt and held in place with a carved bone button and loop. The faux fur mantle is finished on both sides and is made of soft light brown polyester. One size."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-francesca-axe-replacement-handle-106265-42238139784','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/338/0012203_francesca-axe-replacement-handle__20563.jpg','["Francesca Axe Replacement Handle","6.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139784&a=2893129&m=106265","This replacement curved wood handle fits our Francesca Medieval Axe. Made of stained hardwood by Windlass Steelcrafts. Save on 3 or more! Purchase 3 or more handles at $5.95 each!"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-frontier-shirt-106265-42238140140','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/939/0000255_frontier-shirt__04981.jpg','["Frontier Shirt","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140140&a=2893129&m=106265","We''ve seen a lot of simple shirts in our day, but this one stood out as being the go to for reenactors from the Old West to the US Civil War and beyond. A great all purpose garment with historical detail. Natural, unbleached cotton muslin (off white) or bleached white. Available in S, M, L, XL or 2XL. Click here for size chart"]'),
