('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-genuine-irish-shillelagh-cane-106265-42238139855','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/207/0002205_genuine-irish-shillelagh-cane__45346.jpg','["Genuine Irish Shillelagh Cane","84.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139855&a=2893129&m=106265","Each hand-crafted Irish Shillelagh walking cane is unique. Harvested and made in Ireland as they have been for centuries. Famously made from the tough, local blackthorn shrub each shillelagh is selected for its superior weight to hardness ratio. Each is hand sanded and lacquered with a high gloss finish. Today they are used by farmers for herding sheep or cattle, or simply as outdoor walking companions - many are considered family heirlooms. Smaller versions were so tough they were considered ru"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-geodesic-skull-106265-42238140075','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/136/0007729_geodesic-skull__51389.jpg','["Geodesic Skull","40.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140075&a=2893129&m=106265","This Geodesic Skull has an angular design is both mesmerizing and eerie. This polygon bronze statue is a cold cast resin with an antique gold tone metallic finish. Overall: 6-3/2\" tall, 5-1/4\" wide, 8\" long"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-gerber-center-drive-multi-tool-106265-42238140105','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/352/0011932_gerber-center-drive-multi-tool__15860.jpg','["Gerber Center-Drive Multi-Tool","144.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140105&a=2893129&m=106265","Gerbers new multi-tool offers uncompromising performance through revolutionary design. The innovative center-axis driver opens to align like a real screwdriver, yielding maximum torque and rotation. No productivity is sacrificed with the addition of a 30% longer outboard blade and one-thumb opening sliding jaws. Full size, real tools - the multi-tool just got a reality check. The Center-Drive is made for real challenges - and works like the real thing - built right here in the USA. Let those o"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-gerber-devour-multi-fork-106265-42238140058','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/127/0011566_gerber-devour-multi-fork__64836.jpg','["Gerber Devour Multi-Fork","18.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140058&a=2893129&m=106265","With 9 functions, the Devour Multi-Fork is the only tool needed for cooking, eating, and cleaning. The lightweight aluminum combo snaps together for secure portability, yet each tool works independently. At under an ounce, the Devour is ideal for those who demand a lightweight, easy-to-use tool on the trail. Designed to handle mealtime from start to finish, the refreshed fork design doesnt compromise function, and the detachable solid state tool offers 6 functions while keeping your multi-fork "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-gerber-key-note-black-clip-folding-knife-106265-42238139959','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/497/0011564_gerber-key-note-black-clip-folding-knife__57134.jpg','["Gerber Key Note Black Clip Folding Knife","27.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139959&a=2893129&m=106265","The Key Note is a do-it-all knife that packs a surprising amount of utility into a compact frame. The dual-use blade is deployed with a starter tab and secured open with a nail nick. It offers both a scraping and a cutting edge. The stout blade can be carried a multitude of ways - on your belt, in a pocket, or on a keychain to be on hand when you need it for daily tasks. When open, the blade is secured with an easy-to-operate liner lock. The aluminum scales stand up to daily abuse. A removable k"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-gerber-pack-hatchet-106265-42238140117','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/927/0012056_gerber-pack-hatchet__44258.jpg','["Gerber Pack Hatchet","42.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140117&a=2893129&m=106265","This hatchet from Gerber features a full tang, corrosion-resistant, high carbon stainless steel, one-piece axe design. With a comfortable rubber grip and lanyard hole, it also has finger grooves high on the shaft allowing you to hold and control the blade for precise edge control and fine cutting. The tall grind takes a very sharp edge. Stone wash finish. Includes nylon belt/pack sheath. Sized and weighted perfectly for easy carry in a pack. Designed and Engineered in Oregon. Includes Gerber''s l"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-gerber-us1-pocket-knife-106265-42238140013','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/208/0008817_gerber-us1-pocket-knife__49159.jpg','["Gerber US1 Pocket Knife","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140013&a=2893129&m=106265","The best-in-class 420HC blade is deployed with a simple nail nick and held in check by an easy to operate lock back design. The US1 pocket knife is a testament to the adage hard work pays off. Drawing on decades of experience perfecting the folding pocket knife, the US1 boasts innovative design elements and premium materials without sacrificing the iconic history that Gerber has come to be known for. Proudly made in Portland, Oregon, this trusted everyday companion will endure the test of time"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-german-tiger-1-tank-metal-model-106265-42238140107','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/675/0010701_german-tiger-1-tank-metal-model__08683.jpg','["German Tiger 1 Tank Metal Model","10.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140107&a=2893129&m=106265","The Tiger 1 Tank was the most powerful tank in the world when the German''s introduced it in 1942. The 88 mm gun was extremely powerful, and the heavy armor made it almost impregnable to attack. The success of the Tiger was so one-sided that no Allied tank dared to confront it in open combat. The fear it instilled was so rampant is was given a name- Tigerphobia. This pocket sized, laser cut model is an all stainless steel and assembled from two laser cut sheets. No glue needed. Moderate difficult"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-german-war-hammer-106265-42238139742','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/257/0012678_german-war-hammer__90088.jpg','["German War Hammer","89.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139742&a=2893129&m=106265","This Circa 1350 medieval hammer is replicated from an example in the German National Museum in Nuremberg. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts, the steel head is secured to the hardwood shaft with steel langets. Brass tacks provide a more secure grip."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-german-wwii-afrikakorps-p-08-hardshell-luger-holster-106265-42238139813','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/099/0001700_german-wwii-afrikakorps-p-08-hardshell-luger-holster__10935.jpg','["German WWII AfrikaKorps P-08 Hardshell Luger Holster","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139813&a=2893129&m=106265","A magnificent replica of AfrikaKorps brown leather P 08 Luger holster. Our replica is correct in all respects including the use of AfrikaKorps brown leather with white stitching as originally issued. It comes with spare magazine pocket on side and stripping tool compartment on the inside of the hardshell cover. Our holster even has duplicated AfrikaKorps symbol, maker codes and Waffenamt markings."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-german-wwii-reproduction-luftwaffe-officers-cap-106265-42238139776','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/468/0000194_german-wwii-reproduction-luftwaffe-officers-cap__05880.jpg','["German WWII Reproduction Luftwaffe Officers Cap","49.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139776&a=2893129&m=106265","Our fine reproduction visor caps are perfect for the re-enactor or collector. This Luftwaffe Officers Cap is blue and black in color, complete with silver piping, silver cap cords and a silver colored Luftwaffe eagle swastika badge. Specify size: 7-1/4\", 7-1/2\" or 7-3/4\". Patent leather visor and leather sweatband. Please note: ACC holds no sympathetic regard toward Nazis, fascists, or other neo-political parties, past or present. This product is intended for historical purposes only."]'),
