('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-german-wwii-reproduction-wehrmacht-officers-cap-106265-42238139777','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/121/0000192_german-wwii-reproduction-wehrmacht-officers-cap__23975.jpg','["German WWII Reproduction Wehrmacht Officers Cap","49.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139777&a=2893129&m=106265","Our fine reproduction visor caps are perfect for the re-enactor or collector. This Wehrmacht Officers Cap is grey/green in color, complete with white piping, silver cap cords, silver colored cloth cap badge and a silver colored spread eagle swastika badge. Specify size: 7-1/4\", 7-1/2\" or 7-3/4\". Patent leather visor and leather sweat band. Please note: ACC holds no sympathetic regard toward Nazis, fascists, or other neo-political parties, past or present. This product is intended for historical"]'),
