('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-gi-tanto-knife-106265-42238139842','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/352/0002136_gi-tanto-knife__20663.jpg','["GI Tanto Knife","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139842&a=2893129&m=106265","As its name suggests, Cold Steel''s G.I. Tanto is a no-nonsense tactical knife that comes with a legion of practical uses. It may be lean and spare, but it delivers the goods where they count the most! The broad Tanto point blade, integral quillon guard, and Polypropylene handle scales exemplify a tactical knife stripped down to its bare essentials. Its ground razor sharp out of 1055 carbon steel with a hard spring temper and protected by a black, rust-resistant finish so it''s ready to take all "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-grand-union-flag-106265-42238139931','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/685/0008733_grand-union-flag__70615.jpg','["Grand Union Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139931&a=2893129&m=106265","The Grand Union Flag is the first \"official\" flag. Legend says that it was created when General Washington requested Philadelphia pennant maker, Rebecca Flower Young, make a flag to use as a rallying symbol for his troops. The first flag of the colonists to have any resemblance to our present Stars and Stripes, the Grand Union Flag was also known as Continental Colors, the Congress Flag, the First Navy Ensign and the Cambridge Flag. This design consisted of 13 red and white stripes representing "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-green-mountain-boys-flag-106265-42238140014','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/i/007/0008735_green-mountain-boys-flag__96088.jpg','["Green Mountain Boys Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140014&a=2893129&m=106265","One of the most famous Revolutionary War era militia groups was the Green Mountain Boys. Formed before the Revolutionary War in 1760''s, the Green Mountain Boys were a group of men from the colonial New Hampshire Grants territory, an area between the colonies of New Hampshire and New York that eventually became the State of Vermont. Led by Ethan Allen and members of his family, they were originally formed to prevent New York authorities from controlling their land. Later they were instrumental in"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-grenade-mug-106265-42238139858','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/601/0011331_grenade-mug__44742.jpg','["Grenade Mug","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139858&a=2893129&m=106265","This grenade mug is perfect for that blast of caffeine you need! When youre in the trenches of your morning, revitalize with a caffeine blast from this stylish ceramic grenade mug. Matte, olive green. A full cup will be sure to pull the pin on any bad day. Hand wash. Capacity: 22 oz Height: 5-1/4\" tall"]'),
