('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-hobbit-sting-sword-of-bilbo-baggins-106265-42238139861','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/799/0002021_hobbit-sting-sword-of-bilbo-baggins__69965.jpg','["Hobbit Sting Sword of Bilbo Baggins","149.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139861&a=2893129&m=106265","In this harrowing journey Bilbo and his Company of Dwarves come upon a troll lair in Rhûdaur. There they find two Elven swords, Glamdring and Orcrist, and a knife. Bilbo claims the knife for himself and names it Sting, although it was more of a sword to someone of his stature. This authentically detailed replica is a reproduction of the actual filming prop. The Sting sword features a stainless steel blade, solid metal hilt parts and an intricately detailed vine adorning the grip. It is present"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-hobbit-sting-sword-of-frodo-baggins-with-wall-plaque-106265-42238139961','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/583/0012422_hobbit-sting-sword-of-frodo-baggins-with-wall-plaque__21715.jpg','["Hobbit Sting Sword of Frodo Baggins with Wall Plaque","149.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139961&a=2893129&m=106265","The Lord of the Rings book trilogy is the most popular book of the 20th Century and has been presented in a series of feature films from New Line Cinema. This officially licensed Hobbit Sting Sword of Frodo Baggins comes with a wooden display plaque and certificate of authenticity. It features a solid metal guard and pommel with an antique metal finish and a plastic handle. The 420 stainless steel blade features an Elven vine design. Overall: 22\" long Blade: 15\" long View more items from The Lor"]'),
