('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-honor-and-courage-statue-106265-42238140077','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/243/0001785_honor-and-courage-statue__63369.jpg','["Honor and Courage Statue","77.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140077&a=2893129&m=106265","This Honor and Courage Statue is a magnificent tribute to the World War II Army Airborne veteran. This highly detailed statue is spot-on accurate and is made of a cold-cast resin which has been metalized with an antique bronze finish. Overall Height: 12-1/2\""]'),
