('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-honshu-boshin-wakizashi-106265-42238139949','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/707/0000904_honshu-boshin-wakizashi__19394.jpg','["Honshu Boshin Wakizashi","114.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139949&a=2893129&m=106265","United Cutlery''s Honshu Boshin Wakizashi is a classic blade with sleek, modern elegance. The sharp 1060 high carbon steel blade is full tang with a satin finish to complement the satin-finished guard and pommel. The grip is slip-free TPR to let you wield this sword with ease. A wooden scabbard with leather wrapping completes the package. Overall: 32-3/4\" Blade: 22-1/2 long, 3/16\" thick Wt: 2 lbs / 8 oz View more products from United Cutlery"]'),
