('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-hungarian-m38-wwii-steel-helmet-106265-42238140030','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/897/0002170_hungarian-m38-wwii-steel-helmet__66811.jpg','["Hungarian M38 WWII Steel Helmet","109.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140030&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a rare chance to own a genuine WWII M38 Hungarian made German type M35 helmet for far less than a German manufactured wartime one. There is simply no comparison to a genuine combat helmet! These WWII helmet stocks are from the government of Finland and are 100% genuine WWII issue Hungarian M38. In WWII Hungary was an ally of Germany. The Germans allowed and assisted the Hungarians in copying their design of the M35 steel helmet. Therefore, the WWII produced M38 Hungarian steel helmet is "]'),
