('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-illuminated-staff-of-the-wizard-gandalf-106265-42238139909','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/865/0012444_illuminated-staff-of-the-wizard-gandalf__45788.jpg','["Illuminated Staff Of The Wizard Gandalf","219.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139909&a=2893129&m=106265","This special edition of the Staff of the Wizard Gandalf has an Illuminated crown that glows just like the one seen in The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug. Crafted from the molds of the actual film prop, it has been cast in hard polyresin and hand-painted. It includes an Elven-styled wall display plaque featuring Gandalfs G rune and Certificate of Authenticity, Features a translucent lattice within the crown that holds a high-intensity white LED (100 lumens, 50,000-hour lifespan). The light is"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-imperial-katana-106265-42238140130','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/594/0000842_imperial-katana__19942.jpg','["Imperial Katana","499.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140130&a=2893129&m=106265","Cold Steel uses only traditional materials for the fittings of their Japanese Imperial swords. The Tsuba (guard), Fuchi (collar) and Kashira (pommel) are expertly made and finely crafted in nickel-silver brass. The Habaki (blade collar) of this Katana is hand made out of nickel-silver brass and the hilt is covered in Samé (ray skin) and tightly wrapped in the traditional style with black silk cord. A beautiful Menuki (a small ornamental sculpture inserted between the ray skin and the cord wrappi"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-iron-feasting-utensils-w-pouch-106265-42238139738','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/589/0012454_iron-feasting-utensils-w-pouch__40837.jpg','["Iron Feasting Utensils w/ Pouch","49.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139738&a=2893129&m=106265","Finally, feasting utensils for the re-enactor on the go! Great for Viking and medieval settings, our knife, fork and spoon set fit neatly in a tie-fold, open belt leather pouch for a great combo. Easy to take along to the faire, a picnic, camp out or wherever you want to be able to eat out! The handle for each hand-forged piece has the traditional blacksmith''''s twist and the knife is capable of holding an edge. Each piece is approximately 8\" long overall. Leather pouch not sold separately. Pleas"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ironwood-walking-stick-106265-42238139884','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/165/0002211_ironwood-walking-stick__79447.jpg','["Ironwood Walking Stick","32.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139884&a=2893129&m=106265","If a wood could be tough as nails, this Ironwood Walking Staff is it. This is a very dense hardwood, handmade in Texas by cowboy Joel Lancastern from American Hornbeam, also known as ironwood. A rustic classic with unique characteristics so each is one-of-a-kind. Features a lanyard thong. Non-slip, thick rubber tip. Not meant to be used for medical purposes. Approx. 55\" tall"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-javelin-head-106265-42238139730','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/925/0012199_javelin-head__63442.jpg','["Javelin Head","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139730&a=2893129&m=106265","The Peltasts or light infantry of ancient Greece were often armed with multiple light javelins, often with throwing straps to increase standoff power. Our javelin head has been modeled after these lighter yet deadly spears. Hand-forged of tempered steel and made for use, these heads will fit wooden shafts 7/8\" diameter. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-join-or-die-flag-106265-42238139902','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/542/0008740_join-or-die-flag__27683.jpg','["Join Or Die Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139902&a=2893129&m=106265","The famous Join, or Die cartoon appeared in the Pennsylvania Gazette on May 9, 1754 and is believed to have been created by Benjamin Franklin, who owned and ran the Philadelphia based newspaper. By the 1750s, France and Great Britain had been arguing for years over the extent one anothers landholdings in the Americas. Franklin considered the American colonies to be fragmented. With this cartoon and its accompanying article he hoped to convince the American colonies that they would have greate"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ka-bar-chopsticks-2-sets-106265-42238139876','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/392/0009305_ka-bar-chopsticks-2-sets__20381.jpg','["KA-BAR Chopsticks - 2 sets","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139876&a=2893129&m=106265","This set of KA-BAR® Chopsticks provides two sets of American-made, dishwasher safe chopsticks. Made from Food and Water Safe Grilamid®, they measure 9.5\" overall. The chopsticks are each marked \"KA-BAR\" and \"USA\" and are lightweight, strong and easy to clean. Overall: 9-1/2\" long Weight: .64 oz each Includes 2 sets of chopsticks (4 sticks total) View more items from KA-BAR"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ka-bar-emergency-whistle-106265-42238140144','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/i/239/0011940_ka-bar-emergency-whistles__97341.jpg','["KA-BAR Emergency Whistle","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140144&a=2893129&m=106265","The KA-BAR emergency whistle delivers approximately 100 decibels of sound in any weather. Made in the USA from food and water safe Creamid. They can easily be put on key chains, zipper pulls, backpacks or worn like a charm around the neck. Set of two. Overall: 3-3/4\" long View more items from KA-BAR"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ka-bar-tactical-spork-106265-42238139984','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/319/0009308_ka-bar-tactical-spork__07011.jpg','["KA-BAR Tactical Spork","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139984&a=2893129&m=106265","The Tactical Spork from KA-BAR is made from food and water approved Grilamid. This fork/spoon combo has a 2-1/2\" plastic serrated knife in the handle, accessed by pulling the spork in opposite directions from each end. Light, strong and easy to carry. Take them camping, hunting, keep one in the car for emergencies! Hint: avoid gripping the flat panel area in the middle of the Spork, this is actually part of it''s lock. The tighter you hold here, the more difficult it will be for you to pull out t"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ka-bar-trail-blaze-playing-cards-106265-42238139983','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/098/0011945_ka-bar-trail-blaze-playing-cards__53559.jpg','["KA-BAR Trail Blaze Playing Cards","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139983&a=2893129&m=106265","KA-BAR playing cards are water (and other beverage) resistant. Made from white PVC, the playing cards double as trail markers, letting you blaze your own trails. Rugged enough to hold up to the harshest weather plus friends and family that take a card game a little too seriously. Made in Spain. Trail Blazing or way marking is the practice of marking paths in outdoor recreational areas with signs or markings that follow each other at certain, undefined distances and mark the direction of the trai"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ka-barley-bottle-opener-106265-42238139891','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/527/0001993_ka-barley-bottle-opener__73710.jpg','["KA-BARLEY Bottle Opener","10.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139891&a=2893129&m=106265","This KA-BARLEY bottle opener is made of durable, glass reinforced nylon with the famous KA-BAR oval-shaped knife grip design. Made in the USA. View more items from KA-BAR"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kagemusha-crimson-katana-106265-42238140206','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/476/0000885_kagemusha-crimson-katana__86202.jpg','["Kagemusha Crimson Katana","164.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140206&a=2893129&m=106265","This blood red Kagemusha Crimson katana is entirely hand made using traditional materials and processes and is as beautiful in the hand as it is to the eye. The differential heat treatment of the blade gives the spine the ability to absorb cutting impact while the higher RC edge gives this razor sharp sword bite. Forged from 1060 carbon steel with a real hamon. The parts are copper and the Musashi style tsuba is iron. Real rayskin adorns the handle and is wrapped in red cotton. Saya is lacquered"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kershaw-pt-2-key-chain-tool-106265-42238140016','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/527/0009262_kershaw-pt-2-keychain-tool__07711.jpg','["Kershaw PT-2 Key Chain Tool","12.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140016&a=2893129&m=106265","Key chains just got handier with the new PT-2 key chain tool, offering eight handy functions in a compact space. Weighing less than an ounce it offers a bottle opener and cap lifter, a pry bar, two screwdriver tips, a wire scraper and 3 sizes of hex drives. And because it''s a real tool, Kershaw made it out of quality 8Cr13MoV stainless steel with an attractive bead-blasted finish. For good grip, the PT-2 tool features a handle overlay in glass-filled nylon with a K-Texture pattern. Just use the "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kershaw-ration-multitool-fork-spoon-106265-42238140043','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/174/0009260_kershaw-ration-multitool-fork-spoon__68268.jpg','["Kershaw Ration Multitool Fork Spoon","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140043&a=2893129&m=106265","If you camp, backpack, hike, or hunt, you know you need this. If you have to grab lunch between classes, you need this. If you eat lunch at your desk, you really know you need this. The Kershaw Ration is a compact tool that also offers a generously sized spoonso you can get a real mouthful of that soup or chili youre eatingas well as a fork with tines long enough to actually be useful. As a convenient bonus, it also has a built-in carabiner, so its easy to clip to a backpack, briefcase, or p"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kershaw-tx-tool-106265-42238139892','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/746/0009022_kershaw-tx-tool__40478.jpg','["Kershaw TX-Tool","13.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139892&a=2893129&m=106265","Switching a pocket clip, tightening a screw, or adjusting the pivot tension...now Kershaw owners and others with similar knives have the right tool for almost every adjustment. This Kershaw TX-Tool includes five key bits: T-6, T-8, T-10 and a #2 Phillips, plus a slotted screwdriver bit. A magnetic bit driver tip makes it easy to change bits. Even better, all bits store conveniently inside the TX-Tool''s handle. A pocket clip makes it easy to carry. Steel bits with an aluminum handle."]'),
