('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-keysmart-usb-106265-42238139950','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/772/0007175_keysmart-usb__84859.jpg','["Keysmart USB","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139950&a=2893129&m=106265","Adding big gigabytes to your pocket in the most compact way. This 16 GB USB 2.0 drive can be added easily to any KeySmart. The drive has a full aluminum housing that is very sleek and smooth. More importantly, it protects the drive from harsh environments and falls. View more products from Keysmart"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kikkerland-animal-multi-tool-106265-42238139916','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/990/0008776_animal-multi-tool__11611.jpg','["Kikkerland Animal Multi-Tool","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139916&a=2893129&m=106265","This compact 7 in 1 multi-tool transforms into the cutest little helpers! Made of high-grade stainless steel with beech wood casing, it fits easily into your pocket. Includes a flat head screwdriver (hippo), Phillips head screwdriver, file (llama), punch, bottle opener (rhino), knife and wire stripper."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kikkerland-bug-plier-multi-tool-106265-42238139917','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/l/211/0008787_bug-plier-multi-tool__89316.jpg','["Kikkerland Bug Plier Multi-Tool","6.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139917&a=2893129&m=106265","This Bug Multi-Tool has 6 handy tools in a compact design which is small enough to fit on a keychain. Made of high-grade stainless steel featuring a knife, Phillips screwdriver, pliers, wire cutters, flat screwdriver and a file. Includes ball chain to attach to a keychain."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kikkerland-crab-multi-tool-106265-42238139868','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/847/0008781_crab-multi-tool__95084.jpg','["Kikkerland Crab Multi Tool","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139868&a=2893129&m=106265","You won''t be crabby with this handy tool around. Made of high-grade stainless steel and solid wood, this multi-tool has 6 fold-out tools. Features mini scissors, bottle opener, 3/16 flat head screwdriver, plus small flat head, lanyard holes, can opener, mini knife, rope saw and punch. Perfect for camping, picnicking and outings to the beach."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kit-rae-black-legion-battle-axe-106265-42238139999','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/i/575/0012445_kit-rae-black-legion-battle-axe__33777.jpg','["Kit Rae Black Legion Battle Axe","149.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139999&a=2893129&m=106265","From Kit Rae and the Swords of the Ancients mythology, the Black Legion Battle Axe has tempered, false edged 420 J2 blades that have been deep etched. The highly detailed antique finished metal handle parts are made to the designers'' exacting specifications. The solid metal handle has a leather-wrapped grip. Axe head length is 15\". Includes custom art print The Barumen ©2005 Kit Rae. View more products from United Cutlery"]'),
