('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kitchen-classics-paring-knife-106265-42238139985','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/577/0015719_kitchen-classics-paring-knife__73721.jpg','["Kitchen Classics Paring Knife","12.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139985&a=2893129&m=106265","This Cold Steel Kitchen Paring Knife will become a classic in your kitchen as it races through just about any task you can imagine. The 400 series blade has been ice tempered, cryo-quenched then precision flat ground for exceptional cutting power. Comes with a razor sharp edge that lasts and lasts. The handle is designed to ensure a strong, secure and comfortable grip. It features a stiff Zy-Ex core on the inside for durability, with a softer, food-safe Kray-Ex exterior for the kind of non-slip "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-kukri-machete-106265-42238139932','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/d/554/0008621_kukri-machete__08452.jpg','["Kukri Machete","32.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139932&a=2893129&m=106265","Theres no single edged weapon that we can think of that can out-chop or out-cut a good Kukri. This beautiful Kukri Machete from Cold Steel combines the efficient cutting power of the Gurkha Kukri with the heft of a machete. Features the distinctive weight-forward balance of the top-of-the-line models, and always presents the edge on an angle so it''s guaranteed to bite deep with every stroke. Made with 1055 carbon steel. Additionally, it comes complete with a sturdy Cordura sheath! View more"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ladies-frontier-camisole-106265-42238140051','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/111/0010752_ladies-frontier-camisole__97967.jpg','["Ladies Frontier Camisole","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140051&a=2893129&m=106265","This period camisole is part of a racy little ensemble when paired with our pantaloons. This soft, white cotton top has a button-up front and blue ribbon trim. Not just for the boudoir, it can be worn as an undergarment with your old west ensemble. Perfect for the daring ladies of the 18th and 19th centuries. Order S, M, L or XL. Click here for size chart"]'),
