('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ladies-frontier-pantaloons-106265-42238140226','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/029/0010751_ladies-frontier-pantaloons__06495.jpg','["Ladies Frontier Pantaloons","59.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140226&a=2893129&m=106265","Bloomers like these were popular in the old west. When paired with our camisole you''ll have a daring look in the boudoir, but they''ew also perfect for wearing alone as an undergarment. These soft, white cotton pantaloons have an easy-fit elastic waist and waterfall lace at the knees with blue ribbon detailing. Order S, M, L, or XL. Click here for size chart"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-laguiole-knife-kit-106265-42238139844','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/387/0000111_laguiole-knife-kit__38229.jpg','["Laguiole Knife Kit","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139844&a=2893129&m=106265","Create your own stunning heirloom quality blade with this Laguiole Knife Kit. It includes everything you need to make a classic, fully functional folding knife and we mean everything! Includes a presentation box too! Features high grade stainless steel blade and parts, real wood scales and brass pins/screws. Add your own finishing touch to make it yours. We honestly think anyone can proudly assemble a beautiful knife with this kit. Handle: 4-5/8\" Blade: 3-1/2\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-large-agate-arrowhead-106265-42238139740','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/594/0008989_large-agate-arrowhead__39771.jpg','["Large Agate Arrowhead","8.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139740&a=2893129&m=106265","This massive arrowhead would have been used as a spear tip historically and could have dated from ancient times to the forming of America. Today it is not uncommon to see them as a necklace signifying luck in the hunt and strength. This is a modern, handmade agate head measuring approximately 5- 1/4\"long by 1-1/2\" wide by 1/2\" thick. Due to the hand carving process and natural occurring variance in the stone, no two will ever be alike."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-large-miners-pan-106265-42238139925','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/415/0011385_large-miners-pan__41513.jpg','["Large Miners Pan","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139925&a=2893129&m=106265","This Miners Pan is a great collector''s item, decor piece or take it out and pan for gold! Made from existing antiques for accuracy in size and depth, it is hand aged to perfection. Made from antiqued, thin gauge steel, you can use it just like the ones employed during the gold rush. Overall: 16-1/4\" diameter"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-large-strop-106265-42238140044','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/l/708/0001840_large-strop__77935.jpg','["Large Strop","16.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140044&a=2893129&m=106265","Fine tune your edge with this large strop. Razor strops are a traditional way to polish and hone thinner blades like straight razors and kitchen knives. This strop has two sides, one leather and the other canvas, with leather trim and solid metal parts. Small strop also available. Overall: 22-1/2\" long, 2\" wide"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-leaf-knife-106265-42238140000','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/266/0012461_leaf-knife__70398.jpg','["Leaf Knife","12.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140000&a=2893129&m=106265","An artistic hand-forged beauty from the smithy. One continuous piece of steel is twisted and hammered to form a rustic double leaf design. Includes leather belt sheath. No loose parts, just a fully functional, interesting knife that gets attention. Measurements will vary slightly due to the hand-made construction. Overall: Approximately 7-3/8\" long, 1/8\" thick Edge: Approximately 4-1/4\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-leather-belt-sheath-for-pocket-knife-106265-42238140214','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/p/880/0011885_leather-belt-sheath-for-pocket-knife__37540.jpg','["Leather Belt Sheath for Pocket Knife","15.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140214&a=2893129&m=106265","This leather belt sheath is perfect for your trapper or stockman. Regardless of the make, this carries your trusted pocket knife in a convenient position on your belt. Choice of horizontal or vertical carry, they are made of top-grain leather with matching brown stitching and brass rivets. Measures 4\" x 2-1/4\" Fits belts up to 1-1/2\" wide"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-leather-eye-patch-left-eye-106265-42238139767','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/735/0000215_leather-eye-patch-left-eye__85411.jpg','["Leather Eye Patch - Left Eye","15.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139767&a=2893129&m=106265","This high quality eye patch is hand formed and fits perfectly to the contour of your face. Leather thong attached for tying in the back. Also available for right eye."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-leather-eye-patch-right-eye-106265-42238139785','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/148/0000216_leather-eye-patch-right-eye__76480.jpg','["Leather Eye Patch - Right Eye","15.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139785&a=2893129&m=106265","This high quality eye patch is hand formed and fits perfectly to the contour of your face. Leather thong attached for tying in the back. Also available for left eye."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-leg-irons-106265-42238139817','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/779/0002037_leg-irons__74025.jpg','["Leg Irons","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139817&a=2893129&m=106265","These old time leg irons are made just like the originals from iron. Great for the western enthusiasts or re-enactors. Full size. Hand Cuffs also available (#801856)."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-lord-of-the-rings-hobbit-mirkwood-infantry-sword-106265-42238139997','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/495/0012423_lord-of-the-rings-hobbit-mirkwood-infantry-sword__00277.jpg','["Lord of the Rings: Hobbit Mirkwood Infantry Sword","224.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139997&a=2893129&m=106265","The Lord of the Rings book trilogy is the most popular book of the 20th Century and has been presented in a series of feature films from New Line Cinema. This officially licensed Mirkwood Infantry Sword features bronze finished cast metal hilt parts, a composite grip, and stainless steel blade with cast metal ornaments. This collectible replica comes with a wooden display plaque featuring a Wood Elf graphic motif and certificate of authenticity. The Mirkwood Infantry are soldiers of Woodland Gua"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-low-suede-boots-with-fringe-106265-42238139836','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/i/771/0012771_low-suede-boots-with-fringe__70763.jpg','["Low Suede Boots with Fringe","69.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139836&a=2893129&m=106265","The most difficult part of completing a costume is footwear. Perfect for rendezvous, frontier outfits, or just plain comfort, these suede boots have a 1/8\" thick cushioned insole. They have a comfortable rubber sole, so you can wear them all day long. Sizes 8-13 in Black or Brown. Also available without fringe."]'),
