('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-m-1861-us-enlisted-frock-coat-106265-42238140194','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/084/0000669_m-1861-us-enlisted-frock-coat__47615.jpg','["M-1861 US Enlisted Frock Coat","119.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140194&a=2893129&m=106265","The M-1861 US Enlisted Frock Coat is the regulation dress coat for foot soldiers including infantry, heavy artillery, engineers, hospital stewards and ordnance department. The coat is made of Federal navy blue wool. The body and sleeves are lined in black, natural cotton. The extended skirt is unlined. The 9-button front features Union Eagle buttons. The coat has an inside breast pocket. The collar and inverted V on the cuff are piped and the collar is trimmed with blue branch of service. Av"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-m-1917-enfield-bayonet-with-scabbard-106265-42238140207','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/612/0001631_m-1917-enfield-bayonet-with-scabbard__86729.jpg','["M-1917 Enfield Bayonet with Scabbard","109.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140207&a=2893129&m=106265","This is an exact reproduction of the classic WW1 Enfield M-1917 bayonet with simulated WW1 dates. The blade has wood grips and each bayonet comes with a green steel mounted leather scabbard complete with correct hooks for the U.S. infantry waist belt. Perfect for re-enactors and collectors! This bayonet was also the standard issue for military shotguns, aka \"trench-guns\", from WW1 to Vietnam. Outfit your 1917 Enfield or \"trench-gun\" with our high quality reproduction bayonet. Arrives sharpened f"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-m1-abrams-tank-metal-model-106265-42238139955','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/358/0010711_m1-abrams-tank-metal-model__43635.jpg','["M1 Abrams Tank Metal Model","10.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139955&a=2893129&m=106265","This is the US third-generation battle tank that entered service in 1980. It featured a powerful turbine engine, sophisticated composite armor and specially design ammo storage compartment for crew safety. You still see some in action today, and at 62 metric tons, it is one of the heaviest! This pocket sized, laser cut model is all stainless steel and assembled from two laser cut sheets. Moderate difficulty level. 4.13\" x 1.38\" x 1.38\"."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-m1-garand-m10-buttstock-cleaning-kit-106265-42238140017','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/870/0001835_m1-garand-m10-buttstock-cleaning-kit__49893.jpg','["M1 Garand M10 Buttstock Cleaning Kit","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140017&a=2893129&m=106265","This M1 Garand M10 Butt stock Cleaning Kit is US surplus. the 6-piece kit is new and was never issued . Approximately 26-1/2 long when assembled. T handle doubles as disassembly tool. Cleaning rod is made from blued steel. Comes with OD green canvas pouch for easy butt stock storage."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-m1-garand-sling-with-brass-hardware-106265-42238139789','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/l/034/0001693_m1-garand-sling-with-brass-hardware__87378.jpg','["M1 Garand Sling with Brass Hardware","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139789&a=2893129&m=106265","This sling features a WWI pattern with brass fittings and dates. WWI slings were issued with early production M1 Garands and WWII issue Springfields can use either sling (WWII pattern with steel hardware #803134). Also issued with 1917 Enfields. This style sling is still used today in modified form by high-power rifle competition shooters. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-m48-kommando-survival-hammer-tactical-hiking-staff-106265-42238140062','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/507/0012580_m48-kommando-survival-hammer-tactical-hiking-staff__84393.jpg','["M48 Kommando Survival Hammer Tactical Hiking Staff","99.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140062&a=2893129&m=106265","The M48 Kommando Tactical Survival Hammer from United Cutlery is the perfect companion for hiking and camping. Its great as a walking staff while camping and the cast 2Cr13 stainless steel, black oxide-coated head can pummel almost anything with ease. The cane handle features a defensive war hammerhead and a curved back spike, which is an effective breaching tool and defensive hammer in addition to being a fully functional walking cane. The 30% fiberglass handle is nearly indestructible, and th"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-mad-scientist-lab-coat-106265-42238139929','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/808/0012748_mad-scientist-lab-coat__41984.jpg','["Mad Scientist Lab Coat","129.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139929&a=2893129&m=106265","This style coat was all the rage with mad scientists in Victorian times. Made of heavy white denim, this full-length overcoat has long sleeves and features large black snaps running along the neck, shoulders, wrists, and down the asymmetrical front panel. This classic, unlined, Howie style lab coat also has an adjustable belt with buckle at the rear provide a comfortable fit. Sizes S/M or L/XL"]'),
