('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-maintz-pattern-gladius-106265-42238139870','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/155/0015148_maintz-pattern-gladius-with-genuine-bone-grip__15503.jpg','["Maintz Pattern Gladius","269.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139870&a=2893129&m=106265","The Roman armys approach to warfare was direct and pragmatic. It chose the gladius as its principal sidearm because it was practical and efficient and excelled in any close combat situation. This is the sword that conquered most of the known world. Originals of our replica were excavated from the ruins of Pompeii. You can see examples in H. Russell Robinsons book What The Soldiers Wore On Hadrians Wall . The early gladius, like this Maintz pattern version, were wasp-waisted with a long point "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-mare-s-leg-holster-belt-106265-42238139969','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/878/0001697_mares-leg-holster-belt__53581.jpg','["Mare''s Leg Holster & Belt","89.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139969&a=2893129&m=106265","The loop lever 1892 was made famous in the TV series Wanted Dead or Alive. This custom-designed holster is made specifically for the Mare''s Leg replica rifle (item # 802132). This all-leather holster includes replica bullets as shown. Fits waist sizes 32\" to 44\". Ships Separately, no Express Shipping available on this item. View more items from DENIX"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-marine-sword-knot-106265-42238139790','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/854/0001220_usmc-sword-knot__48640.jpg','["Marine Sword Knot","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139790&a=2893129&m=106265","This Marine Sword Knot is made to military specifications."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-marto-sword-of-charlemagne-limited-edition-106265-42238140004','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/371/0013417_marto-sword-of-charlemagne-limited-edition__66822.jpg','["Marto Sword of Charlemagne Limited Edition","649.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140004&a=2893129&m=106265","Charlemagne, Charles the Great, King of Franks and Emperor of Western Europe, was born in 742 AD and became a famous commander in one of the great centers of power in history - The Sacred Roman Empire. Charlemagne''s empire was based on the fighting strength of the Franks, a confederation of barbarian tribes from the land of the Rhine in German. An aggressive conqueror, wise politician, statesman, and fortunate General, Charlemagne set the shape of the vast empire that, in a different way, has re"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-mary-rose-commemorative-compass-and-magnifier-106265-42238139893','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/205/0012217_mary-rose-commemorative-compass-and-magnifier__05906.jpg','["Mary Rose Commemorative Compass and Magnifier","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139893&a=2893129&m=106265","A ship of the Tudor Navy, the Mary Rose sailed from 1511-1545 while proudly defending the English against France, Scotland and Brittany. She was a warship for Henry VIII for 34 years and lost on July 19th, 1545. On May 5th, 1971, three of her port frames were discovered by a diver. Excavation began in 1979, and it wasn''t 1982 that the largest surviving part of the ship was raised. There are still significant remains of the Mary Rose still buried in the seabed. This archealogical find is a wonder"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-mash-metal-sign-106265-42238139995','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/748/0011379_mash-metal-sign__27477.jpg','["MASH Metal Sign","18.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139995&a=2893129&m=106265","No other medical sign is more recognizable than that of MASH, the Mobile Army Surgical Hospital. Long before the CBS TV series, this real-life team was saving the lives of our wounded servicemen. Expertly reproduced on this great tin sign, perfect for hanging in home or office. Measures 7-3/4 x 11-3/4"]'),
