('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-medium-clip-point-hunter-blade-106265-42238139764','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/004/0000098_medium-clip-point-hunter-blade__34625.jpg','["Medium Clip Point Hunter Blade","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139764&a=2893129&m=106265","This medium hunting blade has a clip point and is made from hand-forged, high carbon steel. Features integral finger guard, contoured full tang and Rockwells at 45-55. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Overall: 9-3/4\" Blade: 5\" long, 1-1/4\" wide, 1/8\" thick Wt: 7 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-medium-patch-knife-106265-42238139903','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/574/0000371_medium-patch-knife__26506.jpg','["Medium Patch Knife","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139903&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a beautiful little patch knife or skinner for small game. Attractive whether at a reenactment or in the field. Full profile tang, stainless steel. Polished hardwood scales with brass pins. Includes leather belt sheath. Overall: 4-5/8\" Blade: 2-1/8\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-metal-glo-106265-42238139787','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/p/901/0011677_metal-glo__60680.jpg','["Metal Glo","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139787&a=2893129&m=106265","This aluminum oxide polishing paste clean, polishes and protects virtually all metals. Works with a non-abrasive polishing agent to preserve the surfaces of your knives, guns, jewelry, tableware, etc. Removes salt water corrosion, rust, or tarnish. Safe on handle finishes and factory gun bluing. 1.4 oz tube"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-milanese-parade-armored-knight-106265-42238140034','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/904/0012034_milanese-parade-armored-knight__98185.jpg','["Milanese Parade Armored Knight","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140034&a=2893129&m=106265","This beautiful little statue depicts an armored knight in his full Milanese Parade armor. Made of resin, this piece is lavishly painted, giving it all of the beauty of a royal tournament. Approximately 5-1/8\" tall"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-military-dress-frog-black-106265-42238139805','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/706/0000911_military-dress-frog-black__01331.jpg','["Military Dress Frog - Black","17.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139805&a=2893129&m=106265","Top grain, military issue frog matches issue dress belt and securely holds sword at a comfortable reach. Fits all military dress belts. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts®. Also available in white."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-military-dress-frog-white-106265-42238139769','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/227/0000912_military-dress-frog-white__05142.jpg','["Military Dress Frog - White","18.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139769&a=2893129&m=106265","Top grain, military issue frog matches issue dress belt and securely holds sword at a comfortable reach. Fits all military dress belts. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts®. Also available in black."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-mini-metal-knight-w-axe-106265-42238140145','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/406/0012053_mini-metal-knight-w-axe__35466.jpg','["Mini Metal Knight w/ Axe","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140145&a=2893129&m=106265","From the pages of the Canterbury tales comes this beautiful detailed miniature statue depicting an armored medieval knight with an axe. He stands a full 4 tall and has an antique pewter finish. Mini Metal Knight with Flail also available. Measures 4\" tall"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-mini-ulu-106265-42238140123','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/947/404546_h__76915.jpg','["Mini Ulu","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140123&a=2893129&m=106265","A handy modern take on the famous Alaskan Ulu knife, this 4-3/4\" long knife is small enough for trail carry and can be used to cut your camp food. The curved blade is shaped to cut using a rocking motion. The cutting edge is 3-1/2\". Thumb ridges on spine of blade for extra control. Made from wear resistant 3CR13 stainless steel. Only weighs 4 oz. INcludes nylon sheath/blade protector (no belt loop)."]'),
