('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-miniature-ar-15-toy-model-charky-106265-42238140115','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/794/0011703_miniature-ar-15-toy-model-charky__30689.jpg','["Miniature AR-15 Toy Model - Charky","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140115&a=2893129&m=106265","This Miniature AR-15 Toy Model is a 1:3 scale die-cast model. Made in metal, it captures all the detail and feel of an AR-15, and many of the parts function! Features adjustable stock positions, an adjustable sight, the charging handle pulls back, the ejection port opens and closes, the metal mag has a release feature, moveable trigger and select fire switch. Includes silencer, 4x scope, barrel hand guard, 3 non firing brass rounds, flash suppressor, loadable magazine and display stand. These ar"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-miniature-navy-cpo-cutlass-letter-opener-106265-42238139877','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/086/0001759_miniature-navy-cpo-cutlass-letter-opener__85927.jpg','["Miniature Navy CPO Cutlass Letter Opener","74.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139877&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a highly detailed scaled replica of the newly Board approved US Navy CPO Cutlass with blade etchings and metal parts. It even has a full stainless steel blade and matching scabbard (sized accordingly of course)! Finished in real 24K gold, this letter opener makes a great desk top display. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Overall: 10-1/4\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-miniature-wwii-sub-machine-gun-106265-42238140059','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/017/0011699_miniature-wwii-sub-machine-gun__08806.jpg','["Miniature WWII Sub Machine Gun","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140059&a=2893129&m=106265","This Miniature WWII Sub Machine Gun Toy Model is a 1:3 scale die-cast model. Made in metal with an acrylic wood-grain stock, it captures all the detail and feel of the classic Tommy gun, and many of the parts function! Features a functional bolt, closed barrel, moveable trigger and metal magazine with functional mag release. Includes stock, ejection port, barrel, grips, 3 non firing .45 rounds, loadable magazine, moveable trigger and display stand. These are great alternatives to begin teaching "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-mtech-gray-multi-tool-carabiner-knife-106265-42238140045','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/951/0008386_mtech-gray-multi-tool-carabiner-knife__00705.jpg','["MTech Gray Multi-Tool Carabiner Knife","7.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140045&a=2893129&m=106265","This Grey Carabiner Knife from MTech is a heavy duty multi-tool thats a full 5/16\" thick. The satin knife blade has a liner lock with finger grooves for a secure grip. Flat head and Phillips head screwdrivers are placed at the corners for maximum torque. Includes bottle opener and carabiner for key fob attachment. Also available in Blue and Red. View more products from MTech"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-munich-sword-106265-42238139762','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/521/0013130_munich-sword__85223.jpg','["Munich Sword","324.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139762&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 1600 There are several of these swords in different private and public collections, one in the Wallace Collection and several at the Bavarian National Museum. It''s a perfect example of a German military cut-and-thrust swept hilt carried by the Munich Town Guard. The slightly shorter blade and stout hilt were perfect for breaking up a street fight or tavern brawl, as the town guard was often employed to do, and was clearly intended for practical use. One of the most practical and prolific s"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-musketeer-main-gauche-106265-42238140230','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/884/0013959_musketeer-main-gauche__49120.jpg','["Musketeer Main Gauche","159.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140230&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 1590 Carried at the back for a left hand draw, the main gauche was often brought into play with the rapier for a two-handed fighting style. This dagger has cut-outs and notches to slow or disrupt an opponent''s blade, while the hand is well-protected by the knuckle bow. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts and comes factory sharp. Matching rapier available. Can be personalized with 3 Initials. Click here for details on our personalization service and return policy"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-musketeer-rapier-106265-42238140223','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/166/0013974_musketeer-rapier__83364.jpg','["Musketeer Rapier","349.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140223&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 1590 The musket, though the prime weapon of the French Musketeers, was a cumbersome firearm, both to load and fire. A good rapier was a necessary second weapon. Our Musketeer rapier is fashioned after those circa 1590. The basket hilt is ambidextrous and a very effective mix of both the cup-hilt and swept-hilt styles. The grip is wood wrapped with twisted wire and the parts of the hilt are plated with gleaming nickel silver. Matching main gauche available. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts and "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-napoleonic-1st-regiment-grenadier-flag-106265-42238139746','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/854/0001752_napoleonic-1st-regiment-grenadier-flag__81134.jpg','["Napoleonic 1st Regiment Grenadier Flag","49.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139746&a=2893129&m=106265","The Grenadiers of the Guard were the most senior Regiment in Napoleon''s La Grande Armée. They were given the nickname les grognards, \"the grumblers\", by Napoleon himself. Known as the most experienced and brave infantrymen in the Guard. This Napoleonic 1st Regiment Grenadier Flag is an exacting replica of their battle flag; one that would have flown over many victories and possibly on the fateful day at the Battle of Waterloo. This is not a cheap replica, but high quality on a heavy weight cotto"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-natural-stag-obsidian-blade-knife-106265-42238139922','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/d/129/0010684_natural-stag-obsidian-blade-knife__91452.jpg','["Natural Stag Obsidian Blade Knife","69.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139922&a=2893129&m=106265","This Natural Stag Obsidian Blade Knife is handmade by master artist Dale Duby using the methods of old; grinding, abrading, percussion and pressure flaking. Each knife has a primitive style wolf paw etched on one side and is one of a kind. Each of these knives is handcrafted of naturally occurring materials, with as little alteration as possible to preserve its natural beauty. The blades are attached using sinew. Each handle is minimally worked to save most of its original shape, so color, grain"]'),
