('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-new-scabbard-for-bhojpure-kukri-106265-42238139825','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/p/650/0000602_new-scabbard-for-bhojpure-kukri__68640.jpg','["New Scabbard for BhojPure Kukri","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139825&a=2893129&m=106265","This new scabbard fits the \"BhojPure\" kukri knife. The bhojpure kukri is the most common among Nepalese as it is believed to bring good fortune and prosperity. Used for everyday domestic work, it is also used in religious ceremonies. Made of water buffalo hide with a brass tip."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-new-scabbard-for-kukri-knife-106265-42238139885','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/407/0000604_new-scabbard-for-kukri-knife__37671.jpg','["New Scabbard for Kukri Knife","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139885&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a new scabbard for the WWI and WWII style vintage kukris. This style knife was a slightly smaller version of the traditional kukris. Made of water buffalo hide with a brass tip."]'),
