('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ny-insane-asylum-padlock-106265-42238139970','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/428/0007127_ny-insane-asylum-padlock__40877.jpg','["NY Insane Asylum Padlock","12.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139970&a=2893129&m=106265","This NY Insane Asylum Padlock is a rusted, working steel padlock with a brass plaque affixed identifying it as belonging to the asylum. Includes 2 keys. Approximately 2-1/2\" x 1-1/2\"x 3/4\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-off-grid-tools-survival-axe-106265-42238140061','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/811/0011967_off-grid-tools-survival-axe__76957.jpg','["Off Grid Tools Survival Axe","49.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140061&a=2893129&m=106265","This incredible tool is ideal for survivalists, preppers, hikers and anyone who simply likes a do-it-all tool. Sized for easy carry, it can handle some pretty huge tasks. Features blackened, heat treated 420 stainless steel full-tang head plus hex sockets ( 3/8\",7/16\", 1/2\", 9/16\",10mm, 11mm, 13mm, 15mm), backed 1/4\" hex socket, wire twist, nail puller, pry bar, box cutter, can opener, demolition grip teeth, hammer head, and claw, spanner wrench, gas valve wrench, bottle opener, rubberized glass"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-off-grid-tools-trucker-s-friend-106265-42238140167','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/460/0011963_off-grid-tools-truckers-friend__84075.jpg','["Off Grid Tools Trucker''s Friend","84.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140167&a=2893129&m=106265","Off Grid Tools Trucker''s Friend is proudly made in the USA with a limited lifetime warranty. Perfect for truckers, rescue, construction, outdoors, tactical, and preppers. Features rust-inhibiting black oxide coating baked onto the hardened 1055 carbon steel head. Holds a sharp edge that can be re-sharpened in the field. The patented head has a recessed nail puller, wire twist, pry bar, tire chain hook, hammer and fiberglass shaft with shock-absorbing and insulating rubber grip. Truly a good frie"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-officer-s-kepi-colonel-106265-42238140184','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/454/0008517_officers-kepi-colonel__77366.jpg','["Officer''s Kepi - Colonel","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140184&a=2893129&m=106265","These officer''s kepis are made from quality wool. Available in blue for US and grey for CS (CS not shown). Features a leather visor, chin strap with brass buckle and 3 rows of gilt braid. Branch of service pins not included. Available in sizes M, L or XL."]'),
