('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-official-navy-cpo-cutlass-106265-42238140229','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/395/501504_h_new_2022__82543.jpg','["Official Navy CPO Cutlass","374.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140229&a=2893129&m=106265","The new U.S. Navy CPO Cutlass was developed as a joint project with of the U.S. Naval Uniform Board. With three years in the making, it exceeds all specifications as required by the Board. Made with a Toledo Spanish steel blade and heavy gold plating, it exceeds the required specs and sets it apart from all other non-official versions in the market. Features 24K gold plate over solid brass pommel and guard with 11 gold plated rivets. The 26\" blade has proper etchings with the traditional French"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-old-west-pharo-cards-106265-42238140131','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/629/0009387_old-west-pharo-cards__34470.jpg','["Old West Pharo Cards","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140131&a=2893129&m=106265","This complete deck of old-style poker cards with square corners includes 52 cards, period correct replica box, and history card. Approx date 1870. 4\" x 3\" each"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-old-west-wanted-posters-12-sheet-set-106265-42238140186','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/449/0015470_historical-wanted-posters-12-sheet-set__10318.jpg','["Old West Wanted Posters 12 Sheet Set","12.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140186&a=2893129&m=106265","This is the best Wanted Posters Set weve ever offered. The old yellow parchment type paper shows various signs of aging so none look exactly alike. This 12 sheet set features historical Wanted, Reward and Warning announcements featuring the likes of Wyatt Earp, Jesse James, Sam & Belle Starr, the Sundance Kid, Billy the Kid, Butch Cassidy, Sam Bass and Pancho Villa Theres even some comical ones showing us the Old West had humor. Each sheet is 11-3/8\" x 8-3/4\"."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-on-the-move-statue-106265-42238140096','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/031/0012725_on-the-move-statue__14874.jpg','["On The Move Statue","69.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140096&a=2893129&m=106265","This \"On The Move\" statue is highly detailed. The modern soldier is extremely realistic, with accurately sculpted clothing, gear, and weapons. A frozen micro-second of combat permanently captured for your shelf or desk. Made of cold cast resin with an aged bronze finish that feels like metal Overall: 9-3/8 tall, 4-1/2\" wide"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-oss-smatchet-106265-42238139798','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/660/0000310_oss-smatchet__29688.jpg','["OSS Smatchet","149.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139798&a=2893129&m=106265","The odd-looking, but very effective Smatchet was the brainchild of William Fairbairn (who also co-developed the Fairbairn-Sykes Fighting Knife) during WWII for the OSS (Office of Strategic Services) and British SAS (Special Air Service) for use on clandestine missions behind enemy lines. There were many variations in the grip and pommel, but the basic specifications never changed. Our reproduction is based on an original piece loaned to us by a very generous collector (we matched it detail to de"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-outdoor-edge-chowlite-106265-42238139926','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/899/0011681_outdoor-edge-chowlite__13502.jpg','["Outdoor Edge ChowLite","15.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139926&a=2893129&m=106265","Whether you''re living off the grid, trekking through the woods or car camping with all the fixins'', the ChowLite is the multi tool that makes eating easy and convenient, so dig in! Features include a folding design that locks securely, full size fork and spoon with food separator, can and bottle opener, flat head screwdriver. Made from easy to maintain 420 J2 stainless steel. Frame lock. Closed: 4-1/2\" Open: 7-3/4\" Wt: 1.6 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-outdoor-edge-chowpal-106265-42238139894','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/x/034/0011489_outdoor-edge-chowpal__55841.jpg','["Outdoor Edge ChowPal","21.99","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139894&a=2893129&m=106265","Wherever you are and no matter the type of trekking or camping you do, you''ll like this mealtime multi tool that makes eating easy and convenient. Includes folding frame lock knife, fork, spoon, can opener, bottle opener, flat head screwdriver and graduated wrench. The fork interlocks with the knife and spoon for easy storage and slide apart to separate with this ergonomic design. This lightweight, all-in-one utensil set / multi tool is made of 420J2 stainless steel and includes a nylon storage "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ozark-sumac-root-cane-106265-42238139862','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/997/0008856_ozark-sumac-root-cane__06467.jpg','["Ozark Sumac Root Cane","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139862&a=2893129&m=106265","The Ozark Sumac Root Cane is a walking cane with an attitude. Each is made from solid Sumac root and is unique in appearance. Features smooth rough-hewn texture, clear satin finish (looks hand rubbed), removable rubber safety foot, and leather lanyard. The handle is the actual root of the bush. Lightning safe and eco-friendly. Not meant to be used for medical purposes. Approx. 36\" long Wt: 14 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-p-38-soft-shell-holster-german-marked-106265-42238139895','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/427/0001689_p-38-soft-shell-holster-german-marked__34640.jpg','["P-38 Soft Shell Holster German Marked","37.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139895&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a perfect replica of the German Soft Shell P-38 Holster in black leather. Spare magazine pouch and SS Markings duplicated on back. Ideal for re-enactors and collectors. Indistinguishable from the originals, top quality. Also available without markings #802209. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Please note: ACC holds no sympathetic regard toward Nazis, fascists, or other neo-political parties, past or present. This product is intended for historical purposes only."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-pinkerton-detective-agency-badge-106265-42238140046','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/110/0007125_pinkerton-detective-agency-badge__84570.jpg','["Pinkerton Detective Agency Badge","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140046&a=2893129&m=106265","This Pinkerton Detective Agency Badge is a well-made replica from Americas past to complete your history collection. Allan Pinkerton opened his first detective agency office in the 1850s, working with Law Enforcement nationwide to help arrest criminals. By 1855 he was specializing in protecting railroad shipments for several mid-western railways. in 1870, he and his agents became legendary during their relentless pursuit of Jesse James, the Younger Gang, the Dalton Brothers, and Butch Cassidys"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-pirate-captain-cups-106265-42238139758','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/i/467/0012148_pirate-captain-cups__44343.jpg','["Pirate Captain Cups","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139758&a=2893129&m=106265","Made of spun brass and plated inside with silver, these two jiggers are safe for your next toast! Brazed onto each cup is a copper skull and crossbones, for added pirate flare. Includes a beautiful hardwood storage box with brass accents and top plate suitable for engraving. Each cup is sized close to a shot glass. Hand wash. Capacity: 1 oz. Box: 2-1/2\" x 2-3/4\" x 4-1/4\" Cup: 1-7/8\" tall Can be personalized with 3 Initials. Click here for details on our personalization service and return policy"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-pirate-captain-s-hanger-106265-42238140227','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/i/417/0009479_pirate-captains-hanger__93836.jpg','["Pirate Captain''s Hanger","189.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140227&a=2893129&m=106265","The Pirate Captain''s Hanger is made of beautiful antiqued brass and has a steel hilt. The fully tempered high carbon steel blade is worth its salt against any sea beast or while swarming the side of a galley. Your pirate captains costume is incomplete without this hanger. Overall: 32-1/2\" Blade: 26\" long, 1-1/8\" wide, 3/16\" thick Wt: 2 lbs Can be personalized with 3 Initials. Click here for details on our personalization service and return policy. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts and comes factory "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-polyurethane-cosmic-double-glaive-106265-42238140036','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/613/0012667_polyurethane-cosmic-double-glaive__55472.jpg','["Polyurethane Cosmic Double Glaive","22.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140036&a=2893129&m=106265","All the power of the universe in your grasp! This fearsome instrument looks ready to wreak havoc, but it''s actually polyurethane. Firm enough to resist warpage, but soft enough for LARP style mock battle. Expertly hand-painted, the \"blades\" have an aged steel finish. Perfect for cosplay. Overall: 42-1/4\" long Warning: Use common sense and restraint when using any weapon. Although these are foam covered they can still do harm. They are not toys and are intended for prop adult use only. Please use"]'),
