('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-powder-horn-106265-42238139737','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/060/0001786_powder-horn__23366.jpg','["Powder Horn","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139737&a=2893129&m=106265","This powder horn is made from real horn; no two are alike. It can be used by black powder shooters or it looks great hanging above the fireplace with great-grandpas squirrel rifle. Hand carved end cap and spout plug. Natural leather shoulder strap. Average length 12\" with a 2-1?2\" diameter. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-prandi-italy-yankee-axe-106265-42238140118','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/074/0011972_prandi-italy-yankee-axe__83164.jpg','["Prandi Italy Yankee Axe","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140118&a=2893129&m=106265","Hand made since 1969 in Italy by the famed Prandi company. The durable design is taken from common, proven axe designs from America''s past. The thick and strong shaft is genuine USA hickory. The heavy forged, carbon steel head is polished and ready for any chopping chore. The eye has a fitted wedge and reinforcing steel disc for added strength and secureness. Overall: 15\" x 6\" x 1\" Axe face: 3-1/2\" Wt: 2 lbs / 12 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-primitive-scottish-dirk-106265-42238139832','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/965/0012858_primitive-scottish-dirk__19563.jpg','["Primitive Scottish Dirk","119.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139832&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 1500 This early type of dirk evolved from the kidney dagger and was the first step toward the ornate Scottish Dirk we know today. The grip is solid hardwood and the parts are steel. The long high carbon steel blade is flexible and well-tempered. This is a must-have item for the Highlander. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Includes Scabbard. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts and comes factory sharp. Can be personalized with 3 Initials. Click here for details on our personalization service and retur"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-puma-neck-knife-106265-42238140228','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/834/0002229_puma-neck-knife__97070.jpg','["Puma Neck Knife","8.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140228&a=2893129&m=106265","Light and effective, this Puma neck knife is the perfect companion and back-up knife. Cats claws are always ready to defend. Features strong, full profile tang construction of 400 series stainless steel and semi serrated blade. Tough plastic molded sheath with boot clip for multiple carry options. Cougar also available. Overall: 7 Blade: 3\" View more products from Master Cutlery"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-railroad-spike-bottle-opener-106265-42238140019','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/000/0009121_railroad-spike-bottle-opener__22167.jpg','["Railroad Spike Bottle Opener","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140019&a=2893129&m=106265","This metal alloy Railroad Spike Bottle Opener was cast from an original (which are getting hard to find)and it has the look and feel of aged iron. We don''t know about working on the railroad, but this could sure help you relax around it. Approximately 6-1/2\" long."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-railroad-spike-cleaver-106265-42238139879','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/898/0011014_railroad-spike-cleaver__80226.jpg','["Railroad Spike Cleaver","26.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139879&a=2893129&m=106265","This knife is made from 1065 steel with a rough forged finish. One-piece construction, so no loose parts, just a fully functional, interesting knife that gets attention. Hard-working and surprisingly comfortable with an attractive twisted handle. Includes leather belt sheath. Railroad spike gladius dagger, dagger, and clip point knives also available. Overall: 9-1/2\" Blade: 4-1/2\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-railroad-spike-dagger-106265-42238139923','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/743/0011005_railroad-spike-dagger__02624.jpg','["Railroad Spike Dagger","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139923&a=2893129&m=106265","This knife is made from 1065 steel with a rough forged finish. One-piece construction, so no loose parts, just a fully functional, interesting knife that gets attention. Hard-working and surprisingly comfortable with an attractive twisted handle. Includes leather belt sheath. Railroad spike cleaver, gladius dagger, and clip point knives are also available. Overall: 12\" Blade: 6-1/2\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-red-damascus-katana-106265-42238140078','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/541/0000866_red-damascus-katana__20668.jpg','["Red Damascus Katana","179.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140078&a=2893129&m=106265","This red Damascus katana is eye catching and one of the most attractive katanas weve seen in a while. Features a very unique and, dare we say, stylish Damascus steel blade that has been colored a stunning coppery red color. Features real ray skin grip and traditional cotton wrap with antique metal parts. Tsuba is solid metal, looks like old iron and has two distinct pictures of nature on each side accented with gold and silver. Includes wooden, lacquered saya and cotton sword bag. Overall: 39\" "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-replica-brass-constable-whistle-106265-42238139939','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/321/0009498_replica-brass-constable-whistle__78202.jpg','["Replica Brass Constable Whistle","8.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139939&a=2893129&m=106265","This full size, solid brass whistle is fully functional and is a hand aged replica of those issued to Constables in the 1920''s to 1940''s. Reads \"CONSTABLE\" on one side with a raised lawman''s star on the other."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-rms-titanic-portable-compass-106265-42238139826','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/174/0009295_rms-titanic-portable-compass__91131.jpg','["RMS Titanic Portable Compass","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139826&a=2893129&m=106265","This solid brass, replica working compass from the White Star Line is engraved under the cover to Captain Edward John Smith. Overall: 2-1/2\" diameter, 3/4\" tall For over 70 years Windlass has been a trusted name in historically accurate replicas from the past including arms and armor. An ISO-9001:2015 certified company, they are a trusted source throughout the world. Windlass Nautical celebrates our nautical past by recreating historically significant sea going instruments in wonderful detail. W"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-roman-centurion-gladius-106265-42238139860','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/935/0013204_roman-centurion-gladius__45798.jpg','["Roman Centurion Gladius","244.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139860&a=2893129&m=106265","This beautiful Centurion gladius has a hand forged and tempered high carbon steel blade; it is truly worthy of a Roman officer. All antiqued parts are meticulously hand finished of solid wood with metal accents to complete this regal piece. Features a baldric with a custom wood scabbard wrapped in leather and accented with real metal detail. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts and comes factory sharp."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-roper-razor-106265-42238140148','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/851/0011851_roper-razor__33014.jpg','["Roper Razor","49.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140148&a=2893129&m=106265","The Roper Razor is a rugged and super sharp pal in the field or on the job. Features a long, full tang, fixed coping blade made from super tough D2 tool steel. The blaze orange G10 scales ensures you won''t lose this in low light. Includes black leather belt sheath. A comfortable knife that likes the rough stuff. Overall: 7\" Blade: 2-3/4\" View more Roper Cattleman Knives"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-round-horn-bowl-106265-42238139732','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/636/0008743_round-horn-bowl__85148.jpg','["Round Horn Bowl","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139732&a=2893129&m=106265","Perfect for the themed dinner at home, feasting at an event, or camping at a historic reenactment, this Horn Bowl displays a unique color and pattern. Made of a real natural horn, this round bowl makes a statement for every Viking and Medieval settings. Horn plate and horn bowl and plate set also available. Please Note: Due to the natural material the color and pattern may vary."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-round-horn-bowls-large-set-of-4-106265-42238139797','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/240/0013822_round-horn-bowls-large-set-of-4__15258.jpg','["Round Horn Bowls - Large - Set of 4","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139797&a=2893129&m=106265","These beautiful round bowls are is made of ethically sourced horn and make a statement whether you are entertaining or feasting at an event. Perfect for Viking and Medieval settings! Save over 20% from buying separately. Horn plate and horn bowl and plate set also available. Please Note: Due to the natural material the color and pattern may vary."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-round-horn-plate-106265-42238139765','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/x/203/0008742_round-horn-plate__61653.jpg','["Round Horn Plate","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139765&a=2893129&m=106265","Ever dreamt of going back in time and attending a real medieval feast or banquet? Recreate the look of those dinners at your own table with this Horn Plate, perfect for Viking and Medieval settings. This beautiful round plate is made of real natural horn and makes a statement whether you are entertaining or feasting at an event. Horn bowl and horn bowl and plate set also available. Please Note: Due to the natural material the color and pattern may vary."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-royal-navy-compass-1920-106265-42238139735','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/d/399/0009291_royal-navy-compass-1920__83024.jpg','["Royal Navy Compass 1920","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139735&a=2893129&m=106265","This stunning Royal Navy Compass is made from brass. The replica compass can be removed from the solid hardwood case. An accurate and elegant nautical treasure. Box Measures 4-1/2\" x 3-1/2\" x 1-1/2\" For over 70 years Windlass has been a trusted name in historically accurate replicas from the past including arms and armor. An ISO-9001:2015 certified company, they are a trusted source throughout the world. Windlass Nautical celebrates our nautical past by recreating historically significant sea go"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-rubber-trainer-black-bear-classic-106265-42238139971','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/276/0002247_rubber-trainer-black-bear-classic__90817.jpg','["Rubber Trainer Black Bear Classic","10.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139971&a=2893129&m=106265","Now you can practice with popular knife designs, in relative safety, with Cold Steel''s rubber training knives. Carefully fashioned to look as realistic as possible so it can be effectively used in solo practice, training drills, disarm drills and demonstrations and any other activity where you want a reasonably close approximation of realism but not the extreme danger and risk associated with an actual knife. The Santoprene rubber blade is soft enough to prevent the likelihood of most bodily inj"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-rum-storage-triple-layered-face-mask-106265-42238139874','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/517/0013914_rum-storage-triple-layered-face-mask__72912.jpg','["Rum Storage Triple Layered Face Mask","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139874&a=2893129&m=106265","This Rum Storage face mask is lightweight, breathable, and stylishly designed with everyday work in mind. Made of 100% cotton with silk thread embroidery, it is multi-layered and has a sleeve so you can slide an additional disposable filter into the pocket if desired. The one size fits all construction, combined with adjustable elastic straps behind each ear, provides a snug fit. It even fits well over beards! Machine washable. Note: These masks are not graded for medical use."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sacred-sword-of-the-prophet-106265-42238140218','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/l/054/0013143_sacred-sword-of-the-prophet__88797.jpg','["Sacred Sword of the Prophet","4994.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140218&a=2893129&m=106265","Muhammad ibn Abdullah, the great figure of the Islamic faith, is regarded by Muslims as the messenger and prophet of God and among the many great deeds and traits were those of the cunning mind of a military general. His sword is a symbol of his majesty and importance. His followers cherished every aspect of his life from teachings to physical possessions including his sword so it would be passed on to future generations and we are delighted they did. The sacred relics in the treasury in Alexan"]'),
