('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-scalawag-tricorn-hat-106265-42238139918','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/438/0000213_scalawag-tricorn-hat__06030.jpg','["Scalawag Tricorn Hat","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139918&a=2893129&m=106265","These sturdy pirate tricorn hats are made of 100% polyester which has been textured to look like weathered suede. Two of the three sides have x straps sewn on. There is an elasticized strap around the perimeter of the inside allowing for a easy fit for most head sizes. Order midnight black or classic brown."]'),
