('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-serpent-s-tongue-damascus-sword-106265-42238140093','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/890/0012274_serpents-tongue-damascus-sword__44474.jpg','["Serpent''s Tongue Damascus Sword","129.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140093&a=2893129&m=106265","Forged in the flames of some mythical blacksmith''s shop in the heart of a dark forest that only appears to humans every 100 years? Nope, but this sword''s close enough. Expertly crafted of Damascus steel by hardworking real smiths, the blade has a \"flame\" profile that would inspire any hero from the annals of legendary fiction and myth. The handcrafted grip is made from wood and bone, embellished with brass pins and spacers. The guard is artistically assembled with layers of stainless steel, bras"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-set-of-3-old-west-wanted-poster-koolies-106265-42238140025','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/d/079/0010859_set-of-3-old-west-wanted-poster-koolies__41741.jpg','["Set of 3 Old West Wanted Poster Koolies","13.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140025&a=2893129&m=106265","This set of 3 koolies feature Wyatt Earp, Billy the Kid and Doc Holiday. Fake bullet holes are on these \"aged\" items along with great graphics and short history of the infamous outlaws. Stitched neoprene, they fit all standard size drinking cans."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-set-of-3-old-west-wanted-poster-mugs-106265-42238140161','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/400/0011153_set-of-3-old-west-wanted-poster-mugs__50789.jpg','["Set of 3 Old West Wanted Poster Mugs","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140161&a=2893129&m=106265","This set of 3 ceramic mugs feature Wyatt Earp, Billy the Kid and Doc Holiday. Fake bullet holes are on these \"aged\" items along with great graphics and the short history of the infamous outlaws. Not safe for the dishwasher or microwave. Capacity: 15 oz each."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-set-of-3-old-west-wanted-poster-shot-glasses-106265-42238140050','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/568/0010753_set-of-3-old-west-wanted-poster-shot-glasses__93453.jpg','["Set of 3 Old West Wanted Poster Shot Glasses","13.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140050&a=2893129&m=106265","This set of 3 shot glasses feature Doc Holiday, Billy the Kid and Wyatt Earp. Fake bullet holes are on these \"aged\" items along with great graphics and the short history of the infamous outlaws. Made of glass, not safe for dishwasher or microwave. Capacity: approximately 1-1/2 oz each."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-set-of-3-triple-layered-face-masks-106265-42238140007','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/484/0013904_set-of-3-triple-layered-face-masks__86335.jpg','["Set of 3 Triple Layered Face Masks","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140007&a=2893129&m=106265","In this set of 3 face masks you will get our Viking Valknut, Crusader Shield, and Rum Storage masks. They are lightweight, breathable, and stylishly designed with everyday work in mind. Made of 100% cotton with silk thread embroidery, they are multi-layered and have a sleeve so you can slide an additional disposable filter into the pocket if desired. The one size fits all construction, combined with adjustable elastic straps behind each ear, provides a snug fit. It even fits well over beards! Ma"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-set-of-6-medium-agate-arrowheads-106265-42238139781','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/716/0008990_set-of-6-medium-agate-arrowheads__18577.jpg','["Set of 6 Medium Agate Arrowheads","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139781&a=2893129&m=106265","Agate has been used for over 3000 years and examples can be found from ancient times to the forming of America. These were a perfect size for arrowheads when hunting small to medium size game and today make interesting jewelry. This set of six will vary in size from 1- 3/4\" to approximately 2-1/4\" long and all sizes in between. These are modern, handmade agate heads. Due to the hand carving process and natural occurring variance in the stone, no two will ever be alike."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-set-of-6-small-agate-arrowheads-106265-42238139822','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/i/025/0008991_set-of-6-small-agate-arrowheads__47230.jpg','["Set of 6 Small Agate Arrowheads","7.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139822&a=2893129&m=106265","Agate has been used for over 3000 years and examples can be found from ancient times to the forming of America. These were a perfect size for arrowheads when hunting small game and today make interesting jewelry. This set of six will vary in size from 1-1/4\" to approximately 2\" long and all sizes in between. These are modern, handmade agate heads. Due to the hand carving process and natural occurring variance in the stone, no two will ever be alike."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sheath-for-delta-dart-106265-42238140219','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/521/0000618_sheath-for-delta-dart__47415.jpg','["Sheath for Delta Dart","6.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140219&a=2893129&m=106265","This ConcealEx sheath fits the Cold Steel Delta Dart."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sheath-for-perfect-balance-thrower-106265-42238140079','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/537/0000615_sheath-for-perfect-balance-thrower__51898.jpg','["Sheath for Perfect Balance Thrower","12.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140079&a=2893129&m=106265","This plastic sheath fits the Cold Steel Perfect Balance Thrower."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sheath-for-special-forces-shovel-106265-42238139920','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/443/0000622_sheath-for-special-forces-shovel__24387.jpg','["Sheath for Special Forces Shovel","8.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139920&a=2893129&m=106265","This Cor-Ex sheath fits the Cold Steel Special Forces Shovel. It features an extra wide belt loop."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sherman-tank-metal-model-106265-42238140137','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/939/0010706_sherman-tank-metal-model__72697.jpg','["Sherman Tank Metal Model","10.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140137&a=2893129&m=106265","The primary tank used by the US during WWII, it was named after Union General William Tecumseh Sherman. Over 50,000 were made for the war effort, the second most throughout the war. It''s mobility, reliability and sheer numbers helped offset any disadvantage it was up against. This pocket sized, laser cut model is an all stainless steel and assembled from two laser cut sheets. No glue needed. Moderate difficulty level. 2.89\" x 1.37\" x 1.33\"."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-short-handle-felling-axe-106265-42238139749','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/514/0012895_short-handle-felling-axe__25844.jpg','["Short Handle Felling Axe","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139749&a=2893129&m=106265","This Short Handle Felling Axe from Tata Agrico has a drop forged 1055 high carbon steel blade suited for cutting down trees and chopping. The tapered cutting edge ensures cutting efficiency & longer life to the axe. Features an American hickory handle. Axe head weighs 3-1/2 lbs. Also available with extra short handle. Overall: 31\" long Axe head: 8\" long with 4\" cutting edge Wt: 5 lbs"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-silver-and-gold-claymore-by-marto-106265-42238139872','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/390/0013339_silver-and-gold-claymore-by-marto__06021.jpg','["Silver and Gold Claymore by Marto","449.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139872&a=2893129&m=106265","This Scottish Claymore is a variant of the medieval two handed sword and was the typical weapon of the Highland warriors from the 15th to 17th centuries. A Scottish symbol of national pride, claymores were more a rough tool than a weapon but no-less effective when wielded properly. The name comes from the Gaelic term \"claidheamh mòr\" meaning \"great sword and are characterized as having a cross hilt of forward-sloping quillons with quatrefoil ends. This beautiful ornate replica from Marto of Spa"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-silver-and-gold-excalibur-by-marto-106265-42238139854','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/980/0013355_silver-and-gold-excalibur-by-marto__42349.jpg','["Silver and Gold Excalibur by Marto","349.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139854&a=2893129&m=106265","Legend and history were mixed through time and King Arthurs legend, The Knights of the Round Table and the magic sword Excalibur have intertwined along the way. Merlin the wizard proclaimed only the one able to take the sword out of the stone would be the king. Arthur knelt in front of the stone, fulfilled this deed and took the sword, taking it to the cathedral to offer. Arthur was anointed with the Sacred Oil and, in presence of all the barons and common people, he solemnly swore to be a fair"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sitting-bull-bust-statue-106265-42238140080','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/049/0009015_sitting-bull-bust-statue__91005.jpg','["Sitting Bull Bust Statue","78.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140080&a=2893129&m=106265","This bust shows a brave, strong, resolute and regal pose of Sitting Bull from 1880 is captured in cold cast resin and then plated in a bronze finish for a metal look and feel. A must for any American history collection."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-skinner-diy-knife-kit-106265-42238140028','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/672/0011364_skinner-diy-knife-kit__32610.jpg','["Skinner DIY Knife Kit","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140028&a=2893129&m=106265","If you''re a do-it-yourselfer, love to be unique, and want to completely stand out with your cutlery choices, this kit is for you. This intermediate skill level kit includes all the basics to make a fully functional and beautiful knife - hardwood handle material, solid brass parts, a real leather sheath blank and high grade stainless steel knife blade. It also includes a leather needle and thread to stitch the leather, a sheath rivet and plastic inner sleeve reinforcement. Instructions included. "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-skinner-file-knife-106265-42238139933','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/757/0000406_skinner-file-knife__26783.jpg','["Skinner File Knife","16.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139933&a=2893129&m=106265","These skinner knives are made from high carbon files and have full profile tangs with multi color Dymondwood scales. This is functional art for the workman. Each includes a leather, frontier style belt sheath. Theyre tough as nails, well, files anyway. Utility knife also available. Overall: 7-5/8\" Blade: 3-1/8\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-slitzer-germany-kitchen-knife-set-106265-42238139986','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/864/0001159_slitzer-germany-kitchen-knife-set__01236.jpg','["Slitzer Germany Kitchen Knife Set","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139986&a=2893129&m=106265","This great pair of work knives for your culinary masterpieces. They are made from Rostfrei stainless steel with phenolic scales for overall comfort and easy care. Combo consists of a 8 all purpose chopping knife and 8\" slicing knife, making the set capable of tackling just about every kitchen function at a great low price. Each piece is 13\" in overall length. This high quality set is normally $60! Great for your home or as a lasting gift for that chef in your life. Set comes in a gift box. Desi"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-small-hunter-blade-106265-42238139816','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/013/0000096_small-hunter-blade__45067.jpg','["Small Hunter Blade","13.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139816&a=2893129&m=106265","This blade is hand-forged and tempered with 1085 high carbon steel for a hard-working and dependable blade. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Overall: 8-5/8\" Blade: 5\" long, 1/8\" thick Can be personalized with 3 Initials. Click here for details on our personalization service and return policy."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-small-strop-106265-42238140132','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/469/0001839_small-strop__17080.jpg','["Small Strop","12.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140132&a=2893129&m=106265","Fine tune your edge with this small strop. Razor strops are a traditional way to polish and hone thinner blades like straight razors, pocket knives and kitchen knives. This strop has two sides, one leather and the other canvas, with leather trim and solid metal parts. Large strop also available. Overall: 19-1/2\" long, 1-1/2\" wide"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-solid-copper-coffee-can-106265-42238139823','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/086/0010818_solid-copper-coffee-can__41425.jpg','["Solid Copper Coffee Can","59.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139823&a=2893129&m=106265","This Coffee Can is perfect for your re-enactment or camp excursions. The all-copper can has a tightly fitting, folding lid and is lined in tin. Exposed solder marks enhance the rustic look. Great for emergency preparedness kits too! Dimensions: 4-1/2\" tall, 4-/2\" diameter Height with handle up: 10\" Capacity: 24 oz."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-solid-copper-cs-soup-mug-106265-42238139791','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/541/0001987_solid-copper-cs-soup-mug__15161.jpg','["Solid Copper CS Soup Mug","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139791&a=2893129&m=106265","These mugs are favored by many re-enactors because they keep drinks, soups or stews hot longer. Great for camping trips too because they dont break. Made in solid copper with a 1 piece, heavy-duty body. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Same as 730019 Solid Copper Soup Mug but engraved CS. Can also be personalized with 3 Initials. Also available engraved with US. Overall: 4\" tall, 4\" diameter Capacity: 24 oz. Click here for details on our personalization service and return policy"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-solid-copper-soup-mug-106265-42238139756','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/t/072/0001988_solid-copper-soup-mug__27877.jpg','["Solid Copper Soup Mug","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139756&a=2893129&m=106265","These solid copper soup mugs are favored by many re-enactors because they keep drinks, soups and stews hot longer. Great for camping trips too because they dont break. 1 piece heavy-duty body. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Also available engraved US or CS. Overall: 4\" tall, 4\" diameter Capacity: 24 oz. Can be personalized with 3 Initials. Click here for details on our personalization service and return policy"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-solid-copper-us-soup-mug-106265-42238139800','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/997/0001986_solid-copper-us-soup-mug__55943.jpg','["Solid Copper US Soup Mug","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139800&a=2893129&m=106265","These mugs are favored by many re-enactors because they keep drinks, soups or stews hot longer. Great for camping trips too because they dont break. Made in solid copper with a 1 piece, heavy-duty body. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Same as 730019 Solid Copper Soup Mug but engraved US. Can also be personalized with 3 Initials. Also available engraved with CS. Overall: 4\" tall, 4\" diameter Capacity: 24 oz. Click here for details on our personalization service and return policy"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-special-forces-shovel-106265-42238139857','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/p/667/0000709_special-forces-shovel__35404.jpg','["Special Forces Shovel","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139857&a=2893129&m=106265","The Special Forces Shovel is modeled after the original Soviet Spetznaz shovel. The Spetznaz soldiers made up the most elite unit in the Soviet Army. The U.S. equivalent would be our Green Berets. The shovel head and socket are forged from medium carbon steel, then heat treated for maximum strength. The edges come sharpened to a utility / axe edge that can easily be improved to razor sharpness. Sheath available separately. Overall Length: 19.68\" Wt: 26.6 oz View more Cold Steel products"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-springfield-1903-1903-a3-accessory-kit-106265-42238139839','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/357/0012453_springfield-1903-1903a3-accessory-kit__81084.jpg','["Springfield 1903 1903/A3 Accessory Kit","27.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139839&a=2893129&m=106265","This is an assembly kit for a Springfield 1903 and 1903/A3. New and never issued, the kit includes a blued steel front sight cover, Parkerized steel takedown tool, and pull-through thong cleaning tool."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-ss-pistol-belt-buckle-106265-42238139814','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/002/0001230_ss-pistol-belt-buckle__74230.jpg','["SS Pistol Belt & Buckle","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139814&a=2893129&m=106265","This SS Belt has been reproduced in exacting detail for the collector. The SS black leather pistol belt is 1-3/4\" wide, has a silver looking buckle and adjusts to fit waists up to 44\". Please note: ACC holds no sympathetic regard toward Nazis, fascists, or other neo-political parties, past or present. This product is intended for historical purposes only."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-staff-of-gandalf-the-grey-106265-42238139889','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/974/0012443_staff-of-gandalf-the-grey__91358.jpg','["Staff Of Gandalf The Grey","199.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139889&a=2893129&m=106265","From The Hobbit film series, this Staff of Gandalf the Grey is an authentic replica of the movie prop. Cast in polyresin with authentic details and coloring, the polyresin pipe and spike are removable. Includes a poly stone wall display that matches the design of United''s other staff replicas from The Hobbit. Individually serial numbered. Overall: 69\" View more items from The Lord of the Rings View more products from United Cutlery"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sword-knot-officers-gold-106265-42238139741','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/391/0001219_sword-knot-officers-gold__65785.jpg','["Sword Knot, Officers, Gold","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139741&a=2893129&m=106265","This Gold Officers Sword Knot is made to military specifications."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sword-of-alexander-the-great-limited-edition-106265-42238140124','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/782/0013400_sword-of-alexander-the-great-limited-edition__80712.jpg','["Sword of Alexander the Great Limited Edition","694.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140124&a=2893129&m=106265","Alexander III of Macedonia is considered to be the greatest political figure of antiquity, a great military strategist and creator of a work of great cultural importance. This limited edition Sword of Alexander the great pays tribute to this great King and warrior. This highly collectible piece has a 24K gold plated hilt and simulated ivory handle with finely detailed red-toned engraved scrollwork surrounding faux ruby jewels. The sword''s handle is finished off with a magnificent snarling antiqu"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sword-of-edward-of-woodstock-the-black-prince-106265-42238139927','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/932/0013324_sword-of-edward-of-woodstock-the-black-prince__79089.jpg','["Sword of Edward of Woodstock - The Black Prince","449.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139927&a=2893129&m=106265","This Royal Sword of Edward of Woodstock, the Black Prince is from Marto of Spain. This beautiful replica has a fully tempered AISI 440 stainless steel blade with a fuller groove and etched with the words Eduardo de Woodstock. The Zamak grip is wire wrapped blue suede. The sculpted cast metal cross guard is engraved with medieval designs and like the wheel pommel and fittings have an antiqued silver plated finish. The pommel features an intricate three dimensional animal head. Decorative use only"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sword-of-king-solomon-by-marto-106265-42238139910','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/748/0013290_sword-of-king-solomon-by-marto__24290.jpg','["Sword of King Solomon by Marto","449.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139910&a=2893129&m=106265","This King Solomon Sword was crafted in honor of the King of Israel and the son of David. This highly detailed sword is made in Spain by Marto. The beautiful details feature engravings of the Star of David and the Ark of the Covenant. This historical and ceremonial sword has an unsharpened blade. The beautiful mirror polished blade is made of 420-stainless steel and bears a decorative etching. The cross guard, pommel and the fittings of the King Solomon Swords are made of sculpted antique silver-"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sword-of-rome-gladius-106265-42238139941','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/745/0013262_sword-of-rome-gladius__79438.jpg','["Sword of Rome Gladius","349.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139941&a=2893129&m=106265","Intricate etch-work patterns dress the blade, which is of 420 stainless steel and mirror polished. Forged with Martos world-renown quality, the Sword of Rome gladius is a worthy and popular addition to any sword enthusiasts collection. Decorative use: intended for wall decor, displays, home or office decor or for costume. For a limited time get the matching letter opener FREE WITH PURCHASE. View more products from Marto"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-sword-of-strider-with-display-plaque-106265-42238139859','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/472/0012428_sword-of-strider-with-display-plaque__64302.jpg','["Sword of Strider with Display Plaque","249.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139859&a=2893129&m=106265","From the Lord of the Rings Trilogy, this officially licensed prop replica from United Cutlery is made using only the finest grade materials and craftsmanship. The Hadhafang Sword of Arwen Evenstar features a solid metal pommel with a wooden handgrip with an Elven vine design. The 420 stainless steel blade has a sharp edge. Includes a wooden display stand and Certificate of Authenticity. View more items from The Lord of the Rings View more products from United Cutlery It is important to note when"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-tactical-katana-machete-106265-42238139972','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/362/0007165_tactical-katana-machete__17474.jpg','["Tactical Katana Machete","54.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139972&a=2893129&m=106265","With its deeply curved blade, Cold Steel''s Tactical Katana Machete offers more sword-like cutting performance. And with its broad full tang, solid steel tsuba and injection over-molded high impact polymer handle, its incredibly durable. Features the look of a traditional cord-wrapped handle and fuchi kashira but with modern materials that will not shrink, warp, tarnish or rot and require very little maintenance. Comes factory sharp and with a Cor-Ex sheath for carry and storage. View more Col"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-talwar-106265-42238140021','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/221/0012710_talwar__17217.jpg','["Talwar","249.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140021&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a beautiful, sturdy and highly effective take on the classic saber used throughout India. The guard locks your hand in place for high flying maneuvers typical of the Indian fighting style. Light enough for wicked fast moves, the sturdy design can take on larger blades with ease. 1090 high carbon steel blade, leather scabbard w/ brass fittings. Overall: 39\" Blade: 33\" Wt: 3 lbs / 3 oz View more Cold Steel products"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-templar-flag-106265-42238139840','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/845/0010671_templar-flag__05432.jpg','["Templar Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139840&a=2893129&m=106265","The five-cross Templar flag has been used since at least the 13th century. The central element of the flag is St. George''s cross (still used as the national flag of England), who is the patron saint of Georgia. The design was adopted as a variant of the Jerusalem cross, a symbol used by crusaders in the Holy Land, which likewise used a large central cross with four smaller crosses of the Templars in the four quadrants. The crosses of the Templar flag are said to have represented the five Holy Wo"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-templar-knight-triple-layered-face-mask-106265-42238139848','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/313/0013908_templar-knight-triple-layered-face-mask__65904.jpg','["Templar Knight Triple Layered Face Mask","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139848&a=2893129&m=106265","Let this fantasy Templar knight guard the narrow passageways (your nose holes) to your inner sanctum (your lungs!) from the evil intruders floating around in the air. This 100% cotton face mask has a screen printed image on front with 3 layers and is lightweight and breathable. Disposable filters may be easily inserted for extra protection. The one size fits all construction, combined with adjustable elastic straps behind each ear, provides a snug fit. It even fits well over beards! Machine wash"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-templar-s-sword-106265-42238139898','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/903/0013276_templars-sword__73932.jpg','["Templar''s Sword","449.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139898&a=2893129&m=106265","This Templar''s Sword is made to honor the religious order of the Templar Knights. These ancient medieval knights were tasked with protecting travelers on pilgrimage and the Christian way of life. Features the symbol of the Order of the Knight Templar in the rounded pommel. The wheel pommel, guard and all the fittings are crafted of antique silver-plated cast metal. The unsharpened blade is made of tempered 420 stainless steel with an extremely shiny mirror polish. The blade features black colore"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-texas-dragoons-saber-106265-42238139951','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/o/001/0012117_texas-dragoons-saber__60217.jpg','["Texas Dragoons Saber","239.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139951&a=2893129&m=106265","This is an authentic replica of the highest caliber. A rare chance to own a unique piece of US wartime history. In 1836 Texas, having won its independence from Mexico, formed the Republic of Texas. In 1839, the Texas Government contracted with Ames Mfg. Co. for 280 M1833 Texas Dragoon Sabers. Our replica saber has a well-tempered, full-tang 1065 high carbon steel blade. The black leather grip is wrapped with twisted brass wire. These are exactly like the M1833 US Dragoon Sabers except for the "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-texas-rangers-badge-106265-42238139904','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/l/051/0007639_texas-rangers-badge__41559.jpg','["Texas Rangers Badge","5.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139904&a=2893129&m=106265","This Texas Rangers Badge is a well-made replica from Americas past to complete your history collection. The full size metal badge is hand made from double die struck solid copper with a brass finish and aged to be accurate to the originals. A heavy pin is on back for attaching to the thick clothing of the era. Each is properly dished and deeply engraved. Approximately 3-1/2\" x 3\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-the-accolade-dagger-of-the-knights-templar-106265-42238140220','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/677/0010055_the-accolade-dagger-of-the-knights-templar__97818.jpg','["The Accolade Dagger of the Knights Templar","179.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140220&a=2893129&m=106265","This striking medieval dagger is the matching companion piece to our Accolade sword. The high carbon steel blade has the seal of the Knights Templar on the ricasso, while the pommel has an inlaid cross. All hardware on the crossguard and pommel have been plated in sterling silver, while the grip has been bound in soft leather with a wire wrapping. The leather sheath has been adorned with two silver-plated crosses, has a leather thong for securing your dagger handle and a loop large enough to fit"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-the-book-of-swords-paperback-by-hank-reinhardt-106265-42238139913','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/625/0000600_the-book-of-swords-paperback-by-hank-reinhardt__08262.jpg','["\"The Book of Swords\" Paperback By Hank Reinhardt","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139913&a=2893129&m=106265","One of the most illuminating books ever written about swords and their use. Museum Replicas Limited founder, Hank Reinhardt, spent an entire lifetime studying every aspect of swords  their use, construction, culture, myths, and history. Decades of performing (and enjoying) hands-on research and 10 years of writing went into this collection of hard facts and colorful, historical anecdotes regarding the most revered weapon of all time. Also includes sections on the forms and functions of other bl"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-the-christus-imperat-rapier-106265-42238140039','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/x/649/0013451_the-christus-imperat-rapier__99822.jpg','["The Christus Imperat Rapier","349.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140039&a=2893129&m=106265","A rapier of this identical form and proportions is currently housed in The Royal Armouries (formerly the Tower of London). The flamboyantly formed hilt is both beautiful and functional. Its forward plates are pierced and show lavish birds among the foliage, while the bars of the guard are slender both defending the hand and having an upward loop to catch an opponents blade. The heavy pommel allows for a more balanced feel for fighting. The blade is etched on both sides of the ricasso with the L"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-the-hobbit-morgul-dagger-blade-of-nazgul-106265-42238139887','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/044/0012420_the-hobbit-morgul-dagger-blade-of-nazgul__33328.jpg','["The Hobbit: Morgul Dagger Blade of Nazgul","146.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139887&a=2893129&m=106265","From The Hobbit film series, this officially licensed Morgul Dagger Blade of Nazgul is a reproduction from the actual filming prop. United Cutlery has made the Morgul blade using stainless AUS-6 steel blade, solid metal hilt parts, and a leather-wrapped grip, all authentically aged and battle worn with a distressed, acid-etched finish. It is presented with a wooden wall display (mounting hardware and instructions included) featuring a graphic motif of the Witch-king crown and includes a Cert"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-the-sword-excalibur-106265-42238140151','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/759/0013652_the-sword-excalibur__83160.jpg','["The Sword Excalibur","349.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140151&a=2893129&m=106265","No other sword in the annals of literature has been more renowned than the legendary Excalibur. This magical blade sealed young Arthur Pendragons lineage to the throne of England. Our version is designed from the stories of Camelot, from the time of the author, Sir Thomas Malory. The blade is high-carbon steel, made by the master smiths of Windlass Steelcrafts. The metal fittings have an antique finish and emulate the flowers of a new spring. The two-handed grip, as well as the wooden scabbard,"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-thompson-saber-106265-42238140047','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/d/022/0001126_thompson-saber__38183.jpg','["Thompson Saber","249.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140047&a=2893129&m=106265","The Thompson Saber is not a historical or period-specific sword, rather it is a newly developed, thoroughly modern fighting saber. Designed by Cold Steel President Lynn C Thompson to be a fighter''s sword for the modern martial artist. \"I believe that the edge is superior to the point when facing multiple opponents.\" Therefore, while it does thrust well, the Thompson Saber is a cutting tool first and foremost, on foot or horseback. Hair shaving sharp for the first six inches from the point, then "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-tombstone-az-sheriff-badge-106265-42238139934','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/295/0007640_tombstone-az-sheriff-badge__06047.jpg','["Tombstone AZ Sheriff Badge","5.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139934&a=2893129&m=106265","This Tombstone Sheriff''s Badge is a well-made replica from Americas past to complete your Old West collection. In 1881, the infamous Shoot-Out at the O.K. Corral occurred in the Arizona Territory of Tombstone and Sheriff John Behan wore a badge very much like this one. The full-size metal badge is hand made from double die-struck solid copper with a brass finish and aged to be accurate to the originals. A heavy pin is on the back for attaching to the thick clothing of the era. Each is properly "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-trainer-bokken-wakizashi-106265-42238139988','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/143/0000830_trainer-bokken-wakizashi__72579.jpg','["Trainer Bokken Wakizashi","34.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139988&a=2893129&m=106265","To go from merely a good swordsman to a great one required practice and a lot of it. To do this safely the Japanese used wooden training swords called bokkens. Although still used effectively today they could split, crack, splinter and warp if the elements or training overburdened the wood, which could be expensive. Cold Steel has come up with a great alternative using the heaviest commercial grade polypropylene available they found that could mimic the size, weight and feel of a real sword with"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-treasure-is-where-you-find-it-hardcover-book-106265-42238139728','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/536/0000590_treasure-is-where-you-find-it-hardcover-book__05209.jpg','["\"Treasure is Where You Find It\" Hardcover Book","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139728&a=2893129&m=106265","Treasure Is Where You Find It, the 30 Year Nepal Quest, by Christian Cranmer is a full color narrative of the hunt to save the forgotten arsenal of the Royal Nepalese Gurkha Army. Stored in an old palace, Lagan Silekhana, since 1839 this was a 30 year quest completed in 2004 saving more than 50,000 antique firearms including over 150 cannons, most bronze, and countless edged weapons which are now available to the collector''s market. More than 100 on site color photographs of the weapons as found"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-trench-hawk-106265-42238139989','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/011/0000694_trench-hawk__71222.jpg','["Trench Hawk","47.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139989&a=2893129&m=106265","One stroke from either vicious side of this Trench Hawk from Cold Steel and it is all over. Also great for defending against blows and hooking your opponents clothes or weapon. Drop forged 5150 carbon steel, differentially hardened. The axe will withstand tremendous blows and the awful stress of continued throwing. Polypropylene handle is highly resistant to shock, abuse and impact. Includes articulated Secure-Ex sheath. Key Measurements: Overall: 19\" Head: 8-3/4\" Wt: 24 oz View more Cold Steel "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-type-15-swallowtail-arrowhead-set-of-5-106265-42238139752','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/552/0010165_type-15-swallowtail-arrowhead-set-of-5__09264.jpg','["Type 15 Swallowtail Arrowhead (set of 5)","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139752&a=2893129&m=106265","This long barbed broad arrowhead was the perfect choice for hunting larger game. The swallowtail design allowed it to fly well, yet cut a deep wound into its intended target. Hand forged of darkened steel and can easily be made to fit onto a standard 5/16 arrow shaft. Sold in a set of 5 pieces. Measures 2-3/4 X 2 each"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-type-16-curved-broad-arrowhead-set-of-5-106265-42238139744','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/115/0010164_type-16-curved-broad-arrowhead-set-of-5__44122.jpg','["Type 16 Curved Broad Arrowhead (set of 5)","28.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139744&a=2893129&m=106265","Though primarily thought of for hunting, this type of barbed warhead would have easily found its way onto the battlefield of Poitiers in 1356. Hand forged of darkened steel and can easily be made to fit onto a standard 5/16 arrow shaft. Sold in a set of 5 pieces. Measures 2-3/4 X 1 each"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-union-enlisted-artillery-shell-jacket-106265-42238140188','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/e/950/0000666_union-enlisted-artillery-shell-jacket__53475.jpg','["Union Enlisted Artillery Shell Jacket","129.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140188&a=2893129&m=106265","This Union Enlisted Cavalry Shell Jacket features a Federal blue wool outer shell, red piping and a rough muslin lining like the originals. All buttons have the Union Eagle. The wool bolsters were set at the bottom rear/side seams and were designed to bolster the weight of a saber belt which carried the pistol and saber of a mounted soldier. Choose S, M, L or 2X. A wearable collectible perfect for re-enactors. Also available with yellow piping for Cavalry. Click here for size chart"]'),
