('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-union-vest-106265-42238140158','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/470/0008499_union-vest__17027.jpg','["Union Vest","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140158&a=2893129&m=106265","This replica Civil War vest is authentically patterned, high quality clothing. Perfect for collectors, history buffs and re-enactors who want durable, well-made, accurate copies from a critical time in our nations history. 100% richly dyed wool front with cotton back and lining. Union eagle metal buttons. Choose size 40, 42, 44, 46, 48, 50. Click here for size chart"]'),
