('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-universal-sword-hanger-106265-42238139736','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/y/117/0012768_universal-sword-hanger__91068.jpg','["Universal Sword Hanger","9.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139736&a=2893129&m=106265","The perfect display option for most of our swords, this sword hanger is made from polished steel and has an adjustable bracket. On the top is a hole for a nail or screw. Once you hang the sword, the hanger practically disappears, taking nothing away from your beautifully edged weapon collection."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-universal-sword-plaque-by-kit-rae-106265-42238139978','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/221/0012447_universal-sword-plaque-by-kit-rae__61007.jpg','["Universal Sword Plaque by Kit Rae","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139978&a=2893129&m=106265","This universal sword plaque from Kit Rae offers a unique way to display your sword! Constructed from solid wood and accented with fantasy screen printed tribal designs, this striking plaque will dress up any sword in your collection so you can display it proudly. View more products from United Cutlery"]'),
