('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-us-air-force-commemorative-wall-plaque-106265-42238139778','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/134/0001787_us-air-force-commemorative-wall-plaque__82418.jpg','["US Air Force Commemorative Wall Plaque","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139778&a=2893129&m=106265","Proudly display your support for our brave men and women of your chosen branch of service with this beautifully hand sculpted, full metal emblem from the US Air Force. This beautiful plaque features the official Coat of Arms and is sturdily cast from solid metal and flashed with beautiful 24K gold. It can easily be hung on a wall or used as part of an existing display. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Also available for Navy and Army branches. Approximately 5-3/4\" x 5-3/4\""]'),
