('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-us-army-officer-s-ceremonial-belt-106265-42238140048','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/396/0001233_us-army-officers-ceremonial-belt__96120.jpg','["US Army Officer''s Ceremonial Belt","69.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140048&a=2893129&m=106265","This US Army Officer''s Ceremonial Belt is a government spec, current issue ceremonial sword belt. Features 24K gold-plated buckle with Army Coat of Arms and matching belt keepers. One size. Belt width is 1-3?4\" wide. Adjustable up to 48\" length. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-us-army-officers-saber-chain-106265-42238139731','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/l/154/0001226_us-army-officers-saber-chain__21747.jpg','["US Army Officers Saber Chain","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139731&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a regulation stainless steel Army Officers saber chain."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-us-flag-106265-42238139935','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/x/486/0009433_us-flag__29919.jpg','["US Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139935&a=2893129&m=106265","The current flag of the United States consists of 13 stripes, alternate red and white, representing the 13 original colonies/states. The canton consists of a blue field containing a white star for every state in the union. The 27th flag of the United States became the official flag on July 4th, 1960. Hawaii was admitted as the 50th state on August 21st, 1959 and this 50-Star Flag, by Executive Order of President Eisenhower (dated August 21, 1959) provided for the arrangement of the stars in nine"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-us-gi-wwii-s-w-victory-holster-106265-42238139952','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/823/0011272_us-gi-wwii-sw-victory-holster__57580.jpg','["US GI WWII S&W Victory Holster","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139952&a=2893129&m=106265","A fine replica of the official holster used by our troops for the Smith & Wesson Victory model revolver (same as Model 10 S&W and fits 4\" to 5\" barrel). Sturdy brown leather construction with full flap US embossed, closing on brass stud. Includes belt hangers for attaching to standard web belt."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-us-mark-v-divers-helmet-replica-106265-42238139886','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/441/0001267_us-mark-v-divers-helmet-replica__61798.jpg','["US Mark V Divers Helmet Replica","294.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139886&a=2893129&m=106265","This replica US Mark V Divers Helmet is a stunning nautical decor item. Originals are rare and cost thousands; our version stays with the Mark V WWII era theme and takes a little license in the design to ensure awesome looks over traditional diving function. Made entirely of antiqued aluminum which ensures a nice aged patina for years and a reasonable weight. It features real glass port hole windows and the front plate swings open on this stunning display piece. This high quality reproduction is"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-us-navy-commemorative-wall-plaque-106265-42238139770','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/x/032/0001789_us-navy-commemorative-wall-plaque__71691.jpg','["US Navy Commemorative Wall Plaque","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139770&a=2893129&m=106265","Proudly display your support for our brave men and women of your chosen branch of service with this beautifully hand sculpted, full metal emblem from the US Navy. This beautiful plaque features the official Coat of Arms and is sturdily cast from solid metal and flashed with beautiful 24K gold. It can easily be hung on a wall or used as part of an existing display. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Also available for Air Force and Army branches. Approximately 5-3/4\" x 5-3/4\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-us-vietnam-advisers-hat-106265-42238139906','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/464/US_Vietnam_Advisors_Hat_720048_h_new__52679.jpg','["US Vietnam Advisers Hat","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139906&a=2893129&m=106265","This hat style was worn by early Vietnam advisers and Special Forces and was styled on the French Mle 1949 pattern. A rare style, our high quality replica matches the details and material of those originals. Made like the originals in a circular weave pattern for strength, this has the proper batting and screened mesh grommeted vents. When you turned the hat inside out the bright lining allowed helicopters and aircraft a good visual aid to show friendly troops during air strikes or medivac mis"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-us-vietnam-advisers-hat-106265-42238140086','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/464/US_Vietnam_Advisors_Hat_720048_h_new__52679.jpg','["US Vietnam Advisers Hat","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140086&a=2893129&m=106265","This hat style was worn by early Vietnam advisers and Special Forces and was styled on the French Mle 1949 pattern. A rare style, our high quality replica matches the details and material of those originals. Made like the originals in a circular weave pattern for strength, this has the proper batting and screened mesh grommeted vents. When you turned the hat inside out the bright lining allowed helicopters and aircraft a good visual aid to show friendly troops during air strikes or medivac mis"]'),
