('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-usmc-1911-style-black-holster-106265-42238139908','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/245/0011283_usmc-1911-style-black-holster__26483.jpg','["USMC 1911 Style Black Holster","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139908&a=2893129&m=106265","This USMC Officer''s Holster is designed to fit standard 1911 style handguns. Made from top-grain heavy leather with a warm satin finish and sewn with waxed linen thread, it comes complete with leather leg-thong. Features 2-1/4\" wide belt loops and belt hanger for use on web belts. Comes stamped USMC, right hand or left hand draw. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Also available in Brown."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-usmc-military-beretta-92-glock-gold-cup-style-black-holster-106265-42238140060','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/189/0011285_usmc-military-beretta-92-glock-gold-cup-style-black-holster__27136.jpg','["USMC Military Beretta 92, Glock & Gold Cup Style Black Holster","39.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140060&a=2893129&m=106265","This USMC Officer''s Holster is designed to fit Beretta 92, Glock, Gold Cup Style and similar models. Made from top-grain heavy leather with a warm satin finish and sewn with waxed linen thread, it comes complete with leather leg-thong. Features 2-1/4\" wide belt loops and belt hanger for use on web belts. Comes stamped USMC. Choose left or right hand draw. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-usmc-officer-s-sword-guard-106265-42238139837','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/190/0004831_usmc-officers-sword-guard__55639.jpg','["USMC Officer''s Sword Guard","19.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139837&a=2893129&m=106265","This frog/guard helps prevent the sword from marring the officers dress uniform. Made to government specification out of black high gloss synthetic leather."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-victorian-walking-cane-106265-42238139773','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/126/0015637_victorian-walking-cane__10818.jpg','["Victorian Walking Cane","54.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139773&a=2893129&m=106265","Often mentioned throughout Victorian literature and carried by Dr. Watson in many screen adventures, this sidearm is one of the most beautiful walking canes produced by Windlass Steelcrafts. The highly detailed hardwood shaft has been black enamelled and is accented with a hand-carved bone ring and topped off with actual horn. The end has a lions head firmly mounted as a cap. Rubber, anti-slip cap is included. Also available as a sword cane."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-viking-horn-mug-106265-42238139796','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/243/0011986_viking-horn-mug__39934.jpg','["Viking Horn Mug","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139796&a=2893129&m=106265","This small cup is bad to the bone, literally! Hand formed from real horn, this cup has an unusual triangular shape and sports a handle too. Hand wash only. Please Note: Due to the Horns being natural, the sizes and color may vary. It is recommended to wash the tankard thoroughly before drinking. Overall: Approximately 4\" x 3\" x 2-1/8\" Capacity: Approximately 8 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-viking-raven-pewter-pendant-106265-42238139771','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/795/0010009_viking-raven-pewter-pendant__24700.jpg','["Viking Raven Pewter Pendant","29.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139771&a=2893129&m=106265","Ravens were heavily used on Norse flags, banners and jewelry during the 9th through 11th centuries. They signified Odins magical ravens, Huginn and Muninn. Our stunning pendant is made of 99.9% lead free English pewter which has been antiqued to bring out all of the details of both the raven and the runes which surround it on the circular band. The runes are the first runic inscriptions and consist of 24 letters known as Futhark. Measures 2 in diameter. Includes a 30 black leather thong with "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-viking-thane-axe-106265-42238139804','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/b/187/0010741_viking-thane-axe__32460.jpg','["Viking Thane Axe","99.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139804&a=2893129&m=106265","This Windlass hand axe features many traits common to the Norse hatchets we''ve come to love through the years. The solid, one-piece forged head is strong X46Cr13 high-grade stainless steel. 52 RC. The comfortably contoured handle is Sissoo, a North Indian hardwood and it''s capped with a handsome genuine bone butt cap. Even better are the Norse engravings unique to our axe that are deeply etched on both sides of the handle, and on the bone end cap is a depiction of Thor''s mighty hammer, Mjolnir. "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-viking-ulfberht-106265-42238140024','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/032/0010083_viking-ulfberht__20533.jpg','["Viking Ulfberht","289.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140024&a=2893129&m=106265","Copied from a sword shown in Ian Pierces book Swords of the Viking Age. An old legend has it that a Nordic smith named Ulfberht developed the first all steel blade. This crucial development achieved near-mythical status among warriors, making this one of the most important swords in the study of medieval weapons. Several of these blades from slightly different time periods exist, some engraved in gratitude and reverence with Ulfberhts hallowed name. Prior to the Ulfberht swords, all European s"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-viking-valknut-triple-layered-face-mask-106265-42238139943','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/j/541/0013923_viking-valknut-triple-layered-face-mask__02652.jpg','["Viking Valknut Triple Layered Face Mask","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139943&a=2893129&m=106265","This Viking Valknut face mask is lightweight, breathable, and stylishly designed with everyday work in mind. Made of 100% cotton with silk thread embroidery, it is multi-layered and has a sleeve so you can slide an additional disposable filter into the pocket if desired. The one size fits all construction, combined with adjustable elastic straps behind each ear, provides a snug fit. It even fits well over beards! Machine washable. Note: These masks are not graded for medical use."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-vintage-style-boonie-hat-106265-42238140054','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/380/0000221_vintage-style-boonie-hat__75039.jpg','["Vintage Style Boonie Hat","18.99","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140054&a=2893129&m=106265","These Vintage Style Boonie Hats are made from original patterns issued during the Vietnam War. These 100% rip-stop cotton reproductions wear just as well today. Feature metal mesh side vents, 3\" brim, nylon chin cord, and webbing. Popular with military enthusiasts and outdoorsman, these all-weather hats are available in tiger stripe camo or olive drab. Choose from 7-1/4, 7-1/2 or 7-3/4."]'),
