('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-vintage-style-olive-drab-boonie-hat-106265-42238140027','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/482/0007099_vintage-style-olive-drab-boonie-hat__38776.jpg','["Vintage Style Olive Drab Boonie Hat","18.99","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140027&a=2893129&m=106265","These Vintage Style Olive Drab Boonie Hats are made from original patterns issued during the Vietnam War. These 100% rip-stop cotton reproductions wear just as well today. Feature metal mesh side vents, 3\" brim, nylon chin cord and webbing. Popular with military enthusiasts and outdoorsman, these all-weather hats are also available in tiger stripe camo. Choose from 7-1/4, 7-1/2 or 7-3/4."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-vintage-style-olive-drab-boonie-hat-106265-42238140112','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/c/482/0007099_vintage-style-olive-drab-boonie-hat__38776.jpg','["Vintage Style Olive Drab Boonie Hat","18.99","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140112&a=2893129&m=106265","These Vintage Style Olive Drab Boonie Hats are made from original patterns issued during the Vietnam War. These 100% rip-stop cotton reproductions wear just as well today. Feature metal mesh side vents, 3\" brim, nylon chin cord and webbing. Popular with military enthusiasts and outdoorsman, these all-weather hats are also available in tiger stripe camo. Choose from 7-1/4, 7-1/2 or 7-3/4."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-vulcania-trinket-box-106265-42238140033','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/932/0012029_vulcania-trinket-box__12480.jpg','["Vulcania Trinket Box","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140033&a=2893129&m=106265","Imagine this miniature of Captain Nemos hideout, Vulcania, sitting on your steampunk desk! The amazing little Vulcania Trinket Box has a secret compartment which opens up and allows you to store your private treasures within. Made of resin, this ultra cool box has been metalized with an antique bronze finish with hand-painted brass and copper accents. Measures 8-3/4\" tall\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-war-of-1812-flag-106265-42238139878','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/601/0001747_war-of-1812-flag__33242.jpg','["War of 1812 Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139878&a=2893129&m=106265","This flag is also known as The Battle of Plattsburgh Flag. The War of 1812 actually stretched out until 1814 as the newly founded United States of America frantically fought off a large scale British attack. The battle, also known as the Battle of Lake Champlain, ended the final British invasion attempt of the northern United States. The flag was described as having \"...a black ground with 13 stars for the Union of White, wrought in silver. That in the centre of the Flag there be a Death''s Head,"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-warrior-chisa-katana-106265-42238140159','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/w/669/0000844_warrior-chisa-katana__76087.jpg','["Warrior Chisa Katana","359.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140159&a=2893129&m=106265","The Warrior Series of Japanese styled swords from Cold Steel offers an affordable blade by omitting the expensive mirror polish and using a more practical finish. This Warrior Katana is very handsome and shares the same 1055 steel, heat treatment and sharpness as more expensive counterparts. Features a Samé covered, cord wrapped handle and quality fittings. Come complete with a black lacquered scabbard and a blue/violet cover bag. Overall: 36\" Blade: 24-1/2\" long Wt: 37.1 oz View more Cold Steel"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-warrior-katana-106265-42238140081','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/447/0000832_warrior-katana__85308.jpg','["Warrior Katana","359.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140081&a=2893129&m=106265","The Warrior Series of Japanese styled swords from Cold Steel offers an affordable blade by omitting the expensive mirror polish and using a more practical finish. This Warrior Katana is very handsome and shares the same 1055 steel, heat treatment and sharpness as more expensive counterparts. Features a Samé covered, cord wrapped handle and quality fittings. Come complete with a black lacquered scabbard and a blue/violet cover bag. Overall: 40-1/2\" Blade: 29-1/4\" long, 5/16\" thick Wt: 41.4 oz Vie"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-warrior-naginata-106265-42238140213','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/367/0011720_warrior-sword__87919.jpg','["Warrior Naginata","119.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140213&a=2893129&m=106265","This massive naginata features an aged hardwood handle and 1/2\" thick cast, carbon steel blade. Overall this impressive pole arm is 53\" with a 25\" blade. The back spike and hook toward the tip makes this one of the most aggressive we''ve ever seen. And the curved, reinforcing ridge along the flat of the blade makes it super strong for cutting. The Dadao style guard and ring are made of steel. Includes nylon blade sheath. Overall: 53\" Blade Length: 25\" Blade Thickness: 1/2\" Wt: 4 lbs / 8 oz Steel:"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wartech-dagger-106265-42238139998','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/419/0012639_wartech-dagger__84743.jpg','["Wartech Dagger","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139998&a=2893129&m=106265","This US-designed handy wide-bladed dagger is for boot or belt carry. Crafted from a single piece of 3CR13 stainless steel, with a 3-1/2\" long, 1-3/16\" wide blade. 1/8\" thick for dependable punching power. 8-1/4\" overall. The skeletonized grip is notched on both sides for a secure grip and has an extra-large pommel ring. Kydex sheath with steel belt/pocket/boot clip. Cannot ship to CA, MA, or NJ."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wartech-field-hatchet-106265-42238140217','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/916/0012948_wartech-field-hatchet__14098.jpg','["Wartech Field Hatchet","24.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140217&a=2893129&m=106265","This is a US-designed field and camp hatchet with intent! The head utilizes a double-pronged approach to field-work with an axe blade on one side and a sharpened backspike on the other. Constructed in a one-piece design with a 3CR13 stainless steel head and handle with G-10 scales that are textured to aid grip. Includes nylon belt sheath. The heel is beveled, but not sharpened."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wartech-full-tang-skull-dagger-106265-42238140037','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/391/0012937_wartech-full-tang-skull-dagger__10789.jpg','["Wartech Full Tang Skull Dagger","16.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140037&a=2893129&m=106265","This combat dagger has one of the most eye-catching blades we''ve seen in a while. The brushed finish middle contrasts sharply with black-coated bevels and fuller. A skull relief on the ricasso completes the \"serious\" attitude. Blade and handle are one continuous piece of 3CR13 stainless steel with an almond-shaped stainless steel guard. Handle wrapped with nylon survival cord. Includes a nylon belt sheath. Cannot ship to CA, MA, or NJ."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wartech-old-glory-dagger-106265-42238140120','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/q/539/0012635_wartech-old-glory-dagger__55027.jpg','["Wartech Old Glory Dagger","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140120&a=2893129&m=106265","Wear this handy wide-bladed dagger for boot or belt. Designed in the USA and crafted from a single piece of 3CR13 stainless steel, with a 3-1/2\" long, 1-3/16\" wide blade. 1/8\" thick for dependable punching power. 8-1/4\" overall. The skeletonized grip is notched on both sides for a secure grip and has an extra-large pommel ring. Kydex sheath with steel belt/pocket/boot clip. Cannot ship to CA, MA, or NJ."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-whiskey-rebellion-flag-106265-42238139921','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/s/123/0008734_whiskey-rebellion-flag__26117.jpg','["Whiskey Rebellion Flag","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139921&a=2893129&m=106265","In 1791 Congress placed an excise tax on whiskey to raise money to pay off Revolutionary War debt. The East Coast distilleries made almost no objection to the excise. However farmers on the frontier - then anything west of the Allegheny Mountains - protested, leading to a stillborn rebellion. The Whiskey Rebels used various flags during their rebellion, most quite simple with an anti-Federal theme. The most common were a white flag with red stripes and a flag bearing the inscription \"Equal Taxat"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-white-buffalo-statue-106265-42238140134','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/522/0007641_white-buffalo-statue__03657.jpg','["White Buffalo Statue","65.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140134&a=2893129&m=106265","An omen of good fortune and abundance. The White Buffalo or Bison is a symbol of hope for many people and figures spiritually into ancient lore. Bring the positive message home with this majestic sculpture. A contrasting glaze highlights the horns, eyes, nose and hooves. Resin, hand painted. Overall: 9-1/2\" long, 7\" tall"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-white-leather-gloves-106265-42238140190','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/n/394/0000233_white-leather-gloves__50704.jpg','["White Leather Gloves","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140190&a=2893129&m=106265","Military regulation genuine leather dress gloves. Perfect for color guards, dress uniforms and more. Unlined. Size S, M, L, XL"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-white-wolf-of-the-north-statue-106265-42238140135','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/d/923/0009012_white-wolf-of-the-north-statue__58481.jpg','["White Wolf of the North Statue","44.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140135&a=2893129&m=106265","This White Wolf of the North Statue depicts a handsome and regal wolf overseeing his pack and domain. Made from cold cast resin and hand painted. An imposing, yet beautiful display."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wild-shot-vacuum-bottle-thermos-106265-42238139936','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/m/731/0008635_wild-shot-bullet-vacuum-bottle-thermos__45750.jpg','["Wild Shot Vacuum Bottle Thermos","11.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139936&a=2893129&m=106265","Take your favorite drink with you wherever you go. Good for hot or cold beverages. The double wall insulated, stainless steel construction vacuum bottle thermos holds 16.9 ounces and has a brass and copper finish. The superior vacuum keeps the beverage hot or cold for hours. Diameter: 2-1/8\" Heigt: 11\""]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-william-wallace-braveheart-claymore-106265-42238139871','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/082/0013309_william-wallace-braveheart-claymore__68082.jpg','["William Wallace Braveheart Claymore","349.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139871&a=2893129&m=106265","The great Scottish hero, William Wallace, and his band of lowlanders bested a superior English force of 50,000 at Stirling Bridge in 1297. In his ongoing challenge of Edward I he also laid waste to several counties in the north of England. These early attacks inspired Scottish Nationalism that culminated with the achievement of independence under Robert The Bruce. This replica is just like the one used in the movie Braveheart and more importantly is a close replication of the sword used by some "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-winchester-heart-shaped-iron-lock-106265-42238140023','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/r/466/0008756_winchester-heart-shaped-iron-lock__63878.jpg','["Winchester Heart Shaped Iron Lock","12.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140023&a=2893129&m=106265","This Heart Shaped, hand finished Winchester iron lock is made from an historic original. This heavy, solid iron, fully functional lock with an antique finish makes a great decor item and really does work. Lock up your firearms, Pony Express payroll, jail house or use as a unique paperweight. They also serve as a wonderful token of love for a heart collector, gun lover or hunter. A fun collectible from a bygone era. Includes two keys."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-winchester-round-six-lever-iron-lock-106265-42238140136','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/h/466/0008752_winchester-round-six-lever-iron-lock__34981.jpg','["Winchester Round Six Lever Iron Lock","26.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140136&a=2893129&m=106265","This Round Six Lever hand finished Winchester lock is made of solid iron with an antique finish. Based on an historic original, this heavy, fully functional lock makes a great decor item and really does work. Lock up your firearms, jail house, Pony Express payroll or use as a unique paperweight. A fun collectible from a bygone era. Includes two keys."]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-windlass-active-wear-polo-shirt-106265-42238139846','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/z/554/0008218_windlass-active-wear-polo-shirt__30588.jpg','["Windlass Active Wear Polo Shirt","33.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139846&a=2893129&m=106265","These are the highest quality polo shirts on the market! Made of 100% cotton, they are resistant to wrinkles, pilling, shrinking, staining and fading... these shirts are made to last. Available in S, M, L, XL or XXL. Choose from Black, White or Navy Blue. Also available Embroidered with a Scottish Clan Badges. Click here for size chart"]'),
