('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-windlass-classic-bastard-sword-106265-42238139962','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/a/342/0013498_windlass-classic-bastard-sword__91226.jpg','["Windlass Classic Bastard Sword","324.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139962&a=2893129&m=106265","Circa 15th Century Brought back by popular demand, we are pleased to offer this Windlass Classic bastard sword. This massive broad sword could have easily been used at the Battle of Bosworth Field in 1485, cutting and slashing its way through the Tudor ranks. As large as this sword is, it is still amazingly light and well balanced. The wide blade is forged of high carbon steel, while the pommel and cross guard have been antiqued with a darkened, aged finish. The large 7\" handle is wrapped in sof"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-windlass-steelcrafts-1840-heavy-cavalry-saber-106265-42238139834','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/355/0012204_windlass-steelcrafts-1840-heavy-cavalry-saber__28518.jpg','["Windlass Steelcrafts 1840 Heavy Cavalry Saber","229.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139834&a=2893129&m=106265","This fine saber has a 1065 high carbon steel blade with full tang and is well tempered. An authentic replica of the highest caliber. This historically accurate saber was well known as the Wrist Breaker. The model 1840 Cavalry Saber has a three branch brass guard, brass wire wrapped black leather grip, and comes with a steel scabbard. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. Overall: 41-1?4\" Blade: 35-3?4\" x 11?4\" x 9?32\" Wt: 2 lbs/5 oz Sword and scabbard each can be personalized up to two lines each with"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-woolly-mammoth-fire-braid-106265-42238140197','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/980/0011974_woolly-mammoth-fire-braid__27860.jpg','["Woolly Mammoth Fire Braid","14.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140197&a=2893129&m=106265","This braided jute bracelet from Outdoor Element is a survival fire braid so you can explore with confidence. Features an EverSpark buckle with signal mirror, EPDM Ranger Band/fire starter, and the rest of the band is braided jute which is an ideal tinder. The buckle incorporates a Ferro rod and hardened stainless steel striker and the striker doubles as a reflector for emergency signaling. There are nearly 10 feet of flammable jute (plus a sample strand for practice) and a small EPDM Ranger band"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wwi-doughboy-replica-helmet-106265-42238139759','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/k/440/0011472_wwi-doughboy-replica-helmet__59774.jpg','["WWI Doughboy Replica Helmet","89.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139759&a=2893129&m=106265","This WWI Doughboy Helmet is made from an original M1917 pattern found at auction. This 18 gauge steel shell replica helmet is made to the same specs down to the string, metal and adjustable coated canvas liner. Great for display or reenactment. Made by Windlass Steelcrafts. 18 gauge steel WT: 2 lbs / 9-1/2 oz"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wwi-french-battalion-metal-sign-106265-42238140165','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/701/0011375_wwi-french-battalion-metal-sign__08860.jpg','["WWI French Battalion Metal Sign","18.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140165&a=2893129&m=106265","Enlistment posters were not just limited to the US during the first World War. This great French poster is wonderfully reproduced on a sturdy tin sign, great for any room or office. Measures 11-3/4 x 7-3/4"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wwi-trench-mace-106265-42238139755','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/g/523/0008903_wwi-trench-mace__95704.jpg','["WWI Trench Mace","49.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238139755&a=2893129&m=106265","This British trench club was made by placing a flanged metal ring on a standard entrenching tool handle. While the First World War is strongly associated with the introduction of modern weaponry, primitive melee weapons still had a place in the close-quarters fighting encountered during trench raids. Decommissioned or broken heavy machinery was often re-purposed and you can see the cog-like look as though this could have been a gear from a tank or other large artillery. There was no shortage of "]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wwi-us-marines-metal-sign-106265-42238140088','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/v/521/0011376_wwi-us-marines-metal-sign__66012.jpg','["WWI US Marines Metal Sign","18.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140088&a=2893129&m=106265","Enlistment signs have always shown how strong our service members are. And this one is no exception. The stalwart US Marine is shown in his dress uniform on this perfectly reproduced tin sign. Perfect for any collection! Measures 11-3/4 x 7-3/4"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wwii-grenade-metal-sign-106265-42238140142','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/f/540/0011374_wwii-grenade-metal-sign__32304.jpg','["WWII Grenade Metal Sign","18.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140142&a=2893129&m=106265","As America entered WWII, many Americans were called into making arms for our troops. This beautiful poster shows how every piece manufactured needed to work properly. This poster has been reproduced on a sturdy tin sign for your home or office. Measures 11-3/4 x 7-3/4"]'),
('awin-atlanta-cutlery-corp-wwii-sergeant-statue-106265-42238140095','Atlanta Cutlery Corp.','sports-outdoors','sports-outdoor-gear','https://www.atlantacutlery.com/product_images/u/176/0012721_wwii-sergeant-statue__25258.jpg','["WWII Sergeant Statue","69.95","USD","Atlanta Cutlery Corp.","Outdoor Adventure","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42238140095&a=2893129&m=106265","This cold cast resin statue is an excellent portrayal of a WWII sergeant in full contemplation, stogie in hand. Whether he''s pondering his last skirmish or his next one, this antique bronze finished figurine makes a fine addition to your history collection. Made of cold cast resin that feels like metal. A great addition to your military collectibles. Overall: 12-7/8 tall, 4-1/2\" wide, 4-1/2\" deep"]'),
