('awin-blooh-umoja-hoop-earring-119683-42795318759','Blooh','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0515/2781/1261/products/5_1.jpg?v=1628233718','["Umoja Hoop Earring","66.00","USD","Blooh","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42795318759&a=2893129&m=119683","Representing unity and harmony, the Umoja is a simple classic staple for your favorite denim moment. Dress it up with a dress for a night out or for a day out with good friends."]'),
