('awin-bookemon-1937-letter-collection-from-a-ccc-camp-91219-41940562003','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=c43806bd8831b59da4d05372987db74a','["1937 Letter Collection From A CCC Camp","27.94","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562003&a=2893129&m=91219","A collection of letters written by a family member to his father while serving with the CCC during the months of October and November of 1937 at a Florida location."]'),
('awin-bookemon-a-grandmother-s-wish-91219-41940562074','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=47a47f021bb0ab594703fb198a062763','["A Grandmother''s Wish","36.51","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562074&a=2893129&m=91219","This book was written for my grandchildren. I wanted to give them a guide to living well in the world and to become better instruments for peace in the world. This book is written on a young level, but the concepts are very adult."]'),
('awin-bookemon-a-little-this-a-little-that-soul-food-91219-41940561960','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=4f90fb06289af6ca3793c75e4228a8b6','["A little this, a little that....Soul Food","30.62","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561960&a=2893129&m=91219","A little of this, a little of that cookbook Soul Food Edition"]'),
('awin-bookemon-a-poets-dreams-of-life-and-love-91219-41940561968','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=ad8dc79026bac21057ae9a159d99c50f','["A Poets Dreams of Life and Love","43.75","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561968&a=2893129&m=91219","A book of poems about love, life, joy, heartache, pain, and perseverance. Living through the good the bad and even the ugly, and finding hope love and understanding through it all."]'),
('awin-bookemon-a-window-into-my-soul-91219-41940561934','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=9941f4c54a0e1120252dcd970a9ccc01','["A WINDOW INTO MY SOUL","70.53","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561934&a=2893129&m=91219","Book of my thoughts. Hope to give inspiration."]'),
('awin-bookemon-a-year-of-dissected-love-91219-41940562067','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=ab7471f4dac1d46ca5a0551dc5943503','["A year of dissected love","44.74","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562067&a=2893129&m=91219","Love... Everything in my life is influenced by love. I was blessed with wonderful experiences of love. As daughter, sister, niece, grandaughter, mother, grandmother, friend, lover, wife... My life is love, my soul is love. A rainbow of love! I was challenged and pushed to give up love. Unbearable pain helped me to appreciate and protect my love more. Love gave me immunity to pain. This little book is dedicated to love, to fragility and strength of love. Even when broken into millions of little s"]'),
('awin-bookemon-about-ralph-91219-41940561922','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=399b3beb526c5ff4d0cce50a66e65180','["About Ralph","55.71","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561922&a=2893129&m=91219","During a two week vacation at the Jersey shore in 2001, Peter Carlo meets a stranger, Ralph, and through conversations and flashbacks, he explores a crisis in his marriage, that leads him to painful and deep discoveries about life, relationships, women and himself. He also finds in Ralph a history he never knew."]'),
('awin-bookemon-alejandro-captain-bill-and-the-departure-from-terceira-91219-41940562081','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=b4e98626789104d0a9b84b8131a44916','["Alejandro, Captain Bill, and the departure from Terceira","12.12","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562081&a=2893129&m=91219","This story is set in Boston during the early 1940s and details the story of a young man named Alejandro Ramires, who was born in Terceira Island, a small island in the Atlantic Ocean owned by Portugal. His only friends are his parents, although his father works for months at a time, yet he remained very content and loving of his small social circle. He meets a small amount of companions after his father pays a ferry-owner to send him to the United States to live the American Dream. He was only 1"]'),
('awin-bookemon-all-about-kobe-bryant-91219-41940561951','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=fd572fd916b764cbc4b50a5331e0801f','["All About Kobe Bryant","31","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561951&a=2893129&m=91219","Learn all about the fascinating life of basketball star Kobe Bryant."]'),
('awin-bookemon-all-day-long-91219-41940562036','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=46a970f6b48df4f08a2f4b75509941df','["All Day Long","16.88","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562036&a=2893129&m=91219","Pretending is a source of great imagination for children. This book allows a child to dream and imagine a safe and loving environment that listens to them."]'),
('awin-bookemon-autumn-91219-41940561998','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=5c40f91ca84442dcb11d21724ed15407','["Autumn","46.38","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561998&a=2893129&m=91219","An Autumn Special Event compilation of wonderful poetic lines by Poetry for Peace Poets/members"]'),
('awin-bookemon-ayla-does-art-91219-41940562061','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=cfb5d6f33a6c947127a1b3c8d050adaf','["Ayla Does Art!","32.98","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562061&a=2893129&m=91219","Ayla is an artist who has an adventure making art."]'),
('awin-bookemon-ayla-wants-bamboo-91219-41940562010','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=f485818de8718b6b117991f1617f9a06','["Ayla Wants Bamboo","32.98","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562010&a=2893129&m=91219","Ayla will do anything to get her favorite treat."]'),
('awin-bookemon-baby-boomer-tomboys-91219-41940562028','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=4f71cf79fa04db10aa66e6eaf844c550','["Baby Boomer Tomboys","56.65","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562028&a=2893129&m=91219","Memoirs of a tomboy who grew up in the fifties and sixties"]'),
('awin-bookemon-back-to-then-91219-41940561930','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=40744520586ac1029d5bffefd0bf6642','["BACK TO THEN","38.58","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561930&a=2893129&m=91219","Seniors who suffer with a memory loss disease often still have vivid recollections of their past. In many cases, as with my own mother who suffers with Alzheimer''s disease, these seniors struggle with their short term or recent memory while recalling many details of their distant past. In fact, my mothers day to day existence, her reality, is her distant past. On any given day she may be in the sixties, as a housewife, or back in the thirties as a child. As with other seniors suffering similarly"]'),
('awin-bookemon-back-to-then-91219-41940562019','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=956a7a69452307e2310e9685fb000180','["BACK TO THEN","38.58","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562019&a=2893129&m=91219","Seniors who suffer with a memory loss disease often still have vivid recollections of their past. In many cases, as with my own mother who suffers with Alzheimer''s disease, these seniors struggle with their short term or recent memory while recalling many details of their distant past. In fact, my mothers day to day existence, her reality, is her distant past. On any given day she may be in the sixties, as a housewife, or back in the thirties as a child. As with other seniors suffering similarly"]'),
('awin-bookemon-barks-91219-41940561957','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=e30d15467a929a31b8b8902aa4f8cc83','["Barks","15.46","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561957&a=2893129&m=91219","In this Proverbs 3:5-6 biblical parallel, a prodigal dog, Barks, desires to explore and live life along his own path rather than obey the directions of his kind and loving master. As trouble arises, Barks soon begins to long for the safety and protection he formerly experienced in the presence of his master. Join Barks as he goes through difficulties in his search. 24 pgs."]'),
('awin-bookemon-broken-heart-broken-dreams-91219-41940562083','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=fc46ea3f428f074f2568379f36b34e64','["Broken Heart, Broken Dreams","20.41","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562083&a=2893129&m=91219","Is healthcare today about money and power, or love and caring? This question is a reality we must all face. Broken Heart, Broken Dreams is a collection of prose and poetry depicting your frustrations of the changing healthcare system. The author can feel your pain and see how incredible you are as a caregiver even with the challenges you face in your profession."]'),
('awin-bookemon-but-i-m-not-sleepy-91219-41940562084','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=072750d934b4c3b37485a0d12c86f9e1','["But I''m Not Sleepy!","22.39","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562084&a=2893129&m=91219","Childrens'' never ending struggle to fight off sleep"]'),
