('awin-bookemon-mommy-doesn-t-feel-good-91219-41940561953','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=dff04ed977b72aaecbf3be057819e811','["Mommy Doesn''t Feel Good","24.74","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561953&a=2893129&m=91219","It is very important that our children understand our illness. When I was first diagnosed, my daughter didnt understand. Mommy didnt look sick. Now that she is older, she understands. I wrote this book with her in mind, from a childs prospective.She loved it so much that she gave me a huge hug. It melted my heart. My hopes for this book is to spread awareness about this horrible disease. Together we can make a difference."]'),
