('awin-bookemon-my-time-on-machias-seal-island-91219-41940562021','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=e970842b1a1dc5ddfd5bf2c9e5021e38','["My time on Machias Seal Island","65.01","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562021&a=2893129&m=91219","This is my documented photographs and journal field notes of my travels to Machias Seal Island located at the boundary between the Gulf of Maine and the Bay of Fundy on May 17, 2018. I was extremely fortunate to be able to tag along with Captain Andy Patterson of Bold Coast Tours who was going to be doing a supply run to the island."]'),
