('awin-bookemon-nya-knows-numbers-91219-41940561944','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=213b21ec113d4fc9ea899d631164f494','["Nya Knows Numbers","24.36","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561944&a=2893129&m=91219","Nya knows Numbers introduces you to 2 year old Nya. Nya has the ability to identify numbers in a very unique and fun way. With this series of books, I hope to inspire all little girls, especially black and brown little girls to become passionate about Science, Technology, Engineering, and of course MATH."]'),
