('awin-bookemon-the-princess-and-the-crooked-toe-91219-41940562042','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=c3e2709e8221d3c0980dccad68821c6c','["The Princess and the Crooked Toe","19.18","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562042&a=2893129&m=91219","Just as the story of many immigrants, in a fairy tale bed time story, this book tells the saga of an immigrant couple who built their kingdom and find happiness after many long years of disappointments and hardship. It illustrates how they foresee explaining the In-Vitro process they went through to conceive their perfect little princess, and the family traits that makes her perfect, despite her crooked toe."]'),
