('awin-bookemon-the-strange-thing-at-the-lake-91219-41940562058','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=fe5865aca91bde06cb9bdf05778ce9a1','["The Strange Thing at the Lake","32.98","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562058&a=2893129&m=91219","This group of kids is determined to figure out what is in the lake."]'),
