('awin-bookemon-the-world-around-you-91219-41940562040','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=4a598f67d22073fc5d45c3e9abe5b524','["The World Around You","26","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562040&a=2893129&m=91219","The World Around You: Under Your Feet is a children''s nonfiction picture book that provides information about living things that call the soil home. Includes photographs and illustrations as well as text features. Able to be adapted for use in the classroom."]'),
('awin-bookemon-these-dogs-know-how-special-you-are-91219-41940561939','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=d831ae964694636dd23f04647a4cba23','["These Dogs Know How Special You Are","18.06","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561939&a=2893129&m=91219","Deb''s dogs affirm that children are loved and that they are capable, unique people."]'),
('awin-bookemon-thinkers-lodge-its-history-and-legacy-91219-41940562069','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=f907d5b5a4b55c8511667c51340cc9d8','["Thinkers Lodge: Its History and Legacy","60.41","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562069&a=2893129&m=91219","Thinkers Lodge is a National Historic Site in Pugwash, Nova Scotia, symbolizing the birth of the Pugwash movement for nuclear disarmament.Joseph Rotblat (Nobel Peace Prize recipient), Cyrus Eaton (host of the early Pugwash Conferences), Anne Eaton, Ruth Adams, and 22 scientists in 1957 from both sides of the Iron curtain were peace activists seeking to build a world that would not incinerate in a nuclear holocaust.Author Cathy Eaton, granddaughter of Pugwash born Cyrus Eaton, documents the peopl"]'),
('awin-bookemon-three-heroes-91219-41940561991','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=38bf407d0c7b4c54126f3e8e9fe81a59','["Three Heroes","32.98","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561991&a=2893129&m=91219","Some unique heroes are chosen to protect Wildville. They must go on a journey to fulfill their destiny and save their home."]'),
('awin-bookemon-timberr-91219-41940561950','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=982216218684cde0dd89e69f0dc49e0c','["Timberr","48.65","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561950&a=2893129&m=91219","Long ago, but not so very far away in a deep primeval land, lived the trees. In those days, there was no understanding between the worlds of man and trees. If the trees had seen man walk around, they would have told them to stand still otherwise, their roots would never begin to grow. Of course, trees are very attached to their roots."]'),
('awin-bookemon-time-travelers-91219-41940562073','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=0cc10704983417a79c11fa2e5aa6513c','["Time Travelers","34.95","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562073&a=2893129&m=91219","An adventure story that goes back in time!"]'),
('awin-bookemon-valley-of-doubt-to-freedom-91219-41940561992','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=def3b33e056b33706bb7b74bed6d4470','["Valley Of Doubt To Freedom","25.16","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561992&a=2893129&m=91219","Are you tired of reading black and white self-help books? Then this book is written for you. Each page will visually stimulate you to think and grow. Written in the form of prose and poetry it will guide you to think through the healing process toward freedom."]'),
('awin-bookemon-verses-in-my-head-volume-one-91219-41940562011','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=a4cf5303592e1d2ea616a900bffc3a46','["Verses In My Head: Volume One","34.15","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562011&a=2893129&m=91219","Thoughts on life"]'),
('awin-bookemon-verses-in-time-91219-41940562055','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=574635160692685082bf7fd69444a362','["Verses in Time","32.16","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562055&a=2893129&m=91219","Original poems and pictures by Taylor Ford"]'),
('awin-bookemon-west-of-booby-point-91219-41940562027','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=9c83cc53381863c0b5666171b66d23bb','["West of Booby Point","94.53","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562027&a=2893129&m=91219","?A picture array of all the points of interest in Booby Point, Spot Bay and Boggy Sand.?Photos of all the homes west of Booby Point noting their original and present owners.?Vivid photographs of the cays northeast of Booby Point.?A peek into a selection of the lives of important members of the community, both past and present.?A stroll Through The gardens of Spot Bay highlighting an assortment of medicinal plants and their uses."]'),
('awin-bookemon-what-have-you-done-jack-91219-41940562065','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=3141e4d02fcbc9b2b1142de399ab5cd5','["What Have You Done Jack?","32.98","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562065&a=2893129&m=91219","In 2003, my children and I wrote a children''s book.Finally, it is now published. I am so thrilled that their children and yours will be able to enjoy the story of a mischievous kitten who, in the end, triumphs and wins the day."]'),
('awin-bookemon-what-we-have-is-precious-time-91219-41940562041','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=13d42825aa434039d0e813222e1ba6b0','["What We Have Is Precious Time","16.88","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562041&a=2893129&m=91219","Living Life to the Fullest no matter what."]'),
('awin-bookemon-when-night-falls-91219-41940561937','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=35b3d94918cc2378f0415c08bb7543af','["When Night Falls","16.68","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561937&a=2893129&m=91219","Jason, Arianna and Brooke are three teenagers trying to survive something we all fear, the zombie apocalypse. This short novel is a thrilling, romantic and exciting look inside their complicated lives. Not only are the teens faced with their own individual losses and hardships, they must also learn to trust and protect each other in order to survive as a group. Will they make it through alive or will the apocalypse be the end of these courageous teens'' lives?"]'),
('awin-bookemon-where-do-babies-come-from-91219-41940561974','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=30c12cb751fdfccd297c115e8674b412','["Where Do Babies Come From?","20.04","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561974&a=2893129&m=91219","Parents explain to a child how babies come to grownups"]'),
('awin-bookemon-why-did-you-let-this-happen-god-91219-41940562087','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=c682f2a72a3e75817cc827ff47f921c8','["Why Did You Let This Happen God?","21.34","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562087&a=2893129&m=91219","A book to help those who have suffered abuse of any kind find healing and hope through Jesus Christ."]'),
('awin-bookemon-wild-things-91219-41940562045','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=33b57f41540aed83e85ffdaef224f646','["Wild Things","39","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940562045&a=2893129&m=91219","Wild Things is a Poetry/Art book - 8.5 x 8.5 available in Hardcover or Softcover - Color - 60 pages including 52 original poems and 15 original art pieces from three contributing artists. A true anthology of creative collaboration, dedicated to cheeky romance, lost loves and doleful anecdotes. A collection of clever words and delightful images for your amusement"]'),
('awin-bookemon-words-and-music-by-philip-lee-and-taylor-ford-91219-41940561954','Bookemon','education','workbooks','https://www.bookemon.com/get_file2.php?disk_file_name=0c33ceffd83b7a8b3453add03f365056','["WORDS and MUSIC by PHILIP LEE and TAYLOR FORD","58.05","USD","Bookemon","Books","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41940561954&a=2893129&m=91219","This book contains all of the songs written by Philip Lee and Taylor Ford plus pictures of our friends from our neighborhood in Norfolk, Virginia. Also included are the original notes for most of the songs as well as letters from music publishers regarding attempts to sell the songs."]'),
