('awin-embossed-graphics-executive-7-tablet-set-carnival-with-linen-holder-117001-41721850373','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/7tc002h-801.jpg','["Executive 7-Tablet Set - Carnival with Linen holder","38.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721850373&a=2893129&m=117001","The Executive 7 Tablet Set adds fun and flair to your desk. These seven tablets in various sizes feature vividly colored papers and a bold lettering style that makes your name and initial command attention. Black ink. Includes a white linen holder to keep the set tidy."]'),
