('awin-embossed-graphics-executive-7-tablet-set-white-with-linen-holder-117001-41721850381','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/7tw002h-801.jpg','["Executive 7-Tablet Set - White with Linen holder","35.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721850381&a=2893129&m=117001","Modern and professional, our Executive 7 Tablet Set with White Linen Holder stands proudly on a desk or credenza. Each tablet prominently announces your name or initials in a bold, clean typeface and ink of your choice. A textured white linen holder organizes the tablets for easy access. White paper."]'),
