('awin-embossed-graphics-executive-card-raised-ink-117001-41721850572','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/cr6002-801.jpg','["Executive Card - Raised Ink","75.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721850572&a=2893129&m=117001","A Giftsin24 best-seller. Project a professional image with our Executive Card. Two lines of personalization, appropriate for a name and company, appear in shiny raised ink at the top and bottom of a generously sized 4.5\" x 6.2\" card. The thick, smooth paper feels solid in hand. Opt for the hand-inserted lining, optional border, 100% cotton paper or return address for even more luxury."]'),
('awin-embossed-graphics-executive-chesapeake-card-raised-ink-117001-41721850668','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/cr9002-801.jpg','["Executive Chesapeake Card - Raised Ink","85.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721850668&a=2893129&m=117001","***Chesapeake Cards are our largest-sized flat, correspondence card***. . Offered on a larger, triple-thick card and a choice of vertical or horizontal formats, the Executive Chesapeake Card - Raised Ink offers two lines of raised ink personalization in a choice of 10 lettering styles. The bottom line features a slightly smaller point size, great for your favorite quote or job title.. . Design your unique stationery set today.. - Horizontal or Vertical format choices. - 10 lettering style & font"]'),
('awin-embossed-graphics-expression-guest-towel-foil-pressed-117001-41721851063','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/gfz230-801.jpg','["Expression Guest Towel - Foil-Pressed","39.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721851063&a=2893129&m=117001","Have something important to say? Proudly display your special message on the Expression Guest Towels in a lettering style of your choice. Names, dates, special occasions or sentiments stand out in any of our foil and paper color combinations."]'),
