('awin-embossed-graphics-expression-napkin-foil-pressed-117001-41721851202','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/hfz230-801.jpg','["Expression Napkin - Foil-Pressed","34.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721851202&a=2893129&m=117001","Have something important to say? Proudly display your special message on the Expression Napkins in a lettering style of your choice. Names, dates, special occasions or sentiments stand out in any of our foil and napkin color combinations."]'),
