('awin-embossed-graphics-pearl-sting-monogram-napkin-printed-117001-41721851290','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/hkz380-801.jpg','["Pearl Sting Monogram Napkin - Printed","29.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721851290&a=2893129&m=117001",". . The Pearl Sting Monogram Napkin - Printed features our exclusive Pearl String monogram and is available in square or diamond format. Select from a variety of napkin and ink colors to match your party decor.. . Design your Monogrammed Cocktail Beverage Napkin today.. - 2 format options (diamond or square). - 2 paper color choices. - 18 ink color choices. - Personalization: Three-letter monogram. - Includes coin-bordered edge (standard)."]'),
('awin-embossed-graphics-pearl-string-monogram-guest-towel-foil-pressed-117001-41721851081','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/gfz380-801.jpg','["Pearl String Monogram Guest Towel - Foil-Pressed","39.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721851081&a=2893129&m=117001","If your event is dressy, you?ll want your napkins to be, too. Our Pearl String Monogram Guest Towels feature our exclusive Classic monogram in a fancy pearl string design. Use it in the powder room, as well as at the buffet table and the dining table. Select from a variety of paper and foil colors to match your party decor. The coin-bordered edge adds extra charm."]'),
('awin-embossed-graphics-pearl-string-monogram-guest-towel-printed-117001-41721851123','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/gkz380-801.jpg','["Pearl String Monogram Guest Towel - Printed","34.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721851123&a=2893129&m=117001",". . The Pearl String Monogram Guest Towel - Printed features our exclusive Pearl String monogram. Choose from a variety of guest towel and ink colors to match your party decor.. . Design your Monogrammed Guest Towel today.. - 2 paper color choices. - 18 ink color choices. - Personalization: Three-letter monogram. - Includes coin-bordered edge (standard)"]'),
('awin-embossed-graphics-pearl-string-monogram-napkin-foil-pressed-117001-41721851245','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/hfz380-801.jpg','["Pearl String Monogram Napkin - Foil-Pressed","34.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721851245&a=2893129&m=117001","If your event is dressy, you?ll want your napkins to be, too. Our Pearl String Monogram Napkins feature our exclusive Classic monogram in a fancy pearl string design. Use it as a beverage or cocktail napkin, as well as for passed hors d?oeuvres, at the buffet table and at the dining table. Choose square or diamond format. Select from a variety of napkin and foil colors to match your party decor. The coin-bordered edge adds extra charm."]'),
('awin-embossed-graphics-pearl-string-monogram-note-digital-print-fairfax-stationery-117001-41721850785','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/ff5380g-801.jpg','["Pearl String Monogram Note - Digital Print - Fairfax Stationery","29.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721850785&a=2893129&m=117001","Here, our Classic Monogram is interpreted by a string-of-pearls motif. Fancy and feminine, this folded note is an eye-catching sensation. Matching envelopes with return address included. The Pearl String Monogram Note - Digital Print - Fairfax Stationery allows for a three-letter monogram featuring digital ink personalization. The Pearl String Monogram Note features our Double-Thick paper and is a part of our exclusive Fairfax Stationery line of fine-quality papers. Design your unique stationery"]'),
('awin-embossed-graphics-pearl-string-monogram-note-raised-ink-117001-41721850884','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/fr5380-801.jpg','["Pearl String Monogram Note - Raised Ink","81.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721850884&a=2893129&m=117001","Our Pearl String Monogram Note - Raised Ink features your monogram in a larger, more modern monogram. Add an optional color border to really make your stationery stand out.. . Design your unique stationery set today.. - 10 raised ink color choices. - 2 paper color options (White or Ivory). - 6 border color options . - 10 Hand-Inserted Envelope Lining color options. - Return Address on Envelopes (matching ink color & font)"]'),
('awin-embossed-graphics-pearls-of-paris-monogram-note-digital-print-fairfax-stationery-117001-41721850786','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/ff5381g-801.jpg','["Pearls of Paris Monogram Note - Digital Print - Fairfax Stationery","29.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721850786&a=2893129&m=117001","Graceful. Impressive. And oh-so-continental. This ultra-feminine design includes two lower-case letters flanking a central capital letter and underscored by an elegant flourish. Folded Note. Matching envelopes with return address included. The Pearls of Paris Monogram Note - Digital Print - Fairfax Stationery allows for a three-letter monogram featuring digital ink personalization. The Pearls of Paris Monogram Note features our Double-Thick paper and is a part of our exclusive Fairfax Stationery"]'),
('awin-embossed-graphics-pearls-of-paris-monogram-note-raised-ink-117001-41721850885','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/fr5381-801.jpg','["Pearls of Paris Monogram Note - Raised Ink","81.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721850885&a=2893129&m=117001","Our Pearls of Paris Monogram Note - Raised Ink features your monogram in a larger, more modern monogram. Add an optional color border to really make your stationery stand out.. . Design your unique stationery set today.. - 10 raised ink color choices. - 2 paper color options (White or Ivory). - 6 border color options . - 10 Hand-Inserted Envelope Lining color options. - Return Address on Envelopes (matching ink color & font)"]')
) AS src(slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url, payload)) AS parsed
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, price=EXCLUDED.price, currency=EXCLUDED.currency,
  brand=EXCLUDED.brand, merchant=EXCLUDED.merchant, category=EXCLUDED.category, department=EXCLUDED.department,
  product_type=EXCLUDED.product_type, image_url=EXCLUDED.image_url, affiliate_url=EXCLUDED.affiliate_url,
  description=EXCLUDED.description, source_data=EXCLUDED.source_data;
INSERT INTO awin_catalog_products
  (slug, name, price, currency, brand, merchant, category, department, product_type, image_url, affiliate_url, description, source_data)
SELECT slug, data->>'product_name', (data->>'search_price')::numeric, data->>'currency', brand,
  data->>'merchant_name', data->>'category_name', department, product_type, image_url,
  data->>'aw_deep_link', data->>'description', data
FROM (SELECT slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url,
  to_jsonb(jsonb_object(ARRAY['product_name','search_price','currency','merchant_name','category_name','aw_deep_link','description'], ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(payload::jsonb)))) AS data FROM (VALUES
('awin-embossed-graphics-pearwood-card-digital-print-fairfax-stationery-117001-41721850554','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/cf6748g-801.jpg','["Pearwood Card - Digital Print - Fairfax Stationery","29.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721850554&a=2893129&m=117001","Pearwood is finely grained and traditionally used in intricate inlay work on tables and chests. Our Pearwood Card reflects that refined history. Your name appears in all capital letters on a flat correspondence card. Part of our Fairfax Printed Stationery Collection, the Pearwood Card set includes 25 envelopes with printed return address. Design your unique stationery set today. - White paper color - 18 ink color choices - Personalization: One line of text - FREE Return Address on Envelopes (mat"]'),
