('awin-embossed-graphics-personalized-mat-117001-41721851697','Embossed Graphics','toys-hobbies','party-supplies','https://www.embossedgraphics.com/common/images/2015_item_images/801/pg5054-801.jpg','["Personalized Mat","29.95","USD","Embossed Graphics","Gifts","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41721851697&a=2893129&m=117001","The Personalized Mat is a great display for your favorite 5\" x 7\" photo. The mat fits nicely within an 8\" x 10\" picture frame. Choose from 10 font styles, 18 mat colors, and 12 ink colors.. . Personalization process: Your personalization is digitally printed on the mat material.. . Customize your photo mat today.. - Personalization: Top and/or Bottom Line. - Horizontal or Vertical layout choice. - 10 lettering style & font choices. - 18 mat color choices. - 12 ink color choices"]'),
