('awin-fan-ink-juventus-retro-capsule-snapback-hat-103359-42123600547','Fan Ink','shoes-bags','fashion-accessories','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1417/4238/products/JUV-2093-5425.png?v=1603833361','["Juventus Retro Capsule Snapback Hat","35.99","USD","Fan Ink","Accessories","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42123600547&a=2893129&m=103359","When the club launched as Sport-Club Juventus on November 1, 1897, players wore a pink kit that has become an iconic jersey for Juve fans for a long time. It was there that we found the inspiration to create this hat, with the idea of bringing back the origins of the Turin club to our collection."]'),
('awin-fan-ink-juventus-retro-capsule-snapback-hat-103359-42123600548','Fan Ink','shoes-bags','fashion-accessories','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1417/4238/products/JUV-2093-5426.png?v=1603835202','["Juventus Retro Capsule Snapback Hat","35.99","USD","Fan Ink","Accessories","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42123600548&a=2893129&m=103359","The Uefa Champions League is considered the most important trophy in Europe. In the 1995-96 season, La Vecchia Signora led by Alessandro Del Piero, Gianluca Vialli, and Fabrizio Ravanelli, became champions for second time. In the final they wore a beautiful blue jersey with yellow stars that drove the Bianconeri fans crazy. That feeling is replicated in this hat, to commemorate the last Champions League achieved by Juventus."]'),
('awin-fan-ink-juventus-retro-capsule-snapback-hat-103359-42123600549','Fan Ink','shoes-bags','fashion-accessories','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1417/4238/products/JUV-2093-5427.png?v=1603835387','["Juventus Retro Capsule Snapback Hat","35.99","USD","Fan Ink","Accessories","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42123600549&a=2893129&m=103359","Yellow with blue is a popular choice of second strip for the Bianconeri. It has never been done better than when la Vecchia Signora lifted the 1984 Cup Winners'' Cup. This trophy is considered one of the most important in Juventus history and with this hat we pay tribute for that tremendous team led by Zbigniew Boniek, Michel Platini and Marco Tardelli."]'),
('awin-fan-ink-juventus-ribbon-hoodie-103359-42123600753','Fan Ink','shoes-bags','fashion-accessories','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1417/4238/products/JUV-3040-7044_WHITE_01_Large_94da8e14-8f0f-4a04-8683-d95176cee360.png?v=1646373038','["Juventus Ribbon Hoodie","198","USD","Fan Ink","Men''s Accessories","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=42123600753&a=2893129&m=103359","Multi-coloured hoodie through cut-and-sew panelling. Juventus screen print at chest. Juventus logo embroidery on left sleeve. Side team label. Stitched club label at back hem. Side-entry waist pocket. Made in Portugal."]'),
