('awin-fang-accessories-alocasia-flower-amethyst-tassel-earrings-128369-45419416651','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Alocasia Flower Amethyst Tassel Earrings","49","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45419416651&a=2893129&m=128369","Alocasia Flower Amethyst Tassel Earrings — Where Flower Language Meets Healing Light Every flower speaks its own language, and every crystal carries its own energy. The Alocasia Flower Amethyst Tassel Earrings are where the language of flowers meets the power of healing. 🌸 Alocasia Flower Meaning: Purity, Happiness & Protection The alocasia flower, with its elegant and refined form, symbolizes purity, happiness, and pure love. Its pristine white blossoms represent untainted love and noble charac"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-amethyst-bracelet-with-super-seven-crystal-128369-45575986454','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Amethyst Bracelet with Super Seven Crystal","99","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45575986454&a=2893129&m=128369","A Story Carved in Stone There is a legend whispered among crystal healers—a story of an ancient oracle who wore three sacred stones to navigate the space between worlds. The amethyst crowned her third eye, granting visions of clarity. The Black Gold Super Seven anchored her to the earth''s deepest wisdom. And the tiger eye blazed like the sun, giving her courage to speak the truths she saw. This bracelet is a modern talisman born from that same legend. The Stones That Speak At its heart rests a 1"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-autumn-winter-red-maple-leaf-necklace-healing-jewelry-128369-45419416669','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Autumn Winter Red Maple Leaf Necklace Healing Jewelry","59","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45419416669&a=2893129&m=128369","Embrace the Autumn Whisper with the Red Maple Leaf H ealing Jewelry As leaves turn golden and crimson, wear a piece of autumn’s soul. The Red Maple Leaf Natural Stone Necklace captures the fleeting beauty of fall in a healing talisman for your everyday winter outfit. Crafted with: Red Agate beads – warms your heart, stabilizes emotions, and ignites inner courage. Black Spinel beads – shield against negativity, enhance focus, and align your energy. Stainless Steel – durable, skin-friendly, and fo"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-black-spinel-necklace-grounding-protection-jewelry-128369-46026497624','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Black Spinel Necklace | Grounding & Protection Jewelry","49","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46026497624&a=2893129&m=128369","Some gemstones need light to be seen. Black spinel does not. It sits at your throat in near-absolute quiet — deep, dense, opaque, like a piece of night sky compressed into a single point. In Western crystal tradition, black spinel is known as the “shadow worker’s stone.” It does not banish darkness. It teaches you to stay grounded inside it. With a Mohs hardness of 8, black spinel is one of the most low-maintenance black gemstones you can wear daily. Unlike obsidian, it is a true mineral crystal"]')
) AS src(slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url, payload)) AS parsed
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, price=EXCLUDED.price, currency=EXCLUDED.currency,
  brand=EXCLUDED.brand, merchant=EXCLUDED.merchant, category=EXCLUDED.category, department=EXCLUDED.department,
  product_type=EXCLUDED.product_type, image_url=EXCLUDED.image_url, affiliate_url=EXCLUDED.affiliate_url,
  description=EXCLUDED.description, source_data=EXCLUDED.source_data;
INSERT INTO awin_catalog_products
  (slug, name, price, currency, brand, merchant, category, department, product_type, image_url, affiliate_url, description, source_data)
SELECT slug, data->>'product_name', (data->>'search_price')::numeric, data->>'currency', brand,
  data->>'merchant_name', data->>'category_name', department, product_type, image_url,
  data->>'aw_deep_link', data->>'description', data
FROM (SELECT slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url,
  to_jsonb(jsonb_object(ARRAY['product_name','search_price','currency','merchant_name','category_name','aw_deep_link','description'], ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(payload::jsonb)))) AS data FROM (VALUES
