('awin-fang-accessories-braided-tiger-eye-bracelet-set-adjustable-stacking-jewelry-128369-46583571557','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Braided Tiger Eye Bracelet Set - Adjustable Stacking Jewelry","59","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46583571557&a=2893129&m=128369","The Story Behind the Stones Tiger’s eye has been worn for centuries as a talisman of courage and protection. Roman soldiers carried it into battle, believing its golden bands held the strength of the tiger itself . This handmade tiger eye braided bracelet for women carries that legacy forward—each bead polished to reveal its signature chatoyancy, the shifting streak of light that looks like a watching eye. Paired with a sleek 18k gold plated stainless steel bracelet, this set balances earthy war"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-crystal-fish-pendant-necklace-128369-45419416647','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Crystal Fish Pendant Necklace","59","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45419416647&a=2893129&m=128369","There are moments in life when you feel stuck — when the current seems to flow against you, and the path forward feels unclear. This Crystal Fish Pendant Necklace was created for those moments. It is a reminder that you are not meant to swim against the tide, but to move with it, gracefully and intentionally. At the heart of this necklace lies a delicately carved fish pendant — an ancient symbol of flow, adaptability, and spiritual transformation. In metaphysical traditions, the fish glides thro"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-double-layer-red-agate-bracelet-healing-energy-protection-128369-45419416668','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Double-Layer Red Agate Bracelet – Healing Energy & Protection","66","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45419416668&a=2893129&m=128369","In jewelry history, red agate appears in signet rings and cameo pieces, valued for its warm color and carving quality. The double-wrap design reads like two parallel paths—one for routine, one for the road ahead. Understated, but with depth. Design Highlights Double-strand wrap with 8mm natural red agate beads, round and full-bodied Stretch cord, no clasp—easy to put on and comfortable for daily wear A warm, restrained red that works as a subtle wrist accent Strong layered look: substantial alon"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-elegant-amethyst-grape-cluster-earrings-healing-energy-timeless-style-128369-45419416674','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Elegant Amethyst Grape Cluster Earrings: Healing Energy & Timeless Style","49","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45419416674&a=2893129&m=128369","Size: 3.5cm/1.38in Material: Amethyst, Copper, Silver Ear Wires Product Description: Adorn your ears with the enchanting beauty of our Amethyst Grape Cluster Earrings, a masterpiece that blends natural elegance with artisanal craftsmanship. This stunning piece features a lush, dangling cluster of delicate faceted amethyst stones, meticulously arranged to mimic a ripe bunch of glistening purple grapes. Each tiny amethyst grape catches the light, offering a mesmerizing dance of violet and lavender"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-flower-tassel-beaded-earrings-handmade-jewelry-128369-45419416671','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Flower Tassel Beaded Earrings Handmade Jewelry","59","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45419416671&a=2893129&m=128369","Product Description Make every head turn with our Flower Tassel Beaded Earrings – a fusion of floral elegance and playful tassel movement. Handcrafted with high-quality nature shell beads, these bohemian drop earrings add color, rhythm, and artisanal charm to any outfit. Handmade with care – Each pair is beaded by skilled artisans. Premium materials – Nature shell beads + copper. Silver Needle. Lightweight & comfortable – No heavy pulling on earlobes. Hypoallergenic hardware – Eco Copper with18K"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-forest-walk-earrings-set-where-nature-meets-elegance-128369-45419416659','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Forest Walk Earrings Set – Where Nature Meets Elegance","59","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45419416659&a=2893129&m=128369","The Story Behind the Design Every autumn, I take long walks through the whispering woods near my home. The forest floor is a tapestry of golden leaves, curled petals, and gentle streams carving wavy paths through the earth. That’s where the inspiration for this earring set was born – three delicate motifs that capture the quiet poetry of the season: a blooming flower, a drifting leaf, and a flowing wave. Each piece tells a part of nature’s story. The flower represents resilience – the last bloom"]'),
