('awin-fang-accessories-hand-knotted-long-malachite-necklace-128369-46248178108','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Hand-Knotted Long Malachite Necklace","59","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46248178108&a=2893129&m=128369","Malachite Necklace Description The Stone That Writes Its Own Story Every malachite stone carries a story written in layers. Formed through centuries of copper-rich sediment settling in rhythm, each band of green tells a tale of patience, transformation, and time itself. No two stones are ever alike — and that is precisely the point. This hand-knotted malachite long sweater necklace is not mass-produced. It is a singular piece shaped by nature''s hand, then shaped again by ours. Hand-Knotted, Not "]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-handcrafted-gemstone-woven-lace-earrings-128369-46405895416','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Handcrafted Gemstone Woven Lace Earrings","109","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46405895416&a=2893129&m=128369","Some jewelry is made. These woven lace earrings are remembered into form. Each pair begins at a single thread of tatting lace, guided by hand through loop after loop until a lace structure emerges that no machine can replicate. At the center sits cordierite—known in the gem world as iolite, the “Viking’s Compass.” Legend holds that Norse seafarers used thin slices of iolite to locate the sun through cloud and haze, an inner compass for journeys both outer and inward. To wear these handmade lace "]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-handcrafted-malachite-layered-necklace-set-128369-46289559316','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Handcrafted Malachite Layered Necklace Set","99","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46289559316&a=2893129&m=128369","Malachite Layered Necklace Set Description Deep in the copper-rich mountains where ancient Egyptian miners once carved protective amulets from vivid green stone, malachite has been treasured for over 5,000 years as the stone of transformation. Ancient Greeks placed it beneath their pillows to invite peaceful dreams. In Egyptian mythology, the \"Fields of Malachite\" represented an eternal paradise where pain and suffering ceased to exist. Today, we carry that legacy forward in a handcrafted malach"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-handcrafted-nature-stone-necklace-for-inner-peace-the-butterfly-the-tide-128369-45575986455','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Handcrafted Nature Stone Necklace for Inner Peace｜The Butterfly & The Tide","59","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45575986455&a=2893129&m=128369","The Story Begins There is a legend whispered among coastal villages that the sea remembers every soul it has touched. When a moment of profound peace is reached—a letting go, a release—the ocean transforms that emotion into a single blue stone, polished by tides over millennia. This nature stone necklace is born from that legend. Each Blue Spot Jasper and Aquamarine bead carries a fragment of that ancient calm, while the titanium steel butterfly pendant represents the soul''s quiet metamorphosis—"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-handmade-beaded-black-spinel-necklace-layering-set-128369-46668109587','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Handmade Beaded Black Spinel Necklace Layering Set","59","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46668109587&a=2893129&m=128369","There is a quiet confidence in black. Not the loudness of bright color, but the depth of something that knows itself. This handmade black spinel beaded necklace layering set was born from that idea—three distinct strands, each with its own rhythm, designed to be worn together or apart. Black spinel is often mistaken for black diamond, yet it carries a subtler, glass-like brilliance that catches light without shouting . Each bead is faceted by hand, strung with intention, and finished with metal "]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-handmade-garnet-bracelet-woven-gemstone-jewelry-128369-46337234979','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Handmade Garnet Bracelet — Woven Gemstone Jewelry","89","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46337234979&a=2893129&m=128369","Product Description Legend tells us that Noah used a garnet lantern to guide his ark through stormy nights at sea. The word \"garnet\" itself comes from the Latin granatus, meaning \"seed\" — named after the pomegranate seeds that ancient miners thought these deep-red gems resembled. Throughout history, garnet has been cherished as a stone of protection, love, and safe return. In Victorian times, it was given as a token of eternal fidelity. Today, this handmade garnet bracelet carries that same time"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-handmade-gemstone-necklace-the-sunlit-meadow-dream-128369-45813187081','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Handmade Gemstone Necklace -- The Sunlit Meadow Dream","59","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45813187081&a=2893129&m=128369","There is a quiet kind of magic in stones that have traveled through the earth for centuries—and in the hands of an artisan, they become something more than jewelry. They become talismans. Introducing the handmade gemstone necklace woven in the spirit of French country romance. At its heart rests a sunburst titanium steel charm—a tiny golden sun catching the light like morning breaking over a field. Below it, hand-selected Amazonite and Picture Jasper beads dance along the chain, each one unique,"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-handmade-natural-multi-gemstone-beaded-bracelet-necklace-set-128369-45419416660','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Handmade Natural Multi-Gemstone Beaded Bracelet & Necklace Set","89","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45419416660&a=2893129&m=128369","Handcrafted Gemstone Jewelry Set Embrace the cozy elegance of autumn and winter with our Handmade Natural Multi-Gemstone Beaded Set. Each piece is meticulously hand-strung using a curated blend of genuine gemstones – including Tiger''s Eye, Dalmatian Jasper, Egg Yolk Agate, Red Agate. The warm earthy tones and subtle sparkle make this bracelet and necklace set your go-to accessory for chilly days. Whether you’re a crystal lover or simply adore artisan jewelry, this set brings nature’s beauty to y"]'),
('awin-fang-accessories-handmade-natural-stone-necklace-layering-set-with-leaf-charm-128369-45940172508','Fang Accessories','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://images2.productserve.com/noimage.gif','["Handmade Natural Stone Necklace Layering Set with Leaf Charm","99","AUD","Fang Accessories","Women''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=45940172508&a=2893129&m=128369","The Story Behind the Set There are mornings when you wake up and feel the world asking too much of you. Your shoulders carry more than they should. Your voice wavers when it needs to be steady. And somewhere between the coffee and the commute, you forget who you are. This necklace set was born from that feeling — and from the belief that jewelry can be more than decoration. It can be armor. It can be medicine. It can be the quiet reminder that you are enough, exactly as you are. We designed this"]'),
