('awin-fun-fact-co-talon-of-knowledge-pin-114020-40785221058','Fun Fact Co.','education','learning-games','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0650/5080/4470/files/talon-pin-main.jpg?v=1694798208','["Talon Of Knowledge Pin","15","USD","Fun Fact Co.","Games, Puzzles & Learning","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=40785221058&a=2893129&m=114020","This darling metal pin will make you look both stylish and mentally intimidating. Made of bronze, this pin is in the shape of a falcon''s claws (known to many as their talons) and can be affixed to anything you can stick a needle through. Set on a cute and colorful 2\" card, you''ll get to read the full backstory of the Talon Of Knowledge pin and retell it to your hearts content. The pin itself measures 1.5\" in length (or 3.6cm for our metric friends)."]'),
('awin-fun-fact-co-the-party-mix-trivia-card-game-114020-40785220983','Fun Fact Co.','education','learning-games','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0650/5080/4470/files/Fun-Fact-Co-Party-Mix-Studio-Shoot-Print-Res-18.jpg?v=1723233842','["The Party Mix Trivia Card Game","29.99","USD","Fun Fact Co.","Games, Puzzles & Learning","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=40785220983&a=2893129&m=114020","The PARTY MIX is an eccentric trivia card game packed with fun fact questions about our world. Covering a party mix of topics like death, animals, space, numbers and more, the prompts are humorous, surprising and educational! The game uses a multiple choice or true/false format for the fun fact trivia so you always have a change of getting one right. It is outlandish and though-provoking, but suitable for kids and perfect for game nights."]'),
('awin-fun-fact-co-thinking-cap-114020-40785221057','Fun Fact Co.','education','learning-games','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0650/5080/4470/files/corduroy-hat-oxford-navy-front-6509e707cc5a3.jpg?v=1695147789','["Thinking Cap","35","USD","Fun Fact Co.","Games, Puzzles & Learning","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=40785221057&a=2893129&m=114020","Show off your inner-cheese with the Thinking Cap. A dad joke embodied in a classic hat. Featuring navy blue corduroy and white embroidery. Wearers off this hat might enjoy immediate validation of their smarts."]'),
('awin-fun-fact-co-veggie-fun-facts-print-114020-40785221044','Fun Fact Co.','home-decor','decor-accents','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0650/5080/4470/files/veggie-fun-facts-print-unframed.jpg?v=1689343091','["Veggie Fun Facts Print","35.99","USD","Fun Fact Co.","Decorations","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=40785221044&a=2893129&m=114020","Nutritious and (depending on the palate) delicious, you''ll love our vibrant and contemporary Veggie Fun Facts Print. Bursting with colorful yellow, pink, and lavender hues, this captivating poster is a kaleidoscope of fascinating information about 10 of nature''s most remarkable vegetables. Perfect for adding that visual nutrition to kitchens or bedrooms anywhere."]'),
