('awin-fun-fact-co-would-you-rather-from-history-card-game-114020-40785221131','Fun Fact Co.','education','learning-games','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0650/5080/4470/files/Would-You-Rather-Game-framed.jpg?v=1709053054','["Would You Rather (From History) Card Game","29.99","USD","Fun Fact Co.","Games, Puzzles & Learning","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=40785221131&a=2893129&m=114020","Would You Rather is an \"either or\" scenario game that presents different events from history and challenges players to decide what THEY would do. Learn more about your friends and family AND about history with this delightful exposé on some of history''s most intriguing happenings.. Read the short historical story then ask the corresponding question. Will you choose to discover the cause of your own mysterious fate, or ponder whether you''d be better off living with chimpanzees or in a friendly wo"]'),
('awin-grabo-erguo-s1-ergonomic-extension-arm-129497-46235517323','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/ERG1-1-1.png','["ERGUO S1 Ergonomic Extension Arm","59.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517323&a=2893129&m=129497","This is a third-party accessory made for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. Stop bending over to place a tile. The ERGUO S1 is an extension arm that turns a compatible GRABO gripper into a stand-up tool, raising the working height so your back stays straight through a full day of flooring, paving or panel work. It clamps to the tool and gives you a long, rigid reach, which means the vacuum lifter goes down to the floor and you do not. On repetitive installs, where "]'),
('awin-grabo-erguo-s2-extension-arm-with-handlebar-controls-129497-46235517288','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ERGUO-S2-Thumbnail-1.png','["ERGUO S2 Extension Arm with Handlebar Controls","99.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517288&a=2893129&m=129497","This is a third-party accessory made for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. The GRABO ERGUO S2 combines two upgrades in one: a versatile attachment plate that lets you mount almost anything to your GRABO, and a long extension arm with the controls built into the handlebar. Together they let you run the vacuum gripster from standing height, without bending down to touch the tool at all. Four quick-lock pins snap the plate onto a NEMO GRABO, GRABO PRO or GRABO PRO BR"]'),
('awin-grabo-erguo-t-extension-arm-129497-46680067235','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/thumbnail-1.png','["ERGUO T Extension Arm","199.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46680067235&a=2893129&m=129497","This is a third-party accessory made for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. With the GRABO ERGUO T handle, you can finally use the full potential of the GRABO''s vacuum power. Use this extension handle for vacuum gripsters with your team members to safely lift up to 375 lbs of heavy material! The ERGUO T handle is compatible with: NEMO GRABO THE GRABO PRO GRABO HIGH FLOW (with wired remote included) Attach to the GRABO tool via the GRABO''s metal anchor points. There"]'),
('awin-grabo-grabo-14-8v-2600mah-li-ion-battery-129497-46235517316','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/thumbnail-1.png','["GRABO 14.8V 2600mAh Li-Ion Battery","29.99","USD","GRABO","Power Tools","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517316&a=2893129&m=129497","This is a replacement battery for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. A spare battery is what keeps a vacuum gripper working through the afternoon instead of sitting on the tailgate. This 14.8V lithium-ion pack is the official replacement for the Nemo GRABO and the GRABO PRO Lifter 20. The 4-cell, 2600mAh pack gives roughly 1.5 hours of runtime and charges in about 2 hours, so one on the tool and one on the charger covers a full shift on either suction gripster. Wor"]'),
('awin-grabo-grabo-90-degree-seam-setter-for-stone-countertops-129497-46235517319','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/thumbnail-8-1.png','["GRABO 90 Degree Seam Setter for Stone Countertops","149.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517319&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. The GRABO 90 Degree Seam Setter brings two pieces together at a true right angle and holds them there while you set the joint. It works on porous and non-porous surfaces alike, which is what separates a setter built around a vacuum gripper from a plain suction cup. Kitchen islands, countertop returns, shower corners and large-format walls are the everyday jobs for it. Granite, stone, marble, metal and simi"]'),
('awin-grabo-grabo-90-degree-seam-setter-v2-right-angle-jig-129497-46235517289','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/90SeamSetterThumbnail-1-1.png','["GRABO 90 Degree Seam Setter V2 Right Angle Jig","149.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517289&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. The GRABO 90 Degree Seam Setter V2 turns a pair of GRABO tools into a right-angle clamping system. Grip both faces, bring them together, and set granite, marble, tile, stone, wood or metal at a precise level and angle without a second person holding anything. Six 5mm bolts lock the setter into the metal anchor points on the base plate of each GRABO gripper, and eight 4mm bolts secure the angle joint. The r"]'),
('awin-grabo-grabo-attachment-plate-with-threaded-mount-129497-46235517287','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/AttachmentPlateThumbnail.png','["GRABO Attachment Plate with Threaded Mount","59.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517287&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. The GRABO ATTACHMENT PLATE locks into the four metal anchor points on your tool and adds a mounting surface with multiple threaded ports. Lights, cameras, phones, laser levels, microphones and more all bolt straight on. The trick is what the tool does underneath. Stick the vacuum gripper to a wall, a window, a vehicle panel or a sheet of glass, and whatever you mounted stays exactly there, hands free. A su"]'),
('awin-grabo-grabo-bore-mount-core-drill-holder-two-cup-129497-46235517271','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Bore-Mount-Thumbnail.png','["GRABO Bore Mount Core Drill Holder, Two-Cup","149.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517271&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. Drilling into concrete or stone usually means fighting the drill. The GRABO BORE MOUNT removes that fight: a heavy-duty plate that takes two GRABO tools on the outside and a core drill or drill press bolted in the center. Engage both suction grippers and the whole rig locks onto hard, dense material, concrete, stone or metal, holding your drill square and steady while you bore. No pushing, no walking bit, "]'),
