('awin-grabo-grabo-canvas-carry-bag-129497-46235517325','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/thumbnail-4-scaled.png','["GRABO Canvas Carry Bag","19.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517325&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. The GRABO Canvas Bag is the heavy-duty replacement for the bag your tool shipped in. Double zipper closures and multiple compartments keep the suction gripper, its battery, charger, spare seals and filters together and organized rather than loose in a truck bed. It is built for the same treatment the tool gets. Canvas takes jobsite abuse, and the internal compartments mean a foam seal is not sitting under "]'),
('awin-grabo-grabo-foam-rubber-seal-type-a1-universal-fit-129497-46235517326','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/12/thumbnail-2-1.png','["GRABO Foam Rubber Seal Type A1, Universal Fit","24.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517326&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. The Foam-Rubber Seal Type A1 is the reason a GRABO grips material other suction cups will not touch. This patented, high-friction, closed-cell rubber gasket conforms to heavily textured surfaces and holds a tight vacuum where a rigid cup would simply leak. It fits every GRABO model, keeps dust and debris out of the tool, and is what turns a standard suction gripper into a lifter that works on real jobsite "]'),
('awin-grabo-grabo-highflow-1500mm-wired-remote-cable-129497-46235517292','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/1500mm-wired-cable-thumbnail-1.png','["GRABO HighFlow 1500mm Wired Remote Cable","19.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517292&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. Run your GRABO HIGH FLOW without keeping a hand on the tool. This 1500mm wired remote plugs into the control port on the gripper and puts ON and OFF at the end of a cable, so the vacuum lifter can stay down on the material while you stand upright and work. The extra length is the whole point. At 1500mm the cable comfortably reaches the grips of the ERGUO T bar and the PROBST DUO handles, which the shorter "]'),
('awin-grabo-grabo-highflow-20v-5-2ah-li-ion-battery-129497-46235517310','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/20V-BATTERY_THUMBNAIL-scaled-1.png','["GRABO HighFlow 20V 5.2Ah Li-Ion Battery","99.99","USD","GRABO","Power Tools","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517310&a=2893129&m=129497","This is a replacement battery for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. The official 20V (18V EU) 5.2Ah pack for the GRABO HIGH FLOW, the biggest battery in the range because the HIGH FLOW is the hungriest vacuum gripper in it. Moving 1.5 cubic meters of air per minute takes real current, and the 5.2Ah cell is sized to keep that suction gripster running through a paving shift rather than an hour of it. One pack ships with the tool. A second is what stops the afternoon"]'),
