('awin-grabo-grabo-highflow-850mm-wired-remote-cable-129497-46235517293','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/850mm-wired-cable-thumbnail-1.png','["GRABO HighFlow 850mm Wired Remote Cable","14.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517293&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. Keep both hands on the job and leave the GRABO HIGH FLOW to hold the load. The 850mm wired remote connects to the control port on the tool and switches the suction gripper on and off from the end of a cable, so you are not reaching across a paver every time you want to release. Strap it to the included T-Bar handle, or to any official or third-party attachment, with the supplied rubber strap. This is the s"]'),
