('awin-grabo-grabo-highflow-suction-plate-400-16x16in-242-lb-129497-46235517303','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Suction-Plate-400-Thumbnail-1.png','["GRABO HighFlow Suction Plate 400, 16x16in, 242 lb","69.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517303&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. The 400mm (16in x 16in) suction plate for the GRABO HIGH FLOW, and the single biggest capacity upgrade available for the tool. Four quick-lock pins attach it in seconds. The larger surface area lifts rated capacity from the 300mm plate''s 150 lbs (68 kg) up to 242 lbs (110 kg), which is what large, heavy, flat and extremely porous pavers need. Built for professionals who bought a powerful suction gripper an"]'),
