('awin-grabo-grabo-highflow-wireless-remote-keyfob-30m-range-129497-46235517294','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/GHF-Remote-Thumbnail-1.png','["GRABO HighFlow Wireless Remote Keyfob, 30m Range","24.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517294&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. Control your GRABO HIGH FLOW from up to 30 meters away. The wireless receiver plugs into the control port on the tool and the keyfob handles ON and OFF from a distance, so you never need a hand on the suction gripper to run it. That single change opens up work a handheld tool cannot do: hang the HIGH FLOW from a crane, an excavator or any lift system, grip a porous paver, move it into place and release it,"]'),
('awin-grabo-grabo-impact-plate-hammer-shield-129497-46235517285','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Impact-Plate-Thumbnail-2.png','["GRABO Impact Plate Hammer Shield","24.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517285&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. Sometimes the tile does not want to move. The GRABO IMPACT PLATE is a thick, impact-resistant metal bracket that mounts to the four anchor points on your tool and gives you something safe to hit. Stuck tile, bedded stone and pavers set in thinset, glue or cement usually need a shock to break loose. Without a shield that means striking the suction gripper itself and destroying it. With one, you hammer the p"]'),
