('awin-grabo-grabo-panel-pro-kit-with-2-grabo-v2-gripsters-6-cup-vacuum-lifter-440-lb-129497-46235517277','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Panel-Pro-Thumbnail-scaled-1.png','["GRABO Panel Pro Kit with 2 GRABO V2 Gripsters, 6 Cup Vacuum Lifter 440 lb","1399.99","USD","GRABO","Power Tools","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517277&a=2893129&m=129497","Everything in one box: the PANEL PRO modular rail system plus two GRABO V2 tools , ready to lift large, heavy and fragile panels straight out of the crate. The two suction grippers generate vacuum across a network of six high-strength rubber suction cups spaced along the rail. The result is a balanced, evenly distributed hold that keeps material flat and stable in transit, which is what stops a big panel flexing, cracking or dropping. The rail is modular, so it adapts to different panel sizes, a"]'),
