('awin-grabo-grabo-smart-cut-foam-seal-300-for-textured-pavers-150-lb-129497-46235517307','GRABO','home-garden','home-essentials','https://order.grabo.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thumbnail-3-scaled-1.png','["GRABO Smart Cut Foam Seal 300 for Textured Pavers, 150 lb","29.99","USD","GRABO","DIY","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46235517307&a=2893129&m=129497","This is an accessory for GRABO suction gripsters. It is not a suction gripster on its own. The SMART CUT 300mm (12in x 12in) foam seal for the GRABO HIGH FLOW Suction Plate 300, precision cut for the worst surfaces on site. The cut pattern is what separates it from the standard pad. On extremely porous and extremely textured pavers, deep grooves and open aggregate let air escape faster than a plain seal can cope with. The SMART CUT channels direct that flow so the suction gripper keeps a working"]'),
