('awin-hatton-labs-18k-gold-diamond-cut-belcher-bracelet-61197-36686024755','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/p2159130_725871_1_63d148c91b07d_40977f2a-8f75-46e3-90b4-86efbf18521f.jpg?v=1706603470','["18K Gold Diamond Cut Belcher Bracelet","99.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=36686024755&a=2893129&m=61197","This 18K gold-plated sterling silver bracelet is a timeless staple piece perfect for elevated everyday wear. Crafted from solid 925 sterling silver, it features a diamond-cut belcher chain. The bracelet has a secure fastening and comes with a Hatton Labs tag. It is also coated with an anti-tarnish finish to keep it looking its best.The belcher chain is a classic chain style that has been around for centuries. It is named after the English goldsmith, Henry Belcher, who is credited with popularisi"]'),
