('awin-knitfirst-extra-large-faux-sheepskin-fur-rug-126357-44981267535','knitfirst','home-decor','home-textiles','https://knitfirst.com/cdn/shop/products/extra-large-faux-sheepskin-fur-rug-9706738.jpg?v=1752421702','["Extra Large Faux Sheepskin Fur Rug","249.99","USD","knitfirst","Home Textiles","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=44981267535&a=2893129&m=126357","Let your feet sink into a velvet cloud with this extra large faux sheepskin fur rug. The ultra-soft faux fur adds cozy comfort and style to living rooms, bedrooms, and lounge spaces. A non-slip backing helps the rug stay in place, while easy-care maintenance makes it suitable for busy homes. Available in multiple colors and sizes, including large statement sizes for spacious rooms."]'),
('awin-knitfirst-faux-wool-plush-rug-soft-shaggy-carpet-for-home-floor-area-decoration-126357-44981212286','knitfirst','home-decor','home-textiles','https://knitfirst.com/cdn/shop/files/faux-wool-plush-rug-main.jpg','["Faux Wool Plush Rug – Soft Shaggy Carpet for Home Floor Area Decoration","69.99","USD","knitfirst","Home Textiles","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=44981212286&a=2893129&m=126357","Premium faux wool plush rug with luxurious soft texture underfoot. Made from high-quality eco-friendly faux wool that delivers cozy comfort and durability. Ideal for living rooms, bedrooms, dining areas, and other home spaces. Non-slip backing keeps it in place, while easy care features make it a practical choice for busy households."]'),
('awin-le-gramme-1-7g-polished-brushed-black-ceramic-cord-bracelet-61197-36686024770','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/1.7g_Polished_Brushed_Black_Ceramic_Cord_Bracelet.jpg?v=1728310497','["1.7g Polished & Brushed Black Ceramic Cord Bracelet","229.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=36686024770&a=2893129&m=61197","Crafted from high-quality ceramic, the Le Gramme 1.7G Ceramic Bracelet combines a sleek and lightweight design with remarkable durability. The ceramic material provides a lustrous finish that effortlessly complements any attire, making it a versatile accessory for both casual and formal occasions.. The bracelet features a unique, minimalist aesthetic that embodies Le Gramme''s signature style. Its clean lines and refined simplicity create a timeless piece that transcends fleeting trends, allowing"]')
) AS src(slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url, payload)) AS parsed
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET name=EXCLUDED.name, price=EXCLUDED.price, currency=EXCLUDED.currency,
  brand=EXCLUDED.brand, merchant=EXCLUDED.merchant, category=EXCLUDED.category, department=EXCLUDED.department,
  product_type=EXCLUDED.product_type, image_url=EXCLUDED.image_url, affiliate_url=EXCLUDED.affiliate_url,
  description=EXCLUDED.description, source_data=EXCLUDED.source_data;
INSERT INTO awin_catalog_products
  (slug, name, price, currency, brand, merchant, category, department, product_type, image_url, affiliate_url, description, source_data)
SELECT slug, data->>'product_name', (data->>'search_price')::numeric, data->>'currency', brand,
  data->>'merchant_name', data->>'category_name', department, product_type, image_url,
  data->>'aw_deep_link', data->>'description', data
FROM (SELECT slug, brand, department, product_type, image_url,
  to_jsonb(jsonb_object(ARRAY['product_name','search_price','currency','merchant_name','category_name','aw_deep_link','description'], ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(payload::jsonb)))) AS data FROM (VALUES
('awin-le-gramme-1-7g-polished-brushed-sterling-silver-cord-bracelet-61197-36686024718','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/1.7g_Polished_Brushed_Sterling_Silver_Navy_Cord_Bracelet.jpg?v=1728309155','["1.7g Polished & Brushed Sterling Silver Cord Bracelet","149.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=36686024718&a=2893129&m=61197","The 1.7g Le Gramme Sterling Silver Cord Bracelet is perfect for everyday wear. Drawing from an industrial design influence, the main piece is made from high-quality sterling silver and sports a cut-out design with the logo embossed. The adjustable polyester bracelet comes in three colours to accent your style.. 925 Sterling Silver. Made in France. Made From Recycled Metals. Adjustable - Suits all Sizes. Lifetime Warranty"]'),
('awin-le-gramme-11g-polished-sterling-silver-cable-bracelet-61197-40979678346','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/11g_Polished_Sterling_Silver_Cable_Bracelet.jpg?v=1728306078','["11g Polished Sterling Silver Cable Bracelet","329.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=40979678346&a=2893129&m=61197","The 11g Le Gramme Polished Sterling Silver Cable Bracelet is perfect for everyday wear. Drawing from an industrial design influence, it is made from high-quality sterling silver and has a polished finish that gives it a shiny and polished appearance. The bracelet features a chain design that adds a touch of texture to the overall look.. 925 Sterling Silver. Made in France. Lifetime Warranty"]'),
('awin-le-gramme-13g-brushed-sterling-silver-7-beads-cord-bracelet-61197-41006055269','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/lg_carbrcno7b091_13_1.jpg?v=1730558982','["13g Brushed Sterling Silver 7 Beads Cord Bracelet","229.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=41006055269&a=2893129&m=61197","Minimalist elegance meets refined craftsmanship in this 13g cord bracelet from Le Gramme. Featuring seven solid sterling silver beads with a satin-brushed finish, the bracelet balances modern sophistication with a tactile, architectural appeal. Each bead is meticulously crafted, strung together on a durable, adjustable black cord, offering both comfort and versatility for daily wear.. True to Le Gramme’s design philosophy, this piece expresses identity through simplicity, weight, and material. W"]'),
('awin-le-gramme-15g-brushed-black-sterling-silver-ribbon-bracelet-61197-36686024692','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/15g_Brushed_Black_Sterling_Silver_Ribbon_Bracelet.jpg?v=1728304948','["15g Brushed Black Sterling Silver Ribbon Bracelet","399.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=36686024692&a=2893129&m=61197","The Le Gramme 15g Brushed Black Sterling Silver Ribbon Bracelet is a stylish and sophisticated accessory that is perfect for any occasion. The bracelet is made from brushed black sterling silver, which gives it a sleek and modern look. The ribbon design of the bracelet is both unique and elegant, and the bracelet is lightweight and comfortable to wear.. 925 Sterling Silver. Made in France. Lifetime Warranty"]'),
('awin-le-gramme-15g-brushed-sterling-silver-ribbon-bracelet-61197-37646542896','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/15g_Brushed_Sterling_Silver_Ribbon_Bracelet.jpg?v=1728303778','["15g Brushed Sterling Silver Ribbon Bracelet","339.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37646542896&a=2893129&m=61197","The Le Gramme 15g Brushed Sterling Silver Ribbon Bracelet is an elegant piece of jewellery made from high-quality 925 sterling silver. The bracelet features a ribbon-like design that is brushed to give it a matte finish. It is a timeless and sophisticated piece that is sure to make a statement wherever it is worn.. 925 Sterling Silver. Made in France. Lifetime Warranty"]'),
