('awin-le-gramme-1g-polished-entrelacs-necklace-61197-36686024844','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/06_LG_CARPOFM081_01_0468.jpg?v=1698958275','["1g Polished Entrelacs Necklace","239.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=36686024844&a=2893129&m=61197","Carefully crafted from quality sterling silver, the Le Gramme 1g Polished Entrelacs necklace showcases a captivating entrelacs pattern. Offering an alluring visual effect, the interlocking loops symbolise unity, harmony, and the eternal nature of human connections. With a polished finish, it exudes a radiant glow that catches the light with every movement. Lightweight and comfortable, the necklace weighs only 3 grams.. Made in France. Made From Precious Metals. Hallmarked. Lifetime Warranty"]'),
