('awin-maple-bone-ring-61197-40210766775','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/bonering.jpg?v=1731253151','["Bone Ring","129.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=40210766775&a=2893129&m=61197","MAPLE''s Bone Ring is an audacious statement aptly named for its unique design elements that mimic skeletal forms, wrapping seamlessly around the finger. Its sculptural silhouette is both daring and elegant, with a polished finish that accentuates its undulating contours. The dual bone-shaped ends give the impression of a skeletal embrace, making it an instant conversation starter.. 925 Sterling Silver. MAPLE Branding & Hallmarking"]'),
('awin-maple-chalice-ring-61197-37335771645','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/MAPLE-Chalice-Ring-Silver-1.jpg?v=1752351047','["Chalice Ring","209.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771645&a=2893129&m=61197","Crafted from high-quality sterling silver, the Chalice Ring''s design features a series of interconnected panels, each with a distinct, hammered texture that catches the light to reveal the depth and intricacy of its surface. The ring is an embodiment of MAPLE''s dedication to creating pieces that are as unique as they are elegant.. 925 Sterling Silver. MAPLE Branding & Hallmarking"]'),
('awin-maple-cross-ring-61197-37335771641','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/MAPLE-Cross-Ring-Silver-3.jpg?v=1706479880','["Cross Ring","159.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771641&a=2893129&m=61197","MAPLE continue its tradition of exceptional craftsmanship and distinctive design with the Cross Ring, a piece that balances edge and elegance with its striking form. Forged from the finest sterling silver, the ring is a masterclass in the brand''s ability to transform traditional symbols into modern sartorial statements. The ring features a continuous pattern of interlocking crosses, each detailed with a subtle texture that gives the piece a rugged yet refined appearance. The design is evocative,"]'),
('awin-maple-duppy-signet-ring-61197-37335771646','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/Maple-Duppy-Signet-Ring-Silver-Abalone-1.jpg?v=1706479894','["Duppy Signet Ring","169.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771646&a=2893129&m=61197","MAPLE''s Duppy Signet Ring is an exquisite fusion of traditional craftsmanship and natural allure. Cast from lustrous sterling silver, this signet ring is a modern take on a classic design, enhanced by the captivating iridescence of abalone shell.. The ring''s face is inlaid with a carefully selected piece of abalone, known for its rich play of color and oceanic patterns. The deep blues, greens, and purples swirl within the shell''s surface, creating a mesmerizing effect that changes with the light"]'),
('awin-maple-freaky-tails-chain-61197-37335771666','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/MAPLE-Freaky-Tails-Pendant-Silver-1.jpg?v=1706479915','["Freaky Tails Chain","219.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771666&a=2893129&m=61197","MAPLE''s Freaky Tails Chain features a carefully crafted pendant with an intricate design that showcases two different figures, one on each side, offering a playful take on the classic concept of \"heads or tails.\" The pendant is strung on a robust sterling silver chain with a detailed link structure. Forged from premium sterling silver, this necklace is a testament to the brand''s eye for detail and commitment to quality.. 925 Sterling Silver. 23\" Length. MAPLE Branding & Hallmarking"]'),
('awin-maple-hempstar-bangle-61197-37335771659','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/MAPLE-HEMPSTAR-BANGLE-SILVER-925-1_2048x2048_2dcac1d1-9b03-4e69-be47-9a149ce1324a.jpg?v=1706479929','["Hempstar Bangle","259.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771659&a=2893129&m=61197","The MAPLE Hempstar Bangle is a statement of the brand''s commitment to creating pieces that are both fashion-forward and deeply rooted in cultural symbolism. The bangle''s minimalist open cuff design is punctuated by the iconic hemp leaf motif, which symbolizes a counterculture vibe.. 925 Sterling Silver. MAPLE Branding & Hallmarking"]'),
('awin-maple-julian-chain-61197-37335771664','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/Maple-Julian-Chain-Silver-1.jpg?v=1706479950','["Julian Chain","129.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771664&a=2893129&m=61197","Constructed from sterling silver, the Julian chain exemplifies MAPLE''s commitment to combining classic style with a touch of modern sophistication. The sterling silver chain features a twisted rope design that exudes a rugged yet elegant charm, making it a versatile piece suitable for various occasions. The high-polish finish on the silver catches the light beautifully, ensuring that it stands out whether worn on its own or paired with other necklaces.. 925 Sterling Silver. 23\" Length"]'),
('awin-maple-mariner-chain-peace-wheel-61197-37335771667','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/MAPLE-Mariner-Chain-Wheel-Silver-925-1.jpg?v=1706479970','["Mariner Chain & Peace Wheel","309.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771667&a=2893129&m=61197","The MAPLE Mariner Chain and Wheel is a fusion of classic elegance and maritime charm. Expertly crafted with sterling silver and accented with 14K gold, this necklace showcases their commitment to high-quality materials and intricate design. A mariner link chain symbolises strength and steadfastness, a nod to seafaring heritage. The peace wheel pendant, accented with 14K gold, adds an element of luxury and curiosity to the piece.. 925 Sterling Silver & 14K Gold. 23\" Length"]'),
('awin-maple-psychotropic-class-ring-61197-37335771649','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/Maple-Psychotropic-Class-Ring-Silver-Emerald-2.jpg?v=1706480012','["Psychotropic Class Ring","299.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771649&a=2893129&m=61197","The Psychotropic Class Ring exemplifies MAPLE''s modern take on vintage class rings, featuring a hexagonal bezel setting that holds a vibrant colored stone. The ring''s face is etched with eye-catching lettering, framing the stone and adding an element of intrigue. The band, detailed with a subtle texture, contrasts beautifully with the polished stone setting. Whether you choose the deep green of the emerald or the rich blue of the sapphire, this ring is sure to be an eye-catcher. It''s perfect for"]'),
('awin-maple-scorpio-signet-ring-61197-37335771639','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/MAPLE-Scorpio-Signet-Ring-Silver-925-Zircon-1.jpg?v=1706480056','["Scorpio Signet Ring","179.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771639&a=2893129&m=61197","MAPLE''s Scorpio Signet Ring is a unique and daring piece, encapsulating the essence of the Scorpio spirit. This ring features an intricately designed Scorpio, showcasing a detailed body and tail that wrap around the finger, culminating in a captivating red zircon set as the creature''s eye. The ring''s oxidized finish brings out the depth and detail of the design, while the silver''s natural luster is maintained in other areas for a striking contrast.. 925 Sterling Silver. MAPLE Branding & Hallmark"]'),
('awin-maple-smiley-earrings-61197-37335771669','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/smileyearrings.jpg?v=1731270030','["Smiley Earrings","99.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771669&a=2893129&m=61197","MAPLE''s Smiley Earrings are a playful addition to any jewellery collection. These earrings are perfect for those who love to express their playful side through their accessories. The iconic smiley face is rendered in beautiful detail, with bright green enamel that stands out against the silver. These earrings are not just an accessory; they''re a statement of fun and positivity.. 925 Sterling Silver"]'),
('awin-maple-sunburst-chain-61197-37335771665','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/Maple-Sunburst-Chain-Silver-1.jpg?v=1706480107','["Sunburst Chain","239.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=37335771665&a=2893129&m=61197","The Sunburst Chain by MAPLE is an exceptional accessory that features a series of intricately detailed links, each one bearing a sunburst pattern that catches the light and the eye with its reflective surface. The delicate etchings on each link create a harmonious pattern reminiscent of the sun''s rays. The chain is versatile enough to be worn on its own, making a subtle yet impactful statement, or it can serve as a foundation for your favorite pendants, enhancing their appearance with its detail"]'),
('awin-maple-word-peace-ring-61197-38867808549','Stattics','jewelry','jewelry-sets','https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0554/6750/7789/files/Maple-Word-Peace-Ring-Silver-1.jpg?v=1726321624','["Word Peace Ring","139.00","GBP","Stattics","Men''s Jewellery","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=38867808549&a=2893129&m=61197","Crafted from premium sterling silver, the Maple Word Peace Ring is a bold statement piece that merges style and meaning. The design showcases the word \"PEACE\" carved in a vintage, playful font on the front, making it a timeless symbol of harmony and tranquility. Its sleek rectangular face and polished silver finish offer a modern yet timeless aesthetic.. 925 Sterling Silver"]'),
