('awin-rapidcore-bio-bacteriostatic-water-10ml-131929-46846989630','RapidCore Bio (US)','wellness','medical-supplies','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d24aed_089a17d46bc64eeb8f57d377c5ec2b68~mv2.png','["Bacteriostatic Water 10ml","9.00","USD","RapidCore Bio (US)","Medical","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46846989630&a=2893129&m=131929","Bacteriostatic Water is a sterile, non-pyrogenic solution containing a bacteriostatic agent to inhibit microbial growth. It is commonly utilized in laboratory settings for the reconstitution and dilution of research compounds, including lyophilized materials. This product is intended strictly for research purposes and is not for human consumption."]'),
('awin-rapidcore-bio-bpc-157-10mg-131929-46846989649','RapidCore Bio (US)','wellness','medical-supplies','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d24aed_8c9323904afd42908e5326bc1ece0dd5~mv2.png','["BPC-157 10mg","50.00","USD","RapidCore Bio (US)","Medical","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46846989649&a=2893129&m=131929","BPC-157 is a synthetic peptide studied for its role in cellular signaling and tissue-related pathways. It is commonly utilized in research exploring angiogenic mechanisms, cellular migration, and extracellular matrix interactions. This compound is intended strictly for laboratory research purposes and is not for human consumption."]'),
('awin-rapidcore-bio-cjc-1295-10mg-131929-46846989628','RapidCore Bio (US)','wellness','medical-supplies','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d24aed_6f0209d0fd384c8fb5d3b378b6c4433d~mv2.png','["CJC-1295 10mg","75.00","USD","RapidCore Bio (US)","Medical","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46846989628&a=2893129&m=131929","CJC-1295 is a synthetic growth hormone-releasing hormone analog studied for GHRH receptor signaling, growth-hormone and IGF-axis responses, and pharmacokinetic differences between long-acting and shorter-acting research constructs. This product is supplied strictly for research use only and is not intended for human or animal consumption, diagnosis, treatment, or therapeutic use."]'),
('awin-rapidcore-bio-epitalon-50mg-131929-46846989638','RapidCore Bio (US)','wellness','medical-supplies','https://static.wixstatic.com/media/d24aed_09220f4f8bcc4e919e65fe2ae626c995~mv2.png','["Epitalon 50mg","85.00","USD","RapidCore Bio (US)","Medical","https://www.awin1.com/pclick.php?p=46846989638&a=2893129&m=131929","Epitalon is a synthetic tetrapeptide studied for its potential role in cellular aging, telomere biology, circadian rhythm regulation, and overall longevity. Research interest focuses on its possible influence on telomerase activity, melatonin production, sleep patterns, cellular repair, and age-related biological processes. Although early laboratory findings are promising, Epitalon remains experimental, and its long-term effects and clinical benefits have not been established through large-scale"]'),
